c({id:"Alarm:3",text:"Audience\nAlarms are intended to be monitored by a Network Operations Center (NOC). NOC operators are monitoring many systems, and generally do not have detailed knowledge of each system.  The Alarm is simply to bring attention to a problem that a System Engineer will address.\n\nAs such, the alarm should have a short simple name, and just enough details in the note for System Engineer to narrow their search of the system and logs.",sourceId:"Alarm",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[0.032760408,-0.015746329,-0.058032036,-0.016117634,0.04788812,-0.02465314,0.12350072,-0.03691603,0.09698368,-0.09263615,0.0031492223,-0.016033547,0.0041477736,-0.022048302,-0.11081103,-0.08977679,0.084167294,-0.08967768,0.070025064,-0.041537844,-0.011322319,0.05246002,0.016125081,0.015524476,-0.092617355,-0.02370488,0.032984123,-0.022953521,-0.010506956,-0.06812962,0.015077793,0.014350008,0.122288354,0.025963575,0.018077796,-0.07683811,0.018433062,-0.018024728,-0.06756325,0.013581629,0.04065266,-0.031340793,-0.034266207,0.021279916,-0.0757348,-0.030019455,-0.038450062,-0.027556276,-0.038355026,0.012671858,-0.004707982,-0.041559465,0.009388921,-0.02881827,0.040592823,-0.03353691,-0.03571459,-0.044485606,0.006955797,0.07411039,-0.012195669,0.043621957,-0.007524205,0.05357181,0.046138447,0.08117877,-0.017226238,0.060459156,0.082490325,-0.08420952,-0.022518286,0.0018089638,0.1178242,0.01526187,-0.03713373,0.022595841,0.019221308,0.018579997,0.018767206,-0.038867958,-0.03598146,-0.011003211,-0.024705863,-0.02704745,0.035825368,-0.005553672,-0.053681336,0.0053324355,0.023397591,0.006544083,-0.09074635,-0.031595394,0.021527406,0.0059391856,0.024184044,-0.04751151,-0.03798107,0.0052782428,-0.04911155,-0.011153725,-0.0045213867,0.049426846,-0.026144633,0.020211676,-0.004816092,-0.04198724,-0.075045474,0.03442985,0.056910712,0.04950152,-0.040566534,0.030080827,0.036428276,-0.054207876,0.03647789,-0.048412014,-0.030179191,0.030392256,0.019529114,0.04