c({id:"Alarm:6",text:"Usage\nThe Alarm name is the alarm id or key. Alarms default to severity Warning and when created are active.\n\nCode Examples\n\nAlarm\n\n\n  Alarm alarm = new Alarm.Builder(x)\n                    .setName(\"Payment Provider CP Onboarding\")\n                    .setReason(AlarmReason.TIMEOUT)\n                    .build();\n  DAO alarmDAO = (DAO) alarmDAO.put(alarm);\n\n\n((DAO) x.get(\"alarmDAO\")).put(new Alarm(\"Payment Provider CP Onboarding\", AlarmReason.TIMEOUT));",sourceId:"Alarm",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-4.8994354E-4,0.058682103,-0.07887151,0.024022054,-0.03183247,0.0028945191,0.1615412,0.05990313,0.01375933,-0.092344545,-0.008267531,-0.05175546,0.018426804,-0.04668819,-0.08101178,-0.0063151624,0.02362844,-0.034745704,0.035105772,0.036009014,0.04639135,-0.02202423,0.010818464,0.012867652,-0.015276725,-0.063829206,0.08293206,0.0314148,-0.030026162,-0.007647349,0.016863108,-0.02422859,0.107866876,-0.0380571,0.01680732,0.020119354,0.055912636,0.045332402,-0.049827404,-0.04516189,0.07218308,-0.009385734,0.0061561577,-0.005726821,-0.054062087,-0.02099158,-0.020999592,-0.01669983,-0.008234729,0.019659456,-0.012271889,-0.03171713,-0.046475116,-0.05425491,-0.017705495,0.09055132,0.031096721,0.036203645,-0.0010985616,-0.016560605,0.043183897,0.07794643,-0.013723667,0.06353009,0.0035602038,0.021488097,-0.003200767,-0.017306391,0.01510736,-0.050916202,0.040126894,-0.009584809,0.066242024,0.039525263,-0.02977388,0.067361824,0.034059014,0.059854735,0.039271686,-0.067050055,-0.069840185,-0.027213389,-0.015330799,0.0023357335,0.02303468,0.06401097,0.016827809,-0.031277556,-0.003725496,5.3128425E-4,0.01961483,-0.063569784,0.029346742,-0.04310594,0.038122963,-9.31271E-4,-0.015502608,-0.0319339,-0.09193827,-0.021270847,-0.021512913,0.05656119,-0.08395494,0.09546844,0.059321795,-0.09141346,-0.01695868,-0.04488133,0.035080828,0.014446706,-0.026690116,0.051080383,0.088137046,-0.04912197,0.010266498,0.04327313,-0.1072