c({id:"ApplicationController:4",text:"Lifecycle\nrender()\n  \u2514\u2500 addMacroLayout()          // builds nav + stack + footer shell\n  \u2514\u2500 onClientLoad()\n       \u2514\u2500 ClientBuilder.promise\n            \u2514\u2500 splice client sub-context into subContext.proto\n            \u2514\u2500 fetchGroup()\n            \u2514\u2500 fetchTheme()    // loads Theme, expands CSS macros\n            \u2514\u2500 installLanguage()\n            \u2514\u2500 onUserAgentAndGroupLoaded()   \u2190 if authenticated\n                 \u2514\u2500 checkGeneralCapability() // CRUNCH gate\n                 \u2514\u2500 pushDefaultMenu() or routeUpdated()\n                 \u2514\u2500 initLayout.resolve()\n            \u2514\u2500 initMenu()      \u2190 if anonymous\n            \u2514\u2500 subToNotifications()\n\n\ninitLayout is a Latch \u2014 views that depend on layout being ready can await initLayout.",sourceId:"ApplicationController",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.11539458,-0.017052853,0.013532006,0.017726531,0.05773536,-0.024598198,-0.009649642,0.015492376,-0.015397791,-0.013455903,0.02535635,0.01222125,0.024604622,-0.019095987,0.054716904,-0.034413878,0.04426393,-0.05294962,0.020619536,-0.022626983,0.0029516246,-0.09102451,-0.0136143,0.0042725573,-0.0019981163,-0.026143389,-0.011361616,-0.05804901,0.064480186,0.04550864,0.04562498,0.10542398,-0.014279456,-0.04925525,-0.06668976,0.06626996,0.030957889,-0.009026718,-0.0350308,8.307454E-4,-0.0071573374,-0.034101274,-0.016746119,0.010278566,0.039092448,-0.054664504,-0.006183366,-0.008238041,-0.084351555,0.046358246,0.002037221,-0.03824013,0.016370462,-0.032045715,0.001067131,0.09902966,-0.07620106,0.045745283,0.036245257,0.06209361,-0.004091488,-0.039249603,0.01824332,0.053986315,0.07756644,0.06343686,0.041207135,-0.022981726,-0.009297607,-0.033162963,0.013597553,-0.084925294,0.06179265,-0.041952394,-0.05513292,-0.051555898,0.069565624,-0.023187323,-0.08383788,-0.123877876,0.0251