c({id:"Auth:2",text:"Core Model Relationships\nThe FOAM authorization system is built around four primary models: User, Group, Permission, and Capability. These models are connected through junction tables that enable many-to-many relationships while storing additional metadata.\n\nJunction Tables\n- GroupPermissionJunction: Manages many-to-many relationships between groups and permissions\n- UserCapabilityJunction: Manages many-to-many relationships between users and capabilities, storing additional data like status and expiry information\n\nPermission Granting\nCapabilities can grant permissions through their permissionsGranted property. The authorization system uses these relationships to determine user permissions through both group membership and granted capabilities.",sourceId:"Auth",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[0.047735184,-0.033022657,-0.079548866,-0.034314595,0.0018462928,0.0075893993,0.015271373,-0.0114631485,0.017541902,-0.019947106,-0.0025235468,-0.008973339,0.088400856,0.08749432,0.0017017479,0.035098083,0.06473222,-0.046893425,-0.068508565,-0.015542735,0.010204038,-0.014867506,-0.022247765,0.005237611,-0.061738405,-0.01750267,-1.428559E-4,-0.08113585,0.026169762,-0.05210329,-0.0114475675,0.015565704,0.049333226,0.006163931,-0.013696078,-0.058127463,0.062755376,-0.032165892,0.010362438,-0.012991867,-0.057022728,0.021737134,0.0082200365,-0.009619134,0.018085254,0.020590788,-0.017011717,-0.019448698,-0.010127194,0.043435786,0.07101366,-0.029318113,0.039069723,0.088820405,0.021624733,0.046156283,-0.018809099,-0.032956872,-0.09303135,-0.0018799248,0.014646646,0.0103729665,-0.05007189,-7.7599584E-4,0.034615416,0.0129634775,-0.018416999,0.009217741,-0.028201312,-0.09976823,0.009630085,-0.025730569,-0.08477747,-0.05483255,0.06330172,0.041299656,0.009854947,0.030894052,0.07327922,-0.12653914,-0.022726709,0.16141084,0.0407986,-0.025953822,-0.037024762,-0.0015625848,0.023781741,-0.033137858,-0.022188835,0.041129135,0.057788864,-0.0