c({id:"Axioms:5",text:"Axiom Access and Introspection\nClasses provide methods to access their axioms:\n\n- getAxiomByName(name) - Get a specific axiom\n- getAxioms() - Get all axioms including inherited ones 14\n- getOwnAxioms() - Get only axioms defined on this class 15\n- getAxiomsByClass(cls) - Filter axioms by type\n- hasOwnAxiom(name) - Check if axiom is defined locally 16\n\nThe framework also provides debugging support through describe() which lists all axioms with their types and source classes. 17",sourceId:"Axioms",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.010708768,0.029013347,-0.009311191,-0.041417092,0.11209369,-0.03934251,0.011136281,-0.013495073,-0.09194133,-0.027371908,-0.01138889,-0.04830634,-0.06621279,-0.08528521,-0.03249076,-0.029610122,0.031322856,0.030891273,0.024486778,-0.03474796,0.0443182,-0.008211566,-0.09913824,0.037469912,-0.056621596,0.075759426,-0.010784777,-0.047380075,0.06177568,-0.0097912485,-0.06878078,0.09040898,0.014041538,0.050605744,0.0066238907,0.02096625,0.035572253,0.055898674,0.0421409,0.047535587,-0.090430066,0.027524974,0.017243499,-0.024906542,0.014370767,-0.0018517594,-0.019792072,-0.08878966,0.0023245872,-0.06695736,-0.0672599,0.037734497,-0.04813762,-3.3246863E-5,0.14482771,0.042507634,0.010707487,0.050272312,-0.046171736,-0.04418437,-0.093694456,0.050559256,-0.07114108,0.04539044,-0.08145547,0.10070127,0.04302921,0.09772722,0.0020175744,0.0022333658,-0.0647673,-0.0026579234,0.03675587,0.037894752,-0.02711372,0.05611206,0.06700116,0.024102222,-0.012889593,-0.011857494,-0.10533601,0.060752876,0.024493063,0.05110611,-0.001534727,0.08884118,0.024467532,-0.011649837,0.031208375,0.06390711,-0.022145566,-0.051185243,0.027380075,0.0047344407,0.08503188,0.03232655,0.027898217,-0.08256523,0.00419904,0.033945706,-0.023843681,0.0687432,0.06418157,-0.041950602,0.0049237013,-0.0019777818,0.016278904,-0.0175026,0.046046585,0.02677837,-0.01108046,0.023183705,-0.066764005,-0.10968475,0.09321379,-0.003278334,-0.0