c({id:"Boxes:3",text:"How are Boxes used in FOAM\nBoxes are primarily used to drive the Stub/Skeleton RPC system of FOAM.  For example, ClientDAO is a Stub DAO, it can be provided with a Box and will communicate over that Box to provide a DAO interface.\n\n\nvar dao = foam.dao.ClientDAO.create({\n  delegate: foam.box.WebSocketBox.create({  url: 'ws://someserver.com/service/someDAO' })\n});\n\ndao.put(some.Object.create({ ... }))",sourceId:"Boxes",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.033876542,-0.014438189,-0.06868154,0.018927202,-0.016623143,-0.039346956,0.009375557,-0.036190443,0.018722268,-0.038249638,-0.042720854,0.06322942,-0.06321842,-0.01509597,0.039290827,0.013719872,0.1149199,-0.03577868,0.023307541,0.061535385,0.08304687,-0.0031233367,-0.07853731,-0.03403257,-0.04228425,-1.6330945E-4,0.026837794,-0.058351014,0.053803485,-0.035156924,0.08438138,-0.059142612,-0.02555521,0.035124596,-0.0743268,0.032470573,-0.0027766582,-0.035368353,-5.58752E-4,0.016552046,0.016189363,0.019021211,0.022851253,0.026208805,0.057559464,-0.011356957,-0.03529621,0.016765637,0.0021105139,-0.031308606,-0.012702009,-0.033613343,2.8286324E-4,0.076605484,-0.07755249,-0.016133264,-0.01699349,0.06378811,-0.018644027,0.058868308,0.0367242,0.037335254,0.11539857,0.05755337,0.070916235,-0.0044953935,-0.0053799893,0.06652376,-0.046940345,-0.069836065,0.020005126,-0.020803638,0.05024894,-0.0018055396,0.00902705,-0.04116028,-0.011224415,0.022199892,0.08229979,0.10159552,-0.013751602,0.04024943,0.023043387,-0.002925447,-0.06520917,0.1291121,0.027512696,-0.027754486,-0.082802996,0.0019803843,0.039950565,-0.05702911,-0.009413779,0.035683427,-0.06362361,-0.06029973,0.012944999,0.049174387,-0.026125776,-0.005512934,-0.013487048,-0.014372149,-0.02592335,-0.013263239,-0.0024529833,-0.071616076,-0.033113312,-0.011034481,0.023265868,0.1289377,-0.10119813,0.036000904,-0.043417297,0.030709099,-0.042697925,-0.060352314,-0.0526907,0.016489636,0.0052740197,-0.0653236,0.07121602,-0.04