c({id:"Build:9",text:"Build POM Fields\n- name - a non-unique identifier that distinguishes the POM in it's local scope. Used when reporting POM issues.  Also used to set APPNAME. A different APPNAME can be specified in envs.\n\n  foam.POM({\n    name: 'foam',\n    ...\n\n- exclude - directories under this POM which should not be processed if they do not contain a POM.\n- envs - map of key-values pairs to set build environment variables or options.\n\n  foam.POM({\n    name: 'foam-full',\n    ...\n    envs: {\n      appName: 'foam'\n    },\n\n- licenses - source code licenses which applies to the source managed by this POM.\n- version - major[-minor-revision] string used to distinguish a build.  The version is also inserted into the build and available from within.  Used in jar file naming, and also for journal versioning. \n\n  foam.POM({\n    ...\n    version: '1.0.0',\n\n- projects -  (and flags  -   test)\n- files -\n- javaFiles -\n- journalFiles - \n- flowDocFiles - (FUTURE) \n- tasks - (project defined tasks)\n- copy - (build provided tasks)\n- Tooling specific - java, javaDependencies, javaFiles (above)\n\nCreating a Build POM Tasks\nTODO",sourceId:"Build",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.008849434,0.0571615,-1.7302558E-4,-0.030502273,0.08163588,-0.091156095,0.020580674,-0.03160153,0.02287811,-0.018154554,0.052339807,-0.06863437,0.004698072,-0.0032104056,0.054074846,0.030662538,0.00826074,-0.06488975,0.102792785,0.053525392,0.058243014,0.057928827,0.07489814,0.028012177,-0.013657517,0.03494178,-0.024031576,8.754124E-5,-0.0065039834,-0.08840081,0.04978313,0.0786104,0.011302003,-0.031759087,0.071311206,0.06405542,-0.029820861,0.018201424,-0.030052654,-0.015262142,-0.029516924,9.349259E-4,-0.008519638,-0.028293537,-0.06462521,-0.043129444,0.01729838,-0.060541112,-0.064059116,0.063128896,0.028121417,-0.06390482,-0.068214975,-0.069661066,0.06623611,0.019441644,-0.03697437,0.060728848,-0.05911103,-0.04594232,0.03863004,0.03481771,-0.0