c({id:"Build:10",text:"Tooling POM Fields\n- name - a non-unique identifier that distinguishes the POM in it's local scope. Used when reporting POM issues.\n- envs - environment variables that are internal to the tooling itself. For example a calculated value that many tasks share, or that one task sets-up for another.\n- options - defines a property whose value can be manipulated to impact a task.\n- tasks - defines a method which acts against the repository.",sourceId:"Build",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[0.0011349419,-0.006063793,-0.0783862,0.010328275,-0.05085332,-0.09939744,0.08862263,0.007250244,0.013338543,0.02560324,0.02985412,2.669216E-4,0.036863092,0.029027054,0.011900077,0.07139926,0.013159938,-0.05220288,0.04752558,0.019212045,-0.0039947038,0.024701778,-0.066781946,0.0051980754,-0.053491227,0.018520936,-0.03740077,0.08275601,-0.007142127,-0.06885101,-0.016877478,0.046812482,0.016357439,0.0021050025,0.022714334,0.13047467,0.0145908315,0.0086099515,-0.040458154,0.005070321,-0.04787432,-0.04063356,-0.013991449,-0.058917683,0.032366835,-0.010393015,0.07152949,-0.08501608,-0.16187242,0.0055025183,0.026530959,-0.026125813,-0.026709707,0.011929504,0.041816562,-0.013371254,0.048008762,0.026510457,-0.061613258,-0.051362876,-0.030167568,0.028334914,-0.08437218,0.027941382,-0.015052002,-0.04573247,0.13047056,-0.028260104,-0.03193936,-0.04348625,0.035950713,-0.040457997,-0.060986634,-0.008523269,0.0059285183,0.04433914,-0.061915047,0.030799115,0.06389825,-0.100779004,0.02286016,0.1294105,-0.04679534,0.068736024,0.03597965,0.040947672,-0.001200251,0.012954718,0.09275807,0.03471757,-0.04263322,-0.090576686,0.049384277,0.050569456,-0.008034076,-0.009713196,-0.0067398143,-0.010259957,0.027071929,-0.014129307,-0.033332884,-0.025019947,0.008039397,0.015163351,0.025688997,-0.015184666,-0.073567644,0.0018480786,0.0030362145,0.021934634,-0.025648233,0.020163096,-0.016855894,-0.08399762,0.061731912,-0.044442378,0.023840318,-0.006586043,0.0649623