c({id:"Build:17",text:"Additional Tooling\n- Project tooling provides tasks for creating a new FOAM based project, complete with an example Model and Test case.  The task will create the default directory layout along with required poms, and initial journal configuration for logging in and mananging the new Model.\n    \n  ./build.sh -T+setup/Project --appName:example --package:com.foamdev --adminPassword:badpassword\n  # then build with\n  ./build.sh deployment/demo/run.sh\n  # login with demo user - username: demo, password: demopassword\n  # or admin user - username: admin, password: badpassword\n  #\n  # Run the test cases with\n  ./build.sh --server-tests:ExampleTest\n    \n- RemoteInstall tooling provide tasks to install a release on a remote instance.\n    - see doc/guides/Deployment.md\n    - After building with task tar (-k), re-run the build with RemoteInstall tooling to upload and install the tarball on a remote host.\n    \n  # build tar ball\n  ./build.sh -ckJhttps\n\n  # deploy to remote host\n  ./build.sh -TStandard,Java,RemoteInstall --user:foam user-id:3636 --backup:false --remote-hostname:moosehead\n    \n- ESLint Linting support\n    - see eslint.md\n    \n    # Run check on default src/ directory:\n    ./build.sh -TESLint\n\n    # see ussage with\n    ./build.sh -TESLint --usage",sourceId:"Build",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.021180222,-0.013561036,-0.01995259,-0.0344385,0.023579517,-0.073650174,-0.06266222,0.039860126,-0.019320734,0.06856051,0.047114205,-0.07040004,0.06743412,0.030958185,0.06116752,-0.0021692535,0.07340778,-0.057949346,0.06998823,0.019700905,0.021395938,0.016941909,0.08403499,-0.023816785,-0.042526193,-0.024512386,0.029695697,-0.054449525,-0.053733468,-0.049352154,0.015654588,-0.015453062,-0.08220808,-0.042369474,0.14616686,0.13387176,0.09339357,2.7788567E-4,-0.020110846,-0.030711692,-0.0056104627,-0.029228434,-0.00709903,-0.062465012,-0.07253735,-0.06792874,-0.017625583,-0.09023113,0.017717559,