c({id:"Cells:1",text:"The Magic of Spreadsheet Cells\nThere is a quiet revolution hiding in plain sight on millions of desktops around the world. It lives in the humble spreadsheet cell\u2014a rectangle so commonplace that we rarely stop to consider just how remarkable it truly is.\n\nA spreadsheet cell is magical. Not in the sense of parlor tricks or illusions, but in the deeper sense of something that accomplishes the seemingly impossible with effortless grace. The cell combines input, output, computation, and storage into a single unified object, eliminating entire categories of work that plague conventional software development.",sourceId:"Cells",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.063231625,0.009476135,-0.058341376,-0.00848927,-0.06997924,-0.020233518,-0.02935409,0.034356114,0.11076665,-0.01705783,-0.08154577,0.055454534,0.028439559,-0.066638544,-0.051402036,-0.008197029,-0.014636141,0.003707693,-0.076429285,-2.7213787E-4,0.007653821,-0.07533757,-0.024336468,0.01936304,0.059578195,0.05978678,-0.06075043,-0.004832955,-0.01787605,-0.048397794,-0.010523893,0.09338281,0.013278852,0.072273605,-0.07473145,-2.7505808E-7,-0.006270913,0.040868897,0.059466265,-0.03571674,-0.014965622,-0.02993116,-0.034714542,0.04708737,-0.003183581,-0.04438204,-0.040085297,-0.07536439,-0.010349676,-0.0027279037,-0.08852602,-0.0050546974,-0.03326711,0.071541995,0.014029766,0.038504567,0.0019837162,0.0016284306,0.066058345,0.03066957,-0.04541937,0.068104304,0.0073066205,0.0859166,0.025575811,-0.02273029,-0.027781356,-0.011111623,-0.020363046,-0.023922212,5.0676725E-4,0.06823748,-0.014944214,0.034711678,0.0312593,-0.02988495,-0.14926977,-0.08144603,0.04233803,0.04234608,0.02147632,0.023172792,0.06306608,0.097440556,-0.02392966,-0.055435646,0.049510006,0.062261023,0.06979857,-0.05354328,-0.010972192,0.040365532,0.0752777,0.050996,-0.07408936,-0.05107858,0.084895715,-0.024243325,-0.01588142,0.046516668,0.0020672926,-0.015681453,0.14288044,-0.019840483,0.021167476,-