c({id:"Comics:5",text:"Class Hierarchy\nfoam.comics.v3.DAOController          \u2190 top-level state machine; exports daoController, config, click\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 foam.comics.v3.DAOView            \u2190 Browse state: table + create/select buttons\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 foam.comics.v3.CreateView         \u2190 Create state: empty form + Save action\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 foam.comics.v3.DetailView         \u2190 View/Edit state: populated form + Edit/Save/Copy/Delete actions\n\n\nConfiguration for all three states lives in one shared object:\n\n\nfoam.comics.v2.DAOControllerConfig    \u2190 all configuration, consumed by every micro-controller\n\n\nCRUD actions can be overridden per-model via:\n\n\nfoam.comics.v3.ComicsAction           \u2190 extends foam.lang.Action; replaces default CRUD behaviour",sourceId:"Comics",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.024420656,-0.089748904,-0.12729543,0.0060929693,0.050068356,0.015958054,-0.03555682,0.02390798,-0.045617674,0.054544225,0.059417497,0.0028313838,0.006276921,0.028550044,0.047907002,0.052603822,0.038670227,-0.11105539,-0.043655466,0.0860876,0.16202341,0.030597065,0.03831871,-0.03690246,-0.082577005,0.051840063,-0.006751864,-0.0780947,-0.010795389,-0.103923656,2.8508057E-5,0.008899447,0.01277197,-0.06266136,0.08747453,-0.010903343,-0.013358275,-0.023119539,-0.015391169,-0.038582765,0.02345691,0.030871844,0.0061059427,-0.017172983,0.011668264,0.017547967,0.016465478,-0.031180998,0.018345423,0.0066762166,0.040744357,0.018370694,0.03708222,0.016824724,0.042788714,0.037016977,-0.014808837,0.011507927,-0.036751535,-0.009632124,-0.00311423,0.024593089,-0.01906051,0.014389247,0.015142563,0.009329283,0.023080224,-0.021767749,-0.0071587414,-0.0038503495,-0.07658777,0.0052478868,0.01403576,0.0019419017,0.03828514,-0.0034078064,0.01780035,0.028402984,0.028040797,-0.038170986,-0.008987608,0.04699444,0.048053887,-0.028553061,0.022378383,0.055709373,0.0344501,-0.11149687,0.07075694,-0.0052504926,-0.028669395