// Modified by admin admin (42) at 2026-10-02T11:19:33.430+0000
c({id:"Compaction:15",text:"Gotchas\n1. Roll-only does NOT compact -- FileRollCmd only freezes the journal as a generation. Send a CompactionCmd for full compaction.\n\n2. Compaction is async -- The snapshot runs on the thread pool. execute() polls for completion every 5 seconds.\n\n3. One compaction per journal at a time -- a CompactionCmd for a journal that is already compacting is skipped and reported on the command (getSkippedCount(), getSkipped()), not queued and not an error. Overlapping triggers are expected; the next run picks it up.\n\n4. Live traffic during compaction -- Writes go to the fresh journal from the moment of the cutover and are never at risk; the snapshot is a separate file that only becomes visible once complete.\n\n5. MDAO is the source -- Compaction reads from MDAO, not the journal file. The in-memory state is what gets written.\n\n6. FixedSizedDAO interaction -- If the DAO stack includes a FixedSizedDAO, only objects retained by it are compacted.\n\n7. eventRecordDAO required -- execute() writes to eventRecordDAO. Must be available in context.\n\n---",sourceId:"Compaction",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.07010974,0.0109441215,-0.11961684,0.03132793,0.010152417,-0.056803644,-0.028249072,0.0052759317,-0.0039226008,0.0743087,0.015596833,0.07073061,-0.0077960687,-0.108984165,-0.037917685,-0.042181686,-0.03945466,-0.03168639,-0.05322619,0.09026113,0.03748775,-0.0052832393,0.013123983,8.646027E-4,-0.037613787,-0.0071771815,-0.049993783,-0.013954394,0.017892355,-0.03238065,0.020241404,0.02500909,-0.028298004,0.0022598084,0.058496688,0.02407385,0.02025595,0.014943186,-0.06235858,-0.03148534,0.09424547,0.012248247,-0.011425815,0.03104303,-0.061723877,-0.06499974,-0.058132034,0.0075381463,-0.06634876,0.00500379,-0.033553194,0.019731812,-0.029781902,0.093938395,0.04394164,0.029482925,-0.014657744,0.0039518387,-0.08561858,-0.05128215,-0.040052153,0.010580093,-0.09146067,0.07395,0.039912645,0.024436237,0.09476582,0.018377