c({id:"ControllerModeAndVisibility:4",text:"How PropertyBorder Orchestrates It\nPropertyBorder is the component that ties the three layers together. When it renders a property, it:\n\n1. Follows the context's controllerMode$ (via follow())\n2. Computes a modeSlot by calling prop.createVisibilityFor(data$, controllerMode$) \u2014 which picks the right visibility for the current ControllerMode, applies the restriction ceiling, and optionally combines with permission checks\n3. Passes mode$: modeSlot to the inner view (EnumView, TextField, etc.)\n\nThe inner view receives mode$ as a reactive slot. When visibility changes, the view re-renders accordingly.\n\nSource: foam3/src/foam/u2/PropertyBorder.js, foam3/src/foam/u2/Element2.js:1844 (createVisibilityFor)",sourceId:"ControllerModeAndVisibility",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[0.0047007543,-0.027941044,-0.030795138,0.042439844,0.086349554,0.021457177,0.020981947,-0.040647864,0.038605016,-0.01021815,0.04206371,-0.05785521,0.03965076,-0.08467691,0.028266585,0.06697629,0.054377794,-0.10568447,-0.049416468,-0.010917619,0.087573014,-0.006440007,0.002383729,-0.0032262793,0.0047464455,0.068181284,-0.017219786,-0.065654166,0.08892923,-0.06469779,0.08794238,-0.0014936783,-0.058506057,-0.04845769,-0.05023884,-0.05778709,0.029039254,0.0055271313,-0.09577132,0.028298698,0.025970578,-6.141297E-4,-0.04777685,-0.051490743,0.038674496,0.06698479,0.026295107,0.022416452,0.006500285,-0.003282074,0.05609237,-0.03778802,0.019385124,0.025412964,0.0015003404,0.084058926,0.027602494,0.12378429,0.016711904,-0.008605934,0.02792263,0.010933483,0.010470597,-0.012578389,0.13237953,-0.0244202,-0.025715018,-0.03284477,-0.016699124,0.013507371,0.1024724,0.020667935,0.047355108,-0.05654294,0.057312265,0.07483074,-0.047648054,0.03185078,0.08109082,-0.058968715,-0.020187031,0.008372946,-0.03424827,-0.033302583,-0.0020129548,0.029909866,0.027799966,-0.050492458,-0.025070364,0.0755787,0.038031068,-0.021615814,-0.07961759,0.0