c({id:"CrunchLite:2",text:"What is crunch.lite?\nCRUNCH Lite makes it possible for capability data to be stored on objects rather\nthan in association with a user. This allows control over data a user has to\nsubmit to do something with a specific object.\n\nFor example, an object representing a choice of icecream may require the user\nto choose at least one flavour. Because we know the configuration of icecream\ncan be complicated, we choose to make Icecream implement Capable, which adds\nCRUNCH Lite features to our Icecream model.",sourceId:"CrunchLite",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.009129329,-0.0610557,-0.07844754,0.105812795,-0.05450729,-0.06462143,0.026947552,0.091314346,-0.03850519,-0.030635895,-0.028013078,0.0055034407,-0.013144437,0.037787713,0.0368815,-0.015001334,0.057907883,-0.052324608,-0.08360787,-0.08099333,0.08095445,-0.044359025,0.020806855,0.009958794,-0.03536088,-0.023552448,-0.027271098,-0.021956408,0.028649233,0.023849882,0.14361626,0.030535309,0.08926475,0.018361125,0.048293985,0.01818135,-5.1295E-4,-0.025300719,-0.036966164,-0.047696125,0.030733684,-0.031621113,0.010096405,0.03440593,-0.024670098,-0.015055745,-0.0053530796,-0.025349928,-0.07489729,-0.018201709,-0.020597618,-0.082992285,-0.023281902,0.04100592,0.06308187,0.007114474,0.042046204,-0.013337431,0.010867136,-0.018372322,0.009179912,-0.023722738,0.030707572,0.04759068,0.074660495,0.046461042,0.018806625,-0.061927944,0.007385524,-0.10160758,0.001862039,-0.02718404,-0.025282715,0.020502428,0.0113040265,-0.014728289,0.022388084,-0.01750179,-0.044427853,0.0013173318,-0.04457371,0.012544498,0.024823474,-0.011308627,-0.06416069,-0.023675367,0.07772829,2.3271872E-4,0.03929643,-0.028562373,-0.012262599,0.0069755856,0.030870197,0.006625983,-0.12539777,0.00975837,0.0714499,-0.056621034,-0.093896225,0.020363707,-0.04655876,0.04810154,0.011625001,-0.018913528,-0.026502054,-0.117168546,0.014651071,-0.04461373,-0.084075496,0.032640528,0.055473637,0.03287298,-0.0099