c({id:"CurrencyAndUnits:1",text:"Currency and Unit Values\nA money amount in FOAM is two properties: the number, and a sibling property that names its currency. Most rendering bugs come from one of three mix-ups: minor versus major units, a view that cannot reach the sibling currency, or an export that silently stops reading server-computed values.\n\n---",sourceId:"CurrencyAndUnits",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[0.034519166,0.034067377,-0.063546084,0.005307769,0.007932715,-0.06388166,-0.014595554,-0.01871786,0.07559415,-0.028321316,-0.0069819866,-0.14288844,0.042416815,0.018214336,0.02250341,-0.065384984,0.029724646,-0.03399821,-0.055410642,0.07909768,0.053742986,0.005503968,-0.07010069,0.03607244,0.05927683,0.090839684,-0.00302029,-0.10131837,0.047451034,-0.024342718,-0.044452764,0.08024379,0.041513313,-0.0645451,0.06584196,-0.053272415,0.056632735,0.05052479,-0.038744107,0.003301255,-0.009133397,-0.06315488,0.049711157,-0.03522162,-0.0019904159,0.016649496,0.042095136,0.02869384,-0.0074133505,0.068689406,0.07460876,-0.0071873055,-0.02148944,0.061036564,0.037237987,0.033275556,0.050884884,0.051394857,0.0071703494,0.017946111,-0.026261322,0.07067299,0.009636773,0.0037885222,0.071646474,-0.024297317,0.015924089,-0.033991918,-0.11489016,0.009048762,0.058739807,-0.020367289,0.028459843,-0.015249001,-0.003894474,0.08060897,0.058071367,-0.049104203,0.0583919,-0.014792859,-0.0059392643,0.0071325484,0.005994816,-0.031942,0.06457452,0.03427276,0.12283523,-0.042141035,-0.0030072064,0.008298078,0.044929687,-0.0014791287,0.056607053,0.05853684,0.03939237,-0.0060694586,0.0079229325,0.00349304,-0.003033586,0.009413367,-0.01460344,0.02313884,0.09531671,0.04314676,-0.006636581,-0.061297942,0.038762957,0.033153586,0.018316763,0.0290327,-0.0059949937,-0.011340109,-0.0200884,5.6804955E-4,0.02944013,-0.08501277,0.021104714,-0.11508315,0.0028855791,-0.029184403,0.053575814,-0.030835005,0.0040562768,0.032554492,-0.010422479,-0.0010162719,0.0065219086,-2.1