c({id:"DAGView:2",text:"What is DAGView?\nDAGView renders a directed acyclic graph, such as the one shown in the\nCrunchLab view. Unlike a tree view, multiple parent nodes can connect\nto a common child node. The graph is rendered using SVG, but u2 Elements\nmay be nested inside it.\n\nIt is important to know that while DAGView is currently only used by CrunchLab,\nit can be used with any FObject, and with various different grid placement plans,\nto suit a wide variety of use cases. When DAGView isn't suitable, many of the\ncomponents it uses are still re-usable, such as ArrowLine and the\nGridPlacementPlan interface.\n\n<foam class=\"foam.flow.widgets.TabbedModelDocumentation\" defaultTab=\"properties\" of=\"foam.u2.svg.graph.DAGView\"></foam>",sourceId:"DAGView",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.07337551,-0.08617587,-0.08080756,0.01518177,0.010062134,-0.054872576,-0.03463636,0.016285634,0.032196987,-0.047087044,-0.052836128,4.872664E-4,-0.06994723,-0.033788033,-0.0010528403,0.010700631,-0.031324513,-0.07276764,-0.0111252535,0.039118886,0.037454367,-0.018767716,-0.0033074205,-0.09135666,0.09740639,0.042681906,0.012798849,7.8983366E-4,0.019210191,-0.06583338,0.075397566,0.07686898,0.0071226074,0.0755692,-0.04362169,-0.00753498,0.06566649,-0.016735563,-0.081238285,-0.017553557,0.022502553,0.11252444,0.044937897,-0.027148422,-0.022204164,0.012051906,-0.114606865,-0.024388555,-0.0042915684,0.045975085,-0.061958905,-0.02928139,0.04441561,7.280333E-4,0.035656553,0.03230097,0.005565834,-0.0076487535,0.03608674,0.024286464,0.06770727,0.005134438,-0.019416407,0.07482786,-0.009355791,0.037533462,0.032245673,-0.06441908,0.019347379,-0.04609167,-0.056275453,-0.060957164,0.013159653,-0.014810054,-0.01484281,0.027197745,0.06344097,-0.0058499225,0.10634247,-0.111197844,0.035021126,0.15209964,0.03692436,0.04300819,4.1235835E-5,0.078809254,0.02224641,-0.058591645,-0.02922615,0.006694607,-0.011018011,0.049846556,-0.082938895,0.03437803,-0.098241754,-0.0