c({id:"DaoEventsAndRefresh:3",text:"The 3 events\nThe on topic is declared once on the base class (dao/AbstractDAO.js:44). A DAO\npublishes against it; subscribers register with on (JS) or a listener (Java):\njs\ntopics: [ { name: 'on', topics: [ 'put', 'remove', 'reset' ] } ]\n\n\n| Event | Fires when | Payload |\n|-------|-----------|---------|\n| put | one row added / updated | the object |\n| remove | one row deleted | the removed object |\n| reset | bulk / opaque change, re-read from scratch | none |\n\nremoveAll fires one remove per row (MDAO.removeAll:205), not one reset.\nJS subscribes against the on topic; Java registers a listeners list (AbstractDAO.js:691-728).",sourceId:"DaoEventsAndRefresh",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.08187773,-0.03419893,0.006743153,0.02632262,0.0632515,-0.07022798,0.05849261,-0.07610783,0.053954255,-0.040601358,-0.0146362,0.041116174,-0.03383553,0.016668674,-0.0031376516,0.048020095,0.03358819,0.034347426,-0.08359465,-0.028511262,0.060973845,0.02808471,-0.024817945,-0.021591578,0.008783684,0.02481332,0.06985701,-0.08971815,0.017348066,-0.021470007,0.020011766,0.024951277,-0.020508641,0.008233495,-0.029991299,0.021394372,-0.06010189,-0.021167023,0.05251502,-0.0070932745,0.12623508,-0.043392878,-0.0681488,-0.077529564,-0.016970927,-0.05979379,-0.09892966,-0.0053433427,-0.024948342,0.009243847,0.034661364,-0.063033365,-0.0038171087,0.06611355,-0.004732896,0.001559239,0.019233825,0.016359469,-0.04640849,-0.09348558,-0.015984038,-0.018320093,-0.052925248,0.09444445,0.07686308,0.023115851,0.019282186,0.023024594,0.09455101,0.018832622,0.02094767,0.069676116,0.065978155,-0.0074223895,-0.0026457615,-0.029376179,-0.0033035432,0.043014392,9.836775E-4,0.0018654948,0.0052278657,-0.08651163,0.008830642,-0.05064567,-0.020994091,0.033904966,-0.04953852,-0.022648325,0.0128973145,0.056462456,-0.054376993,0.03496796,0.07914156,0.036775142,-0.058902517,0.007540629,0.0036704014,0.024779636,0.030286081,0.0909062,0.00394