c({id:"DaoEventsAndRefresh:7",text:"Cheat sheet\njs\nthis.onDetach(dao.listen(sink));      // react to all changes (preferred)\nthis.onDetach(dao.on.put.sub(fn));    // react to one event type\n\ndao.on.reset.pub();                   // local re-select (memory data only)\ndao.cmd(foam.dao.DAO.RESETCMD);      // reset whole stack + all listeners (re-reads cache)\ndao.cmd(foam.dao.DAO.PURGECMD);      // dump cache, re-pull from server\n\nthis.pub('on', 'put', obj);           // publish (custom leaf DAO only, after the mutation)\n\n\n- Cmd/pub on the same instance the view listens to.\n- Cached DAO + server changed elsewhere \u2192 PURGE, not RESET.\n- Always onDetach a raw on.*.sub.",sourceId:"DaoEventsAndRefresh",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.06868395,-0.04382853,-0.004387163,-0.010883474,0.03324895,-0.08112091,-0.017937448,-0.03528616,0.006624678,-0.04796451,0.011326431,0.011888518,-0.12379484,-0.05253718,-0.024316084,0.04714719,0.033899877,0.053799406,-0.016183538,-0.01747784,0.006490149,0.05049483,-0.030252954,-0.02950432,0.01786173,0.02809033,0.025864644,-0.06377033,-0.014752737,-0.120137736,0.04703415,0.042151228,-0.067346014,-0.04430531,-0.0070050675,0.018952943,-0.10238587,-0.08105391,0.043739602,-0.0307361,0.08286601,0.03728508,-0.011218278,-0.0028219074,0.043689836,-0.011159243,-0.0709803,-0.0051349704,0.056969874,-0.03431111,-0.019423997,-0.046589695,-0.030944372,0.0177994,-0.03207544,0.027770897,0.017069822,0.027722716,0.016736345,0.041515276,0.054838568,0.0028946004,0.03022466,0.07969278,0.035740066,0.035455607,0.05102184,-0.0148273185,0.052672748,0.017997632,-0.02273156,0.020659301,0.07789218,-0.05137025,-0.02935733,0.014883256,-0.033453222,0.020857481,0.041494858,-0.02224334,-0.004521865,0.005653711,0.02263136,-0.0025525002,-0.028393287,0.073398076,0.04660335,-0.054396555,0.078069605,0.007091485,-0.03491648,0.024213588,0.048423037,0.04150162,-0.15012626,-8.7047333E-4,0.08271363,0.06501344,0.017870644,0.08787669,0.002251