c({id:"Deployment:10",text:"cspNonce and CSP directives\n- Server property (services.jrl): VirtualHostRoutingServlet.cspNonce outputs a <meta name=\"csp-nonce\" ...> and applies the nonce to server-emitted style/script tags.\n- CSP header (DAO): Add matching 'nonce-...' tokens to the CSP so the browser accepts nonce-bearing elements.\n  - Nonces apply to <style> and <script> elements (style-src-elem, script-src). They do not apply to style attributes (style-src-attr). For attributes, use 'unsafe-hashes' with specific hashes or avoid inline styles.\n\nExample:\njavascript\n// services.jrl (server emits the nonce)\np({\n  class: \"foam.core.boot.CSpec\", name: \"http\",\n  service: { class: \"foam.core.jetty.HttpServer\",\n    servletMappings: [{\n      class: \"foam.core.servlet.ServletMapping\",\n      servletObject: {\n        class: \"foam.core.servlet.VirtualHostRoutingServlet\",\n        defaultHost: \"localhost\",\n        cspNonce: \"123456789120000\"\n      },\n      pathSpec: \"/\"\n    }]\n  }\n})\n\n// journals/cspdirectives.jrl (browser accepts nonce\u2019d elements)\np({class:\"foam.core.http.csp.CSPDirective\", key:\"nonce\", name:\"script-src\", value:\"'nonce-123456789120000'\"})\np({class:\"foam.core.http.csp.CSPDirective\", key:\"mycompany\",  name:\"style-src-elem\", value:\"'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com 'nonce-123456789120000'\"})\n\nPractical examples\n1) Add a new allowed source (e.g., CDN for a third-party library)\njavascript\n// Appends to FOAM defaults for script-src\np({class:\"foam.core.http.csp.CSPDirective\", key:\"mycompany\", name:\"script-src\",\n   value:\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com\"})\n\n2) Domain-scoped directive (dev-only allowances)\njavascript\n// Allow source maps/fetches only on localhost\np({class:\"foam.core.http.csp.CSPDirective\", key:\"dev\", domain:\"localhost\",\n   name:\"connect-src\", value:\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net\"})",sourceId:"Deployment",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.08527525,0.07685166,-0.044029616,-0.042236697,0.00849657,-0.032850984,0.004089792,-0.024314057,0.019727841,-0.040356185,-0.030213455,-0.07622372,0.05039007,-0.09243697,0.08921479,-0.026799623,0.06438376,0.055930093,-0.01594718,3.9099948E-4,0.031849194,0.023021692,0.08242185,-0.07005225,-0.05099129,-0.00662883,-0.0010398544,-0.025825389,-0.013703454,-0.05286793,0.056663603,-0.0087511875,-0.12686172,-0.026500698,-0.008971118,0.051456664,0.024261128,-0.013854358,-0.0022927304,0.052045505,0.0047803973,0.033818983,-0.062064752,-0.03645314,-0.06060394,-0.051026057,-0.028087001,-0.026068393,-0.055166446,-0.031448014,-0.039796647,-0.034249246,0.011360851,0.0098071145,-0.08798076,-0.08780559,-0.052012462,0.041318633,0.043214623,0.06486455,-0.004543842,-0.05992386,0.039548006,-0.0016732357,0.04462507,5.806418E-4,-0.0027164381,0.026220478,-0.027104171,0.039535347,-0.05060463,-0.002987214,-0.031531475,-0.008633351,-0.044378225,0.101334065,0.010433673,0.047974225,0.034607753,-0.1411567,-0.04959834,-0.052698646,-0.011288218,0.09145531,0.021375883,0.08703731,-0.06392789,0.044796653,0.018330537,0.06277347,-0.05304756,0.017235791,-0.0104025,-0.025151663,-0.0023118327,0.050843645,-0.0051639914,-0.009194184,-0.008798981,0.07630313,-0.007311483,-0.011491481,0.027896777,-0.017223258,0.08859162,-0.0047276136,-0.06747927,0.09428866,0.033066694,6.79337E-4,0.0034423508,0.036632806,-0.04810856,-0.112107486,0.0023732055,0.0045968546,0.10214427,-0.074007094,0.030392896,0.0010362398,0.089126915,-0.07458866,0.01877887,0.0085243685,0.005894901,-0.07260591,0.032307122,6.934001E-33,0.027096527,-0.018019512,0.03214253,-0.04446561,0.0601444,0.015062511,-0.031113308,0.04183603,-0.03974895,3.9572417E-4,0.0135474885,0.010152811,-0.0017057003,-0.059403233,-0.019664237,-0.049410924,-0.033401664,0.015685676,0.04852136,-0.046093754,0.020260474,0.057764985,0.057523962,0.0331269,-0.05550771,0.032948785,-0.050137755,-0.011529034,-0.11100878,0.004638174,0.12407061,-0.03721366,-0.01320342