c({id:"DesignPatterns:1",text:"Design Patterns in FOAM\nFOAM is built on a small number of well-known design patterns applied consistently and pervasively. Understanding which pattern underlies a given FOAM concept makes it easier to predict behaviour, extend the framework, and recognise the structure of unfamiliar code.",sourceId:"DesignPatterns",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.0025722452,-0.015263182,-0.011851939,-0.031821284,0.040773522,-0.008685805,-0.013589142,-0.052393556,-0.019517051,-0.004551616,-0.048681363,-0.05009991,0.023752388,-0.008498089,0.035101917,-0.028096255,0.001196867,-0.031223007,0.023369368,-0.02688948,0.06284892,0.028511463,-0.054259587,-0.012320189,-0.047102038,0.1368353,0.05956753,-0.071694106,0.06706804,-0.06865505,0.04533144,0.081037804,0.019419653,-0.06330081,-0.01573189,-0.0023621335,-0.06084491,0.028789647,-0.02393674,0.019164965,-0.0959904,-0.042931497,0.028968694,0.006343004,0.05543926,0.0139579605,-0.026387447,0.016456785,-0.012897997,-0.014588813,0.009431776,-0.07129957,-0.014969061,-0.06759031,0.040619258,0.028445367,0.03849041,0.09199863,0.009574465,-0.043094605,0.057899162,0.011990625,-0.024140263,0.047377147,0.04203029,0.034654174,-0.014274594,-0.0048018172,0.02317484,-0.07257478,-0.046459988,0.0740117,0.033864368,0.03915486,0.05673537,0.084894456,-0.027425159,0.02521116,-0.021295339,-0.00530598,-0.026092209,0.040406566,0.02727547,0.0014865791,0.04492854,0.009927839,0.07271798,-0.062059134,-0.014352059,0.015504052,0.08375764,-0.07425159,-0.056529157,-0.082329355,-0.020664232,0.056828402,-0.02184267,-0.04402702,0.064176224,0.031963617,-0.07225339,0.005642351,0.013965464,0.03075889,0.02030692,-0.033382278,-0.013698339,-0.026613604,0.03870935,0.03878538,-0.050555885,0.0012893325,0.0056010103,0.0256586,0.048860468,-0.09696769,-0.0013540919,0.0059974724,-0.02001104,0.064461984,0.065678254,-0.050060507,0.052103788,-0.040168546,-0.028778214,0.05259529,-0.13679808,5.0247094E-34,0.008762094,-0.056770302,0