c({id:"DesignPatterns:2",text:"Strategy\nThe Sink interface (put, remove, error, eof) and the MDAO index interface are classic Strategy implementations \u2014 interchangeable algorithms behind a common interface. DAOs, parsers, Actions, and Views are also Strategies, but since they each qualify as a more specialised pattern, they appear under their own headings below.",sourceId:"DesignPatterns",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.018311892,0.0022574042,-0.04571783,-0.080245666,-0.040236983,-0.013929896,0.006051026,1.4030623E-4,-0.031078905,0.015009329,-0.046716094,0.051281326,-0.0017449611,0.005051814,-0.051760547,-0.0251646,-0.017952632,0.016552417,0.05158765,0.024800772,0.07987234,0.03181943,-0.030677726,-0.042975437,-0.099057585,0.08674759,0.032092266,-0.04626615,-0.00938781,-0.028593594,0.035911385,0.044428002,0.0093514295,-0.0371158,-0.16848567,0.017691862,-0.052743558,-0.0067613586,-0.039472498,-0.043079678,-0.026907943,-0.013063808,0.020203084,-0.01586092,0.04297419,-0.034128465,-0.067917705,-0.010199303,-0.034443047,-0.06865871,-0.06923746,-0.004491576,0.012188735,0.010029164,0.08176443,0.04226924,-0.0343788,0.0031515954,-0.02191157,-0.029507225,0.0638296,0.040199745,-0.055520505,0.062556304,0.07084143,0.02742777,0.057182472,0.0334388,0.0080887135,-0.016807059,-0.10425202,-0.036419064,-0.019606227,0.019024925,-0.0026782297,0.06271724,0.03396958,-0.024662532,-0.011967317,-0.026229998,0.016962176,0.0042977957,0.009438793,0.019051503,0.005793906,0.0020064954,-0.06165611,-0.07048764,0.12834111,-0.030055767,-0.026743878,-0.0023023167,-0.028536232,-0.06281006,0.09481318,0.011763395,-0.045733128,-0.013959301,-0.025429266,0.06762924,0.045370683,0.05594369,-0.063152485,-3.1704645E-4,0.01987356,-0.024618322,0.0052316636,0.013008445,-0.024809975,-0.029709931,-0.038126096,0.06611988,-0.058326628,-0.103129886,-0.033631444,-0.0035327266,-0.04173806,-3.9648326E-6,-0.014446817,0.0014073444,-0.04767745,-0.02579501,0.0013671138,0.029717267,0.052619