c({id:"DesignPatterns:3",text:"Proxy\nProxyDAO is a transparent proxy for the DAO interface. It delegates every method call to a delegate DAO, making it the natural superclass for any DAO Decorator: override only the methods you care about and let the rest pass through.\n\njavascript\nfoam.CLASS({\n  name: 'TimestampDAO',\n  extends: 'foam.dao.ProxyDAO',\n  methods: [\n    function put(x, obj) {\n      obj = obj.clone();\n      obj.lastModified = new Date();\n      return this.delegate.put(x, obj);\n    }\n  ]\n});\n\n\nProxySink and ProxyListener play the same role for Sink and Listener respectively.",sourceId:"DesignPatterns",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.0865779,-0.021529676,0.04991857,-0.020209184,-0.06807783,-0.08444099,0.020908799,-0.015777819,-0.033425264,-0.05098542,-0.08796193,0.054442514,-0.10490581,-0.013656799,0.018344851,0.059752006,0.10473365,0.03910851,-0.0024186226,-0.037454337,0.112631634,-0.05400879,-0.05423371,-0.010943206,-0.04383524,0.00832565,0.015744604,-0.099339485,0.03662839,-0.047311094,0.043749437,0.011410879,-0.16660534,-0.06392617,-0.12392825,-1.8520412E-4,0.0014294102,-0.014073845,0.024680149,-0.0099136615,0.090163425,0.0034687237,0.031616017,-0.035610527,0.007016316,0.015508107,0.01678956,0.029418977,0.047282666,-0.026173616,0.038961116,-0.016556898,0.035735045,0.06243603,-0.006703962,-0.0253815,0.010786789,0.039309878,-0.0069671655,0.026640438,-0.03881608,0.029623043,-0.003004713,0.1426919,0.028493777,-0.08577146,0.009295761,0.10259517,0.036307357,0.027851088,-0.061892126,-0.011791783,0.08173456,-0.015159022,0.049829822,-0.00908135,-0.0062463777,0.066934615,0.070990704,-0.047154915,0.09465489,-0.0018205047,-0.013757546,0.025389217,-0.025891967,0.09539739,0.042581286,-0.024083596,0.03273705,0.0034703738,-0.024701787,-0.03019016,-0.023802297,0.007612474,-0.10370419,-0.043719828,0.056585807,0.055287708,0.012141561,0.07027047,-0.03755155,0.06416932,-0.030228183,0.037161384,0.057639323,-0.088225566,-0.0433