c({id:"DesignPatterns:5",text:"Bridge\nThe various DAO implementations are a Bridge: a common interface that makes fundamentally different storage technologies appear identical to application code.\n\n| Implementation | Storage |\n|---|---|\n| MDAO | In-memory with pluggable indexes |\n| JDAO / F3FileJournal | Append-only file journal |\n| IDBDAO | Browser IndexedDB |\n| LocalStorageDAO | Browser localStorage |\n| ClientDAO | Remote server via HTTP/WebSocket |\n| RestDAO | RESTful HTTP backend |\n| ArrayDAO | Plain JavaScript array |\n\nApplication code that calls dao.where(...).select() does not know \u2014 and does not need to know \u2014 which implementation is underneath. Switching storage is a configuration change, not a code change.",sourceId:"DesignPatterns",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.0784933,0.0019419304,-0.062103823,0.013733744,-0.010340188,-0.10154461,0.014569616,0.057338763,0.0063549564,0.0013856788,-0.042911872,0.08429486,-0.05934924,-0.08195589,-7.8460673E-4,0.06635737,0.039587133,0.005079139,-0.041302934,0.079190135,0.070414,-0.010806557,-0.07073166,-0.063869886,0.026196169,0.05553477,0.07894728,-0.0012925934,-0.010894589,-0.04835781,-0.055601712,0.081724554,-0.057744116,0.01148442,-0.032846477,0.03318671,0.022033108,-0.04932632,-0.026385128,-0.08063997,0.059148476,0.077970706,-0.011866877,0.0046889945,0.011206006,-0.064728536,-0.12960516,-0.0063533504,-0.03463035,-0.082668744,-0.06372991,0.078024454,-0.027203575,0.08582855,-0.017562648,-0.017417023,-0.02558331,0.028416282,-0.07830442,0.035814583,0.0014172253,0.023457695,0.041504245,0.08706125,0.053561676,0.009205906,0.07140899,-0.03033594,0.020413212,-0.082406655,-0.088300325,0.06307238,0.02256254,0.013206237,-0.014726895,-0.04852719,0.041660134,0.101722755,0.09407746,-0.08614038,0.018404834,0.019906156,-0.005279632,0.06282818,-0.044615123,0.026035983,-0.05289682,-0.060443036,0.053937983,0.0074486155,-0.0147412615,0.006733029,-4.828043E-4,-0.039484583,-0.034302097,