c({id:"DesignPatterns:7",text:"Composite\nDAOs, Views, and Parsers all implement the Composite pattern \u2014 a uniform interface that works identically whether the instance is a leaf or a composition of other instances.\n\nA CompositeJournal, for example, fans writes out to multiple underlying journals and fans reads back in, while presenting the identical Journal interface. Parser combinators like seq and alt compose primitive parsers into arbitrarily deep trees, all implementing the same parse interface.",sourceId:"DesignPatterns",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.03266394,-0.08891684,-0.001068734,8.648225E-4,-0.018829487,-0.09437887,-0.036783233,-0.034124397,0.027702406,0.027052894,-0.021809744,0.029012498,-0.0024895028,0.005614129,0.057495218,-0.012233159,0.021816742,0.040862773,-0.03657967,-0.008224689,0.0058242753,0.0130592305,-0.12578326,0.018878784,-0.012676216,0.03109441,-0.045663152,-0.08267975,0.055449363,-0.065895624,0.032441575,0.026128344,0.03659913,0.10707102,-0.04430941,0.046575077,0.021985956,-0.01278707,-0.020801302,-0.052291844,0.025370134,-0.02388291,-0.0047382675,-0.026425999,0.047408916,-0.0061122417,-0.0642468,0.03701388,-0.021134824,-0.025767237,-0.094844796,-0.017809149,-0.015705438,0.05898021,0.016814176,0.072118394,-0.028939633,0.027344033,-0.01569618,-0.03543053,0.022697615,-0.025065532,-0.07034508,0.091672145,0.08822965,0.0010212946,0.01863985,0.03243696,0.022068096,-0.038011104,-0.042995755,0.021545941,0.022637831,0.04104241,-0.017625887,0.02826189,-0.023247689,-0.033911876,0.021940518,-0.042256724,0.045004718,0.073322676,0.026717136,0.045643173,0.0055505037,0.014879458,0.02327011,-0.015493209,-0.07726177,0.04017122,-0.017184796,-0.08405918,0.0879815,-0.040826038,-0.08525554,0.003577275,0.037203167,-0.02388978,0.071769394,0.060338885,0.03827435,0.05397253,0.046358094,-0.044956062,-0.028981352,-0.08218738,-0.07397116,-0.059687782,0.044282895,-0.003095039,-0.0037811545,0.09435664,-0.029767865,-0.04508742,-0.