c({id:"DesignPatterns:13",text:"Facade\nEasyDAO is a textbook Facade. It hides the complexity of assembling a decorated DAO stack \u2014 sequence number assignment, journalling, caching, authorisation, performance monitoring \u2014 behind a single fluent builder:\n\njavascript\nfoam.dao.EasyDAO.Builder(x)\n  .setOf(Invoice.getOwnClassInfo())\n  .setSeqNo(true)\n  .setJournal(true)\n  .setCache(true)\n  .setAuthorize(true)\n  .setPm(true)\n  .build()\n\n\nThe resulting DAO is a composed stack of decorators. EasyDAO handles the ordering constraints and compatibility rules between them; the caller deals with intent, not implementation.",sourceId:"DesignPatterns",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.07210899,0.036482245,-0.014900672,-0.033228297,-0.07378466,-0.09215804,-0.10088467,0.0043485537,-0.10420825,0.022550099,-0.0103556905,-0.017686825,-0.066101186,-0.024205461,0.072495796,-0.00978649,0.07299541,-0.053176325,-0.015073971,0.09293405,0.10734972,-0.045802154,-0.08349781,-0.024890311,0.04781968,0.015487108,0.015837047,0.0032154792,0.08672916,-0.08812244,0.054073464,0.057343423,0.053316034,-0.021403644,0.016332215,0.062436085,0.07254687,0.04542024,-0.031751845,0.0046140584,-0.029476753,0.0011547074,-0.002665691,-0.037106916,0.0014590163,-0.052046012,-0.052453365,-0.012569479,-0.0071323905,-0.05432993,-0.015498986,-0.0043880697,-0.041157905,0.009043729,-0.011890186,0.09610344,-0.0065949536,0.07214237,-0.0679401,-0.013107524,-0.0376191,-0.018029755,-0.026424112,0.09492194,0.043894447,0.001790164,0.044215266,0.017133228,-0.038782924,-0.017679075,0.034530625,-0.03731705,0.05076014,0.06770437,0.067413926,-2.816274E-4,0.0013417904,0.014843508,-0.016413072,-0.08203986,0.034855943,0.042756155,-0.03874985,0.08771903,-0.03134482,0.035304703,0.048899982,0.0010087887,0.079834506,0.04511917,0.026048183,-0.053553395,0.05265415,-0.018337917,-0.009589879,0.010232666,0.008602688,9.544399E-4,-0.061269812,-0.0020471332,-0.023715632,0.026724033,0.03743626,-0.0