c({id:"EasyDao:1",text:"EasyDAO: One-stop shop for data source configuration\nA DAO, or Data Access Object, is a universal interface to a collection of\nobjects. foam.dao.EasyDAO configures itself automatically, based on the\nconfiguration flags you specify when creating an EasyDAO.\n\nTo store your class in an EasyDAO, just add an id property:\n\n    foam.CLASS({\n      package: 'fun',\n      name: 'StoreMe',\n      properties: [ 'id' ],\n    });\n\nYour id must be unique for separate objects, so either set it carefully or\nset EasyDAO.seqNo to true to assign id automatically.",sourceId:"EasyDao",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.043610405,0.016781328,-0.08722064,0.047725316,0.012999626,-0.028815722,0.047171384,-0.0057470123,-0.10302485,-0.029982688,0.01666243,-0.042459693,-0.012020681,-0.034248922,0.06634921,0.059786703,0.023665346,-0.068767115,-0.010539695,0.09167407,0.07879173,0.0013111972,-0.012622386,-0.009394021,-0.08946785,0.05828886,0.05127458,-0.0078031905,0.025878549,-0.07090036,0.03855516,0.033958286,-0.036143094,-0.008446313,0.010581042,-0.0123339165,0.042066373,0.005588458,0.017859476,0.019250246,0.014276028,0.017478637,-0.03193355,-0.0033937036,-0.013796928,-0.034104202,-0.04185906,0.011872167,0.07506221,-0.011376913,0.021464333,-0.026682038,0.0024024644,0.01761778,0.0032256334,0.10194503,0.013381473,0.046141338,-0.042319566,0.018999105,0.026104674,-0.02426522,0.13136557,0.068360515,-0.0034482854,-0.03986997,0.013845535,0.04970491,-0.047175355,-0.080129884,0.009396206,0.012745549,0.015217835,0.039184876,0.067362145,0.035466194,-0.043301504,0.019732622,0.04942494,0.0143969795,-0.028070562,0.021677727,0.07326525,0.028380333,-0.018456945,0.031071624,0.044338837,0.02819667,-0.033200823,7.6143985E-4,0.018456923,-0.041989665,0.04414563,-0.02148252,0.004807298,-0.014478003,0.030713372,0.008351251,-0.03184243,-0.052342214,-0.10961057,0.040970825,0.051375654,0.022653174,0.041101202,-0.062824875,0.013310479,-0.09043141,-0.01761155,