c({id:"ExportingFlows:1",text:"Exporting (\"Lifting\") Flows\nWhen you build or edit a Reflow flow in the running app, it lives in the flowDAO on the\nserver. To capture it \u2014 to check it into source control, move it between environments, or hand\nit to someone else \u2014 you \"lift\" it out of the DAO as text. This guide covers the reliable way to\ndo that from the UI.",sourceId:"ExportingFlows",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.11871148,0.002804372,-0.055817567,0.041613728,0.061671797,-0.06028081,0.016231159,0.0020454833,0.006672188,-0.013036711,-0.040849358,-0.022187423,-0.0882462,-0.08228749,-0.014654479,0.02361182,-8.87632E-4,0.049369726,-0.06894744,-0.014232327,0.07382737,-0.0020589174,-0.02952537,-0.005178694,0.072622165,0.05591168,-0.0357597,0.03015453,0.04904135,-0.04576071,-0.039778657,0.09181119,-0.09266183,0.03428368,-0.025709491,0.15344603,0.044887695,0.018809505,-0.050616115,-0.07043192,0.07554307,0.056614906,0.016787527,0.009231476,-0.033013795,0.0029799691,-0.059870765,6.278355E-4,0.036945496,0.012859459,-0.049548645,-0.0038874294,-0.036122177,0.10953687,-0.018275833,0.06191621,0.09650296,-0.05668686,0.0064342017,0.07387853,-8.8448834E-4,0.020397462,-8.131865E-5,0.08439339,-0.035492953,0.032822695,-0.08334197,0.078583494,0.029545283,-0.13865213,-0.0051073567,-0.03969711,-0.038948957,-0.09137235,0.03938021,-0.053223815,-0.054719962,0.023225432,-0.0430086,-0.012820489,0.12583369,0.036074657,-0.01534667,0.10049795,-0.044703804,0.11332984,0.048148863,-0.008637506,0.06631821,0.09864557,-0.08136458,-0.036984082,0.041593924,0.014762739,0.00846277,-0.0345155,-0.021109277,0.0017727679,-0.040741663,0.045165144,0.016510213,0.026559109,0.03388849,0.008472587,-0.0010983398,-0.099999376,0.06729978,0.008654897,-0.02421898,0.052023858,0.0074489056,0.04357568,0.059428975,-0.036259674,0.024644906,-0.03553526,-0.09641489,-0.061829187,-0.13531867,0.03383317,-0.007113644,-0.019352423,-0.0110501,-0.051478144,0.06612023,-0.034825694,0.023