c({id:"FSM:1",text:"State Machines (FSM)\nFOAM models a finite state machine as an Enum. Each value is one state. A model holds the\ncurrent state in a StateMachine property, and FSMDAO enforces the transition rules on the\nserver. This guide covers how to define one and use it, and lists the mistakes that are easy\nto make.\n\nCitations are to src/foam/lang/ unless noted. Line numbers drift; if a citation no longer\nlines up, look for the named method.\n\nFor Enum basics, read Enum.md first.\n\n---",sourceId:"FSM",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.060153678,-0.008465549,-0.057679757,-0.017586488,0.005838839,0.011864252,-0.0159827,0.040735643,-0.053505104,0.024325818,0.0054834276,-0.0017350995,0.05176405,-0.03107613,-0.034987263,-0.011361011,0.011550417,-0.037617132,0.03677512,0.006922988,0.09112231,0.055948995,-0.09236265,0.0391552,-0.068911135,0.08296062,-0.0014829978,0.0064616753,-0.0012273152,-0.10160728,-0.067876846,0.005333249,0.019442752,0.015416377,0.06304574,-0.033426654,-1.8843141E-4,-0.044317625,-0.03579108,-0.045509506,0.04312122,-0.012239982,0.062386602,-0.028243491,0.06797174,0.02887955,-0.009868726,-0.009807202,0.0064097713,0.061187353,4.0319952E-4,-0.012078684,0.037151497,0.067860045,0.040255833,0.014898182,0.08242794,0.030362265,-0.11202373,-0.0051273177,0.005908852,-0.04133821,-0.091321155,0.0030238754,0.0888133,0.056881778,-0.026693089,-0.0067706793,-0.05199792,0.020004777,-0.026989361,-0.020850029,0.06370408,0.037568733,-0.032476615,-0.01081484,0.056407146,0.020163339,0.04138858,0.017958298,-0.09835111,-0.029658776,0.010817573,-0.09250704,0.015477285,3.8261135E-4,-0.0028386484,-0.030110452,0.093583986,0.03694812,0.04308248,-0.026169438,-3.683162E-4,-0.042497408,0.06096601,0.06522952,-0.06204595,0.012495841,0.042473085,0.012338738,-0.053927198,0.053855237,0.06551243,0.029551098,-0.023191335,0.0043464666,0.055532727,0.053961005,-0.047737204,-0.005482049,-0.035043284,0.024070242,0.08326124,0.021298802,0.027462495,-0.125