c({id:"FSM:14",text:"Related files\n| File | Role |\n|------|------|\n| FSM.js | foam.FSM(), StateMachineModel, and the StateMachine property type |\n| StateMachineEnum.js / .java | Base class for states: transitions, guards, permissions, lifecycle |\n| StateTransition.js | History record |\n| FSMDAO.java | Server-side enforcement on put |\n| NamedPropertyInfo.java | Looks up a property by name on each object's class, for polymorphic DAOs |\n| FSMDiagramView.js | Renders a state machine as a diagram |\n| FSMStepConfig.js, FSMStepConfigViews.js, FSMProxyDetailView.js | Shows a state machine's payloads as a step wizard |\n| test/TestStateMachine.js, test/TestStateMachineHolder.js | Minimal working state machine and holder |\n| test/StateMachineEnumTest.js, test/FSMDAOTest.js, test/FSMDAOLifecycleTest.js | Behaviour tests |",sourceId:"FSM",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.11600609,0.043294914,-0.057622846,-0.013249821,0.035757132,-0.03270822,0.042953517,0.019376328,-0.07044745,-0.012804673,-0.018263625,-0.004664581,-0.006269816,0.05287333,0.0019811618,0.021421593,0.017624648,-0.006993106,-0.040600184,0.015676238,0.13085988,-0.01958414,-7.3066965E-4,-0.03757572,-0.023974348,0.056665957,0.015210798,-0.004544271,-0.02616153,-0.081981726,-0.02105395,0.0032327017,-0.011376339,0.028366871,0.047132727,0.070436195,0.10119895,-0.06528722,-0.0055426825,-0.05798068,0.072514415,0.101949655,0.06589566,-0.017755661,-0.009686171,0.042779397,-0.0013216101,-0.10636295,-0.019855311,-0.011049555,-0.07802014,-0.028562335,0.07669092,0.07356914,-0.013678648,0.03292605,0.073210225,0.051937144,-0.08115814,-0.01587778,-0.015526413,-0.025735857,-0.03077366,0.015883304,0.030025056,0.07660057,-0.012619223,0.012734779,0.049073674,-0.045834754,-0.010541428,0.031942703,0.06812683,0.0154096335,-0.021005845,-0.04541549,-0.0033636433,0.05646675,0.053828016,-0.1728114,-0.036484174,-0.052698817,0.0073581934,0.029753778,-0.015309149,0.08126007,-0.06424178,-0.044763837,0.0673