c({id:"Guides:6",text:"Compaction\nCovers FOAM journal compaction: the five-step process (block, roll/backup, unblock, compact, complete) that rewrites many delta entries into one entry per object to speed replay. Includes configuration, custom sinks, rollback procedure, and gotchas.\n\nNDiff\nCovers NDiff, a debugging and change-tracking tool for CSpecs that captures initial journal state, compares it to runtime state, and enables visual before/after comparison and restore. Configured via setNdiff(true) on EasyDAO.\n\nDaoEventsAndRefresh\nExplains the three DAO events (put/remove/reset), how they bubble up through the decorator chain to views, how to subscribe with listen/on.put.sub, and when to force a manual refresh.\n\n---",sourceId:"Guides",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.06182793,-0.02830212,-0.060161624,0.019566018,0.016968844,-0.03326722,-0.051003195,-0.025691614,-0.053157825,-0.026859598,-0.04066899,0.025550375,-0.03404622,-0.042790134,-0.033095997,-0.05730227,0.010559241,0.0044184504,-0.009576015,0.021489847,0.052087307,-6.5084756E-4,-0.034984294,-0.0063069994,-0.029119182,0.028717423,-0.07079695,-0.03433762,0.048416063,-0.12760517,0.01935879,0.032504212,-0.009276044,-0.014878139,0.037714627,-9.1417605E-5,0.012392321,0.011894467,-0.074193686,-0.006350222,0.005018497,-5.4337556E-4,-0.0368303,-0.008135665,-0.014339966,-0.04951965,-0.091925815,-0.013374537,0.0049156738,-0.0026202118,0.029804017,-0.03436687,6.831525E-5,0.047106218,0.07156954,0.058491487,0.021605525,0.03250784,-0.037850097,-0.025459612,0.04161334,-0.0138063105,-0.046301175,0.10552034,0.04638669,0.017651537,0.089973725,0.037858196,0.041885424,-0.038100023,-0.11223125,0.051330663,0.033228286,0.0016917619,0.07157605,0.013508048,-0.06558273,0.040900767,-0.025851088,-0.07379427,0.013573149,-0.0129097495,0.035906877,0.017911203,-0.022284944,-0.011721275,0.087067485,0.01619166,0.03786211,-0.0046003945,0.05223889,0.033442877,0.019827249,-0.022433054,-0.074982144,-0.04028