c({id:"Guides:8",text:"ReactivePatterns\nComplete reference for all FOAM3 slot and reactive binding forms: PropertySlot (obj.name$), slot() lookup, deep $ chain via dot(), ExpressionSlot, dynamic(), linkFrom/linkTo two-way binding, and when to use each.\n\nSlots\nConceptual and advanced reference for Slots as observable pointers: the C-pointer analogy, PropertySlot vs SubSlot vs ExpressionSlot types, the $ accessor, deep chains, two-way linking, and why slots are the backbone of FOAM reactive UI.\n\ndynamic\nExplains the difference between model-level property expression: (lazy, pull-based, reactive computed values) and this.dynamic() (eager, push-based reactive DOM content), covering when each fires and their key behavioral differences.\n\nControllerModeAndVisibility\nDocuments the three-layer pipeline \u2014 ControllerMode (CREATE/VIEW/EDIT), per-property Visibility declarations (RW/RO/DISABLED/HIDDEN), and DisplayMode \u2014 that controls whether a property's view is editable, read-only, disabled, or hidden.\n\nModals\nDescribes the modal component hierarchy: Popup (base, full-screen overlay), StyledModal (title/description/action bar), ConfirmationModal (primary/secondary actions), and ApplicationPopup (wizard flows with progress bar and branding). Includes usage guidance for each.\n\nCSSLayout\nWhat a css: block goes through before the browser sees it (installed on first create, the ^ and $token text rewrites), which box scrolls and how to pin a header, hiding with shown, and how popups, modals and the z-index layers stack.\n\nNotifications\nOverview of the notification system: creating Notification objects via notificationDAO, extending the base class for custom types, display via the bell icon and NotificationCitationView, and how to write custom citation views.\n\nQA2\nThe foam.QA2 decision-matrix questionnaire engine: AQL predicates, \"answered\" meaning a stored value, how the next question is chosen, custom question views, and the shape of the generated class.",sourceId:"Guides",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.09604701,-0.007287875,-0.082767144,0.11360118,-0.0021851293,0.013841775,3.593856E-4,0.053330507,0.07225874,0.016494952,-0.012600165,-0.07446774,0.084098205,-0.0147081,0.052181985,0.09853076,0.07958656,-0.07597654,-0.071737066,0.038049307,0.09071161,-0.011100568,-0.027498132,-0.015414098,-0.0921834,0.06984761,-0.04680633,-0.0563454,0.054833755,-0.017047722,0.00204562,0.05043773,-0.005341748,-0.031047078,-0.11211471,-5.094828E-4,0.0684047,4.5687082E-4,-0.028736137,-0.017227232,0.0048689344,0.0013021927,-0.021224348,-0.0873463,0.09461782,-0.014994687,0.0032695546,-0.043146726,-0.0767288,0.013671337,-0.050084475,-0.06800982,0.0076797274,0.11145779,0.04663328,0.009161628,0.009592395,0.029407544,-0.006841271,-0.022475254,-7.488496E-4,-0.00929021,0.0044916617,0.056825392,0.052605387,-0.027167037,-0.027757138,-0.044629637,0.05737212,-0.049849633,-0.0897875,0.030720143,0.06756951,-0.05882669,0.02375424,0.030233582,0.026314853,-0.014363608,0.02155715,-0.08539197,0.010844213,0.06578481,-0.039516456,-0.028706077,0.0388464,0.05948469,-0.008228214,-0.028424969,-0.035462905,0.033137325,0.04817201,-0.036225192,0.046816994,0.03943825,-0.008246794,0.0049692704,0.018066652,0.015355139,-0.01753063,0.031845253,0.014485151,0.039919563,-0.06358566,6.188708E-6,-0.020865997,-0.051634297,-0.09689865,-0.009126068,-0.058487795,0.022878205,-0.03846055,-0.05606703,-0.032517243,-0.03556988,0.006139202,-0.00329247,0.056115936,0.012644117,0.043995325,-0.028870858,0.050513793,-0.0483865,0.0015131009,-0.0176163,0.07276669,-0.053616352,-0.057898402,6.191813E-33,0.040972065,-0.0029897676,-0.08240425,0.056276213,0.12354175,-0.0022459973,0.03967329,-0.023175081,0.045002267,0.009199382,0.06495833,0.16084506,-0.0027859495,0.038513724,0.025848458,-0.10517718,-0.028512,0.021872725,-0.08021402,-0.05123207,0.022183431,0.06007461,-0.051931918,0.015680106,0.07210871,0.06481469,-0.004872373,0.04391134,-0.13219754,0.011731016,