c({id:"Guides:12",text:"email-setup\nStep-by-step guide for configuring email in a FOAM app: creating EmailServiceConfig (SMTP), EmailTemplate, and EmailConfig journal entries, then sending EmailMessage objects through notificationDAO.\n\nEmailSystemArchitecture\nArchitecture overview of FOAM3's email pipeline: the three config entry types (EmailServiceConfig/EmailTemplate/EmailConfig), the rule-driven processing flow, the template variable system, Microsoft Graph integration, and gotchas.\n\nSafari\nShort guide to running FOAM in Safari, which requires building with HTTPS (-J../foam3/deployment/https -a) and accessing https://localhost:8443, plus certificate trust steps in Keychain.\n\n---",sourceId:"Guides",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.004728211,-0.034198143,-0.016943164,-0.022113282,0.078802526,-0.120626844,-0.008644259,-0.049827825,-0.035739236,-0.043714624,0.027828228,-0.07439635,0.019147925,0.05074154,0.09819521,0.099221505,-0.010131337,-0.04953711,0.052844778,0.041737363,0.019959506,-0.04089878,0.031701338,0.008163058,-0.077457845,-0.02549928,-0.0567955,-0.03185683,-0.059432812,-0.011901761,0.07032648,-0.031324256,0.023071827,0.0047118017,-0.02029699,0.011585236,0.13157181,0.033331957,-0.046853576,-0.018610971,-0.0022425312,-0.035396077,-0.0070130154,-0.0014379864,0.019735482,0.007801041,0.006788845,0.044777587,-0.036635984,0.028994566,-0.002919197,-0.14758596,-0.026759097,0.005356295,-0.082924105,0.052130025,-0.031085785,0.05247498,0.07480649,-0.010514231,0.09344126,0.031346742,0.0041536493,0.025334913,0.0060143284,-0.07495764,0.022357238,-0.011632834,-0.015694099,-0.015678959,-0.0649614,-0.019059768,-0.021444893,-0.027958354,-0.02705681,0.090543285,-0.0041980697,0.009909229,-0.020432001,0.04761037,-0.009049049,0.09552517,0.040553715,0.048506808,0.04202678,0.055517606,0.04268403,0.001425057,-0.011771176,0.090296105,0.058795825,-0.08659134,-0.084787846,0.0097986795,0.039041124,0.057081085,-0.038837023,0.0017205188,-0.0824151