c({id:"Health:2",text:"Overview\nThe Health system is intended for monitoring and reporting the status of FOAM applications.\n\nEach instance sends a UDP heartbeat via multicast broadcast, and each instance listens for heartbeats. The healthDAO displays detected instances along with status and heartbeat stats.\n\nThe HealthWebAgent reports the Health Status of an instance, intended to be consumed by Load Balancers (LB) to determine when an instance is in an appropriate state to receive traffic. (see below)\n\nThe heartbeat UDP packet is sent, by default, to multicast address 230.22.41.0 and port 52241.  This address and port must be open on firewalls between instances which use this type of monitoring.",sourceId:"Health",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[4.936177E-4,0.0150823975,-0.022356085,-0.10526395,0.025504831,-0.05185032,0.0064816214,-0.010046192,-0.013142812,-0.022581173,-0.021233674,-0.022669727,0.013896771,-0.04416164,-0.010286781,-0.07734625,0.12071901,-0.14117353,0.014625003,0.038578536,-0.008663039,0.14179139,-0.0896636,0.021757226,-0.07375673,-0.021439163,0.01937781,-0.024747752,0.018049944,0.0019683535,0.079490006,-0.052280866,0.03921446,0.034172595,-0.042264745,0.0011851069,0.07179741,-0.034158565,-0.16079982,0.05733025,0.08537984,-0.057723217,0.017037963,0.009009007,0.037313074,0.01595915,-0.10719794,0.041424286,0.055032272,0.011948775,-0.047569193,-0.037015527,0.02002326,0.14961834,0.06182188,-0.04010603,-0.005268604,0.0020082516,-0.08807326,-0.042947892,0.021331444,0.0071728593,0.07704795,0.05071416,0.024715587,-0.022551173,0.02936938,0.050194252,0.031099288,-0.073295996,-0.09110417,-0.02532646,0.058881406,-0.020912427,0.006378015,0.104018636,-0.035091046,-0.07331002,0.03343194,-0.019872643,-0.04415895,-0.018645613,-0.024787428,0.040484786,-0.027126234,-0.010861183,-0.004388914,-0.05599071,-0.017999994,0.027419107,-0.018939937,0.04261115,-0.028950645,0.05817355,-0.06836414,0.041312926,-0.027499659,0.0059612,0.019340497,0.