c({id:"Intro:5",text:"5. Data Access Layer\nFOAM provides a unified DAO (Data Access Object) pattern for data persistence:\n- In-memory storage\n- Local storage\n- IndexedDB\n- RESTful API backends\n- WebSocket real-time sync\n- Custom adapters\n\nYou can switch between storage mechanisms without changing your application code.",sourceId:"Intro",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.09421399,-0.012810929,-0.08537734,0.036292262,-0.02971023,-0.050526552,0.013440933,-0.03004409,-0.036969975,-0.034179952,0.016747206,0.060321283,-0.004105476,-0.055775788,0.032789074,0.06643983,0.08011208,-4.70746E-4,5.098327E-4,0.04714725,0.03890002,0.028755842,-0.083333634,-0.015804311,0.002794898,0.05053291,0.031583674,-0.060348265,0.045277115,-0.06755573,0.015831457,-0.015171685,-0.07487155,0.029255226,-0.042890236,-0.023946894,0.023215575,-0.055414077,-0.09844058,-0.017351583,0.02099983,-0.019714765,-0.075193845,0.018324286,-0.01456215,-0.0021967802,-0.044041123,0.03729389,0.002084459,-0.015514897,-0.017675284,-4.828601E-4,-0.015301809,0.093921125,0.01004529,0.024871828,0.009772177,0.072246686,-0.07990796,0.032647457,0.058318876,0.015048037,0.07008234,0.04532089,0.009535057,0.04126693,0.020572398,0.035340935,0.059578363,-0.08173828,-0.036271214,0.04292974,-0.032575257,-0.015681872,0.010859435,0.024353651,-0.032116044,0.006244377,0.0844257,-0.026283618,-0.0087085925,0.08633727,0.038822897,0.00262304,-0.056704726,0.0077932193,0.016033662,-0.017460095,-0.075304344,-0.05843891,0.04931711,-0.02558063,-0.010868504,-0.050740123,-0.043059833,-0.064511865,0.0180862,0.037550785,0.021321246,-0.030292187,-0.018064406,0.04939239,-0.061849706,0.02296273,0.010273908,-0.13317381,0.029898046,-0.049101036,-0.053933464,0.06787636,-0.06645864,0.019652797,-0.06392706,-0.029423751,-0.005439389,-0.050569993,-0.08364014,-0.027934263,-0.030631812,-0.022671845,0.006891003,-0.05133565,0.0030998783,-0.027881965,0.036729332,-0.03005468,-0.033740968,2.9388218E-33,0.0050211526,-0.0596426