c({id:"JobQueue:1",text:"Job\nServer-side execution of long-running, client-initiated tasks, with pollable status.\n\nA task submitted through DAO.cmd() runs inside the caller's request and is bounded by the\ngateway's one-minute timeout. Work that does not care about that limit \u2014 a large match, an\nimport, a report \u2014 is submitted to the jobDAO instead. The put returns immediately with a\nUUID, the work runs on the server's thread pool, and the submitter polls the job by id to\nwatch it progress.",sourceId:"JobQueue",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.13027012,0.014614989,-0.07065616,0.030311987,0.022243084,-0.08118642,-0.016075315,-0.080925845,-6.3803483E-4,0.023272008,-0.0688822,0.08374609,-0.050352298,-0.03803589,-0.056126878,-0.0474598,0.14360397,-0.06892587,-0.03770677,-0.041782495,0.045660313,0.021843538,-0.012540342,7.224924E-4,-0.071829595,-0.028083606,0.006683564,-0.03555341,0.017405517,-0.031834606,-0.027704913,-0.023217712,-0.03577852,-0.010615166,0.010819259,0.08847547,0.03513773,-0.031076532,-0.029859371,-0.057628162,0.110856876,-0.02072304,0.015592243,0.09535561,-0.020340312,0.0057795467,-0.0043743453,-0.038648237,-0.019720528,-0.052741714,-0.07024531,-0.011046944,0.043879647,0.08665811,-0.026807554,0.0366084,0.016089756,-0.01732176,-0.06099646,0.010124013,9.2159586E-5,-0.041111242,0.0051420196,0.08858593,0.09191359,-0.032625396,-0.013598526,-0.0443396,-0.002600843,-0.1085973,0.027922431,-0.040733997,-0.09679703,0.014859853,0.036825698,0.022144126,0.02545694,-0.064455055,0.058860656,-0.13315493,0.014980859,-0.008774311,-0.012794252,0.056992542,-0.041914172,0.0077489894,0.071440704,0.06880131,0.084534176,-0.012544808,-0.05396202,-0.0146087725,-0.07377056,-0.045382388,-0.026237817,-0.0035582213,0.08150091,0.08962989,-0.036283236,0.013052279,0.015758285,0.05075859,-0.039926916,0.006392497,0.039854776,-0.06375808,0.0069732256,0.019984033,0.01119692,5.2057765E-4,-0.005698294,0.051709644,0.05046123,0.073649436,-0.029057