c({id:"JournalFiles:0",text:"JournalFiles\nJournal file naming, generations and the non-blocking cutover: what replays at boot, how rolling freezes a generation, and how a snapshot supersedes one.\n\nKeywords: journal, jdao, roll, generation, compaction, gzip, snapshot, naming, knowledge\n\n<flow name=\"JournalFiles\" category=\"DOC/GUIDE\" spid=\"foam\" description=\"Journal file naming, generations and the non-blocking cutover: what replays at boot, how rolling freezes a generation, and how a snapshot supersedes one.\" keywords=\"journal,jdao,roll,generation,compaction,gzip,snapshot,naming,knowledge\"/>",sourceId:"JournalFiles",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.08784179,0.020836016,-0.08191678,-0.008858301,0.033594396,-0.023765825,-0.047709122,0.002246818,-0.018022468,0.024210902,0.008109225,0.08641826,-0.0129475575,-0.05992918,-0.04441523,-0.036339533,-0.1010214,-0.007855143,-0.005073792,0.023575725,0.06080616,0.017856605,0.0022445421,0.011904058,0.034924746,0.038636617,-0.12392389,-0.027605375,-0.0056020427,-0.038783867,0.034861896,0.07639383,0.024255456,0.048631027,0.0776774,0.028917147,0.011435073,0.065444745,-0.0026005236,-0.001220544,-0.008803074,-0.02612239,-0.039851274,0.010417216,0.016225507,-0.05641248,-0.048728175,-0.016176948,-0.10767715,0.103559405,-0.11775785,-0.03314262,-0.056687735,0.0837697,0.11408396,0.0018017273,-0.01647902,0.018193709,-0.08440302,-0.0060036904,-0.025088465,-0.01572935,-0.1449251,0.051157314,0.012625971,0.010940151,0.09571426,0.03063645,0.039140094,-0.038125083,-0.10883638,0.056808766,0.003907885,-0.013827231,-0.0036079253,0.047105595,-0.01756843,0.073266216,-0.034420878,-0.12839192,0.029448349,-0.066979684,0.0216703,0.003240557,-0.058035452,0.01246577,0.10555991,-0.045178793,0.02696325,0.026532074,-0.034597997,-0.032813746,0.10736772,-0.020273123,-0.017066937,0.011617007,-2.4724894E-4,-0.02031187,0.020953316,0.0034960848,0.04982813,0.061686322,0.041646764,-0.01593868,0.02125531,-0.086334944,-0.0279