c({id:"Journals:3",text:"How Journals Work\nJournals use a simple text-based format with three core operation types<cite />:\n\n- c({...}) - Records a create operation\n- p({...}) - Records an update operation\n- r({...}) - Records a remove (delete) operation\n- // comment - Adds audit trail metadata (when the model does not implement CreatedByAware and LastModifiedByAware) 4\n- v({...}) - Records the application version for subsequent put() operations.\n\nThe journal stores objects as JSON with delta compression - only changed properties are written rather than the entire object, significantly reducing file size 5 .",sourceId:"Journals",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.02726963,0.12636416,-0.057634745,0.06665195,0.027920365,-0.027916912,-0.035501827,0.010108442,0.09848157,0.06049782,-0.048246857,0.10173669,-0.037531357,0.00812896,-0.009303145,-5.598977E-4,-0.030671418,0.026173925,-0.05045138,0.06634591,0.10377112,0.010723119,0.03288196,0.022766141,0.04204856,-0.008388033,-0.10902103,-0.049999874,0.031969517,-0.02395206,-0.008746365,0.05636786,0.037832256,-0.015244285,-0.012221312,-0.010173611,0.046195682,0.013386471,0.039143562,-0.018642865,0.0015273968,0.019511605,-0.040521305,-0.008158438,-0.013916605,-0.062463686,-0.0011721783,0.008405047,-0.08770932,0.035398137,-0.05063119,0.017589446,-0.055559833,-7.833535E-4,0.03183568,-0.042151604,-0.044317327,0.048254065,-0.1161366,-0.015065061,0.009202688,0.023341944,-0.10736024,0.026414717,0.01658047,0.009832785,0.074287556,-0.010816459,0.0049080336,-0.08742832,-0.02063501,0.038264584,-0.01760977,0.022685826,-0.022565339,0.036341,0.006152668,0.10436922,-0.0118652405,-0.054864753,0.040301315,-0.05831422,0.071894,0.062071484,-0.049878284,-0.044742648,0.10480589,-0.017281882,-0.035866406,0.004618647,0.026969116,0.016351212,0.041324988,-0.07178158,-0.030081296,0.007324082,-0.05229936,0.053429235,0.08538517,0.015093518,0.13366553,0.13069743,0.04075752,0.015853586,0.018116666,-0.092846036,0.044892