c({id:"Journals:5",text:"Notes\nJournals are typically used with JDAO (Journaled DAO) which wraps another DAO and automatically journals all operations 10 . The -j build flag deletes runtime journals<cite />. Journal files can be manually edited to seed initial data or fix issues, as they're just text files with a simple format<cite />.",sourceId:"Journals",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.1083589,0.029586917,-0.06713859,0.013448336,0.044071704,-0.023179399,-0.009274099,-0.03336022,0.0078054965,-0.005974552,-0.016479196,0.1058966,-0.111100145,0.0042008557,0.047867138,0.038513415,-0.020718204,0.016597472,0.040673755,0.04554866,0.055511978,0.024271557,0.019345902,-0.035145007,0.06418077,0.03956415,-0.0077743814,-0.048773207,-0.04958846,-0.01365879,-0.027609864,0.07319645,0.018046757,-0.025184853,2.6128886E-4,0.023619631,0.021283483,0.041660648,0.033890508,-0.02051431,-0.044539724,0.060536128,-0.030929197,-0.03517004,-0.05157095,-0.07895189,-0.105271846,-0.043902013,-0.07217173,0.05530445,-0.049183242,0.0055458536,-0.013124178,-0.046245568,0.079418905,0.014735749,0.007523623,0.08686399,-0.05958344,-0.008282826,0.072125286,0.067126594,-0.099359974,0.018372115,0.027578222,-0.010838072,0.06808884,0.036817983,0.03885059,-0.0705304,-0.018941578,-8.6910196E-4,0.03193872,-0.049494736,-0.025272433,0.072784565,-0.029531531,0.080620706,0.010641724,-0.10019882,0.034126457,-0.05356477,0.05595356,0.043674536,-0.057112113,0.06517422,0.028195266,0.004861321,0.07008788,0.058948733,0.039344084,-0.027589409,0.0052118944,-0.031929463,-0.019352864,-0.028850272,0.026645882,0.054326523,0.06536617,0.024066348,0.0878737,0.13172871,0.09397715,0.084021546,0.02502296,-0.02779922,-0.084213056,-0.01768888,-0.0071257795,-0.0015237121,0.043022282,0.04783381,0.028962715,-0.06433606,0.008385796,-0.035725486,-0.025836973,-0.045365166,-0.043116502,0.08488638,0.027364098,-0.012485488,-0.08601796,0.0047955196,-0.03664512,0.0914467,-0.07400508,1.993932E-33,0.08928267,-0.04317