c({id:"LLM:6",text:"Less surface area for hallucination. When an LLM generates a thousand lines of procedural implementation, subtle errors \u2014 a missed edge case, an off-by-one, a wrong algorithm \u2014 hide in the volume. When it generates fifty lines of declarative model, there is far less room for hallucination-induced bugs. The framework's implementation is shared, tested, and not regenerated each time.",sourceId:"LLM",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[0.020541474,0.017185673,0.023007128,-0.05447671,0.020313611,-0.10331881,-0.11693297,-0.0077493675,-0.0609068,0.03071821,-0.043096736,-0.057180382,0.056207053,-0.038327493,-0.010830696,0.028386068,-0.028863559,0.07985015,-0.026600583,-0.032469064,0.019571928,0.020946113,-0.06660462,0.005495163,0.094880514,0.03725232,-0.0043047112,0.018374568,0.08709972,-0.11325993,0.053439815,0.15312943,0.015149199,-0.0035713785,0.030396631,-2.5270818E-4,-0.07387823,0.033293236,-0.008981146,-0.016148655,-0.06965122,0.059730846,0.018450405,0.036507025,0.057579998,-0.010727381,-0.057299323,-0.0012961476,-0.04301408,-0.07292984,-0.026359046,-0.020615244,-9.5833564E-4,0.008469855,-0.02273472,0.026988484,0.10556896,-0.004939674,-0.013842192,-0.014279788,-0.0012470922,0.010424753,-0.06071168,-0.0013006459,0.08147604,0.025644343,-0.015923118,-0.017673112,0.02562302,0.03483483,0.01490649,0.013916974,-0.053354125,0.058039155,0.043643035,-0.022459153,-0.0695926,-0.028280897,0.02401117,-0.018845955,-0.050790135,0.03938858,-0.028580764,0.001801874,0.023179324,-0.042653717,-0.02755615,-0.010773689,0.032279503,0.06301578,0.03472619,-0.049230654,-0.07981063,0.0011741855,-0.020251947,0.010357293,0.04814867,-0.06551376,-0.015713887,0.07217372,-0.009909337,-0.012696305,0.05855586,-0.05668838,0.019371508,-0.02319297,0.110487014,0.067926325,-0.025063466,-0.01739012,0.027725488,0.048426572,-0.016218863,0.01817388,0.033084486,-0.024361184,0.050056506,-0.027352918,0.043364193,0.022721125,0.018782811,0.017565805,-0.016441511