c({id:"Listeners:7",text:"Idled:     x  x  x  x  x  x  x  x  +--[delay]--+ fires AFTER the burst\n                                                   (after silence + delay)\n\nisMerged guarantees a response within delay ms of the first call, even if calls keep coming. isIdled waits for calm \u2014 if calls never stop, the listener never fires.\n\ndelay property\n\ndelay sets the timer duration in milliseconds for isMerged and isIdled. Default is 16ms (roughly one frame).\n\nmergeDelay is a legacy alias \u2014 it reads and writes delay. Use delay in new code.\n\n---",sourceId:"Listeners",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.028401822,-0.037706174,0.004300875,0.01914096,0.0032206508,-0.035111733,0.12400403,0.04879066,0.06380469,-0.032916617,0.07699148,-0.028987275,-0.08586789,-0.033910956,-0.035251398,0.051802605,-0.010628464,0.013396672,-0.096420266,-0.04258927,0.029369343,0.101315856,-0.009119126,0.03711219,0.012931547,-0.035615608,-0.022881484,-0.059279744,0.06586999,-0.04702878,0.041220628,0.026798954,0.042588558,0.017844798,-0.00501642,0.006879935,0.063926265,0.053768836,0.0076313172,-0.021784691,0.028352644,0.0036557775,-0.042818528,-0.035284802,-0.10463437,-0.0054748706,-0.029972633,-0.02720676,-0.018026037,-0.016234957,0.011429465,0.0028015082,-0.003768635,0.009286421,0.038221538,0.057168674,-0.02173007,0.039292738,-0.029388765,0.0599274,-0.102330804,0.023373203,-0.013830283,0.050879564,3.4702782E-4,0.03116054,0.08984375,0.016730124,-0.029439148,-0.038453154,0.0062634028,-0.0060322555,-0.015807891,-0.04462422,-0.029740391,0.032753654,0.11482681,-0.046312682,0.0064666923,0.012257115,-0.01845599,-0.13056324,-0.03974599,-0.062622726,0.029917844,0.002291455,-0.0142104905,0.031959374,-0.039757818,-0.0039766426,-0.008936508,0.00492381,-0.013154457,-0.009838619,0.029393623,0.036490444,0.072017364,0.03233956,0.0030501124,0.05789934,-0.03342681,0.0050085867,-0.07875578,-0.008999771,-0.02071121,-0.03941555,0.047016025,-0.0011037191,-0.00857516