c({id:"MLang:3",text:"Notes\n- MLang predicates are serializable and can be sent between client and server 7\n- The Expressions mixin provides convenient shorthand methods for all MLang operations 8\n- MLang expressions can reference properties directly (e.g., User.NAME) which provides type safety and introspection 9\n- Custom functions can be created using FUNC in JavaScript, though they can't be optimized by the DAO like standard MLang predicates 10",sourceId:"MLang",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.11904494,0.04645349,0.010079847,-0.017865842,-0.028137963,0.033268973,0.0819972,0.04222845,0.0109968325,-0.027906366,-0.09428435,-0.03377805,0.012537568,0.015974484,0.0825923,0.016540792,0.003708772,0.07764472,-0.011276578,-0.014001704,0.10293366,0.019426757,-0.085437104,0.037035484,0.022970246,-0.049175262,-0.030347789,-0.0019589725,0.11805987,0.03620804,-0.00244115,0.076298624,0.0033891138,0.04077461,-0.14596948,0.116184786,-0.012648017,0.022082234,0.036563773,-0.047401406,0.0026821648,0.010508547,-0.0046810517,0.004447723,0.010768855,-0.023519365,-0.07887771,0.038373988,-0.1006344,0.03974195,-0.0511009,-0.0061606853,-0.05959489,-0.015232135,0.10910574,-0.038504973,-0.03537539,-0.023566412,-0.0440964,0.020455914,-0.04742567,-0.065745674,-0.023289472,0.04033727,0.028666396,0.007390539,-0.02923847,0.018682728,-0.013154232,0.06337642,0.0034562857,0.015675109,0.004585055,-0.0062632165,-0.017572073,0.07501735,-0.009916057,0.010867555,-0.01180231,0.0035055494,-0.063786566,-0.022506543,0.01305432,0.039284043,0.012174212,0.05722158,-0.058085047,-0.002823337,0.030649891,0.018553289,-0.056283537,-0.004535827,0.062863424,-0.047029823,-0.06107041,-0.013747249,-0.03356276,-0.039359733,0.030589195,0.052199516,-0.046659414,0.18540251,0.0025237426,-0.10004837,-0.01904285,-0.008117568,-0.0025583592,-0.033692308,-0.020160642,-0.018876666,-0.055293195,0.077374324,-0.015778255,-0.11889187,-0.052922875,-0.024381578,0.010885099,-0.13479574,0.07179903,0.02591