c({id:"Memento:1",text:"Memento & Routing\nHow FOAM syncs UI state (current menu, route, filters, tab selection, ...) into the browser URL hash, so it survives refresh and is bookmarkable/back-forward navigable. Two pieces: foam.u2.memento.Memento (the encode/decode engine) and foam.u2.Router (a controller mixin built on top of it for route-driven view switching).\n\n---",sourceId:"Memento",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.0508738,-0.053273797,-0.04672394,-0.021539748,0.043767616,-0.02667593,-0.02676317,-0.03519725,0.0031139795,-0.031098166,0.017582197,0.05823845,-0.016267547,-0.012329231,-0.024252018,0.07304764,0.056285523,0.0045398697,0.025787333,-0.021130292,0.046745714,0.022651782,-0.024987807,-0.022154544,-0.01003395,0.12427574,0.017701715,-0.066679426,0.016468715,-0.058519762,0.046452258,-0.01385923,-0.067890376,-0.03356608,-0.0862611,-0.02734136,-0.022982806,-0.046217147,-0.032185797,-0.06399556,-0.023004493,-0.02004188,-0.01300886,0.034154005,0.0059778215,-0.035482243,-0.026404547,0.06888481,0.014989324,0.029539397,-0.010850636,-0.026315022,-0.03580903,0.03254688,0.017230395,0.07282162,-0.028748272,0.0540763,-0.07092286,0.06143845,-0.009225563,-0.03751801,0.08536002,0.022961792,0.03319738,-9.2631613E-4,-0.022871414,0.01618411,-0.013708851,-0.059716694,-0.037271794,-0.04843616,0.03956719,-0.057010125,0.034771144,-0.0017025166,-0.0071165515,-0.03249954,-0.022785751,-0.028357605,0.004826221,-0.03671533,0.045562524,-0.047407895,0.10067296,0.038560167,0.045361,-0.07360824,-0.027100256,0.013836553,-0.052649524,-0.06280079,0.05512178,-0.04678314,-0.057024762,-0.065107696,0.0028980342,0.06582186,-0.04952999,0.040316094,-0.008946437,0.050654158,-0.016993022,-0.0177577,-0.023220055,-0.008775637,0.06018041,0.09689364,0.057471145,0.10134453,-0.06350996,0.024323506,-0.010094037,1.6243257E-5,0.0027738933,-0.08725693,0.007731148,0.06207521,0.09276737,9.387653E-4,-0.021375269,-0.03189999,0.036376745,-0.07890944,-0.040697593,-0.031068899,0.0770