c({id:"MixinsAndImplements:1",text:"Key Differences\n| Aspect | implements: | mixins: |\n|--------|---------------|-----------|\n| Purpose | Declare interface implementation or safe mix-ins; can be used for interfaces with or without implementation | Copy all axioms from another model into this class |\n| Override handling | Inserts a new level in the class's axiomMap_ so overridden properties see the correct super-property | No special handling; installs axioms directly |\n| Property installation | Skips installing properties already present on the class | Installs all own axioms unconditionally |\n| Error handling | Throws if the interface/mixin does not exist | Warns if the mixin does not exist but continues |",sourceId:"MixinsAndImplements",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.024665777,0.017899713,0.035863828,-0.028314423,0.026170297,-0.0060286447,-0.0034762393,0.040315185,-0.11617415,-0.010556407,0.07102733,-0.0600694,0.02744214,-0.057121113,0.0045583853,-0.0136733055,0.060525343,-0.007612719,-0.0743579,0.05740717,0.05992825,-0.033334453,-0.06514617,0.045280572,-0.0796955,0.09402008,0.026806127,-0.022291018,0.06047146,-0.022686979,-0.044687375,0.14493194,-0.05847442,0.056178633,-0.08960567,0.011358456,0.08077654,0.008869132,0.01165552,-0.048125885,-0.046682674,-0.027291328,0.005742756,0.004542182,0.017737333,-0.024022555,-0.037772913,-0.084040925,-0.019836957,-0.051502768,-0.051323522,0.03156853,-0.010984175,0.026334846,0.14616285,0.05062212,-1.503331E-4,0.047885995,-0.063543305,-0.045655902,-0.07110683,0.046911728,-0.044453807,0.029339997,-0.006285616,0.03101051,-0.053106733,0.044854116,0.029284848,0.07238827,-0.04994347,-0.02378463,0.018927561,0.02246286,-9.0437627E-4,0.025201555,0.05256518,0.024849538,-0.0172803,-0.016154105,-0.09330562,0.0155371195,0.020565541,-0.014052507,5.5098545E-4,0.028299075,-0.029376958,-0.09781013,0.030362114,-0.016802868,-0.013163701,0.02680937,0.020408457,-0.04996822,0.12515937,0.010186317,-0.014283981,