// Modified by admin admin (42) at 2026-10-02T11:20:51.009+0000
c({id:"Modals:1",text:"Modal Component Hierarchy\nThe FOAM3 framework has a clear hierarchy of modal components, with Popup serving as the base class for all modal dialogs 1 .\n\nBase Component: Popup\n\nPopup is the foundational modal component that provides core modal functionality 2 :\n\n- Full-screen transparent overlay with centered content\n- Background click to close functionality\n- Close button with keyboard shortcut support (Escape key) 3\n- Basic styling with shadow and border radius 4\n\nStyledModal: Standardized Modal Design\n\nStyledModal extends Popup to provide a consistent, styled modal interface 5 :\n\nKey Features:\n- Title support: Built-in title header with consistent styling 6\n- Description section: Optional description text below the title 7\n- Action bar: Standardized button placement at the bottom 8\n- Modal styles: Support for different visual styles (DEFAULT, DESTRUCTIVE, WARN) with colored top bars 9\n- Responsive sizing: Configurable maxHeight and maxWidth properties 10\n\nConfirmationModal: Action-Oriented Dialogs\n\nConfirmationModal extends StyledModal for yes/no confirmation scenarios 11 :\n\nSpecialized Features:\n- Primary/Secondary actions: Built-in support for confirm/cancel button patterns 12\n- Action execution: Automatically calls the provided action and closes the dialog 13\n\nApplicationPopup: Wizard and Flow Context\n\nApplicationPopup extends Popup for complex application flows like wizards 14 :\n\nAdvanced Features:\n- Application branding: Integrated logo and header styling 15\n- Progress tracking: Built-in progress bar support 16\n- Action management: Support for leading actions (back buttons) and primary actions 17\n- Responsive design: Automatic fullscreen mode on mobile devices 18\n- Dynamic content: Support for dynamic headers and footers 19",sourceId:"Modals",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.056954287,-0.035434656,0.01041745,-0.015600325,0.11084147,-0.018466752,0.024464803,0.01814279