c({id:"MultiPartKeys:5",text:"DAO Operations with MultiPart Keys\nWhen using DAOs with multipart key models:\n\njavascript\n// Put works normally - FOAM handles the composite key\nawait orderItemDAO.put(item);\n\n// Find requires the composite ID object (not a simple value)\nvar id = com.example.OrderItemId.create({\n  orderId: 1001,\n  productId: 5\n});\nvar found = await orderItemDAO.find(id);\n\n// Or create an object with the key fields and use its id\nvar lookup = com.example.OrderItem.create({\n  orderId: 1001,\n  productId: 5\n});\nvar found = await orderItemDAO.find(lookup.id);",sourceId:"MultiPartKeys",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.10779163,0.0043932176,0.01785182,-0.016580677,-0.0018471165,-0.03323277,-0.06181937,0.024941476,0.09210104,-0.025291838,-0.023284506,0.063179806,-0.05056191,-0.045648884,0.035040896,0.045241665,0.0076809446,-0.008544907,-0.093044184,0.0061619664,0.10337295,-0.057995234,0.02859659,-0.09763023,0.015595331,0.0063902247,0.02964153,-0.0772116,0.021430537,-0.015351016,0.054154012,0.0021294472,-0.01954209,-0.006093703,-0.013211261,0.01604049,0.040008616,-0.043082044,-0.026820036,-0.030166034,0.10718987,0.057819296,-0.0026078974,-0.030404039,0.08382248,0.030494062,-0.027716434,0.04669363,0.08394609,-0.011358102,-0.10067049,-0.019175192,-0.049480166,0.09896721,-0.056610055,0.061173465,-0.03427491,-0.036381505,-0.036410674,0.031355634,0.06462081,-0.057670016,0.08288026,-0.0055056773,0.10707083,-0.022132857,0.026616478,-0.072947174,-0.052614953,0.014865717,0.14508966,-0.0050158203,0.10155617,0.0067258193,-0.009664315,0.025981005,0.059783217,-0.058376092,0.039661326,-0.007301261,-0.0649653,0.017164076,-0.0497834,-0.006687953,-0.0061086044,0.030210791,-0.035681102,-0.05101027,-0.02533031,0.05891379,-0.107150435,-0.013759492,-0.002222748,-0.039067686,0.07052979,0.02147851,0.076781236,0.08696737,-0.040200915,-0.009162268,-0.04831236,0.070769325,-0.014897209,-0.056261733,-0.0032590628,-0.009027987,-0.0078003253,