c({id:"MultiPartKeys:6",text:"Converting String IDs\nWhen you have a string representation of a multipart ID (common when passing IDs through URLs or table views):\n\njavascript\nvar idString = '{\"orderId\"=1001,\"productId\"=5}';\n\n// Use the generated ID class's FROMSTRING method\nvar of = com.example.OrderItem;\nvar id = of.ID.of.FROMSTRING(idString);\n\n// Now you can use it with DAO.find()\nvar item = await orderItemDAO.find(id);",sourceId:"MultiPartKeys",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.04473987,0.066281624,-7.994353E-5,-0.01132772,0.022115277,0.051731776,0.01476568,0.049277954,0.025690613,-0.068946384,-0.06923253,0.04284604,-0.05020434,-0.051794387,-0.019842282,0.057041362,-0.012613035,0.034981288,-0.0991923,-0.0075036976,0.072873965,0.0408893,-0.004583749,-0.05071667,0.029790686,0.02293067,0.09947026,-0.034240402,-0.0048480886,6.872047E-5,0.08623195,-0.022177795,-0.037069365,-0.06883156,0.011947059,-0.039946727,0.0028907552,-0.07377937,0.06497822,0.005835392,0.1316438,0.03595562,-0.014779964,-0.010112997,0.10658243,0.016975135,-0.056225937,0.06289257,0.022350347,-5.3722423E-4,-0.064792894,-0.0066373856,-0.06922105,0.054270033,-0.030718822,0.01661333,-0.01839122,-0.066995226,-0.014742689,0.09183777,0.07442828,-0.094904535,0.12251605,0.012346186,0.011210173,-0.06725149,0.055699356,-0.029720327,-0.08694871,-0.08991152,0.027517242,0.029502558,0.047930017,0.08585008,0.0041540093,0.005960201,0.01620137,-0.056791466,0.05091375,0.001939345,-0.026723726,0.038390692,0.023539696,0.03496892,0.043953188,0.029382043,-0.07612119,0.058160394,-0.025830097,0.08995904,-0.119098306,-0.02725546,0.018751658,-0.01256483,0.05324721,0.016793145,0.052309744,0.053996023,-0.019108571,0.0025520904,-0.046239085,0.06396116,-0.030038035,-0.0814155,-0.10411755,0.03118046,0.050002478,-0.01554638,-0.002969008,-0.014338536,-0.0888441,0.10645105,0.025773624,0.0096417265,-0.07939657,-0.10466247,0.008010191,-0.046182107,0.05300499,-0.043130293,0.019474274,-4.51043