c({id:"NDiff:5",text:"Architecture\n+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                         NDiff System Architecture                        |\n+-------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                                          |\n|  +---------------------------------------------------------------------+ |\n|  |                        JDAO (Journal DAO)                           | |\n|  |  +-----------------------+    +----------------------------+        | |\n|  |  |   Repo Journal (.0)   |    |    Runtime Journal          |       | |\n|  |  |                       |    |                              |       | |\n|  |  |  NDiffJournal         |    |  NDiffJournal                |       | |\n|  |  |  (runtimeOrigin=false)|    |  (runtimeOrigin=true)        |       | |\n|  |  +-----------+-----------+    +-------------+----------------+       | |\n|  |              |                               |                       | |\n|  +--------------|-------------------------------|------------------------+ |\n|                 |                               |                         |\n|                 v                               v                         |\n|  +----------------------------------------------------------------------+ |\n|  |                          NDiffDAO                                     | |\n|  |   Wraps delegate DAO during replay                                    | |\n|  |   Records initialFObject for each put()                               | |\n|  |   Only records from repo journal (runtimeOrigin=false)                | |\n|  +----------------------------------+-----------------------------------+ |\n|                                     |                                     |\n|                                     v                                     |\n|  +----------------------------------------------------------------------+ |\n|  |                         ndiffDAO Service                              | |\n|  |  +------------------------------------------------------------------+ | |\n|  |  |                    NDiffRuntimeDAO                                | | |\n|  |  |  - Filters select() to show only changed/deleted records          | | |\n|  |  |  - Populates runtimeFObject on-the-fly                            | | |\n|  |  |  - Handles applyOriginal to restore initial state                 | | |\n|  |  +------------------------------------------------------------------+ | |\n|  +----------------------------------------------------------------------+ |\n|                                                                           |\n+---------------------------------------------------------------------------+",sourceId:"NDiff",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.030834172,0.004120388,-0.13731521,-0.030407824,-0.04236117,-0.0762706,0.018465359,0.020826148,-0.044307042,-0.034523755,0.062907435,-0.041796483,0.05025924,-0.08049962,-0.10228237,0.01872234,0.007895578,-0.012571419,-0.009786475,-0.050141625,0.0066007925,0.100431286,-0.058054302,-0.08184603,0.053311646,0.04214227,0.010909381,-0.023327664,-0.038299207,-0.06571956,-0.019706918,0.06202359,-0.031712186,0.0213799,0.12337457,0.037411615,0.008995071,0.014675838,-0.03848444,-0.017388761,-0.018046048,-0.02298765,0.046617527,-0.011628771,-0.053600956,-0.054083947,-0.11486685,-0.01642834,-0.038536802,-0.040085983,-0.07585821,0.069942035,-0.03176236,0.036866672,0.067388766,0.029527484,-0.010324547,-0.011443038,-0.011721021,-0.022316698,0.01277043,0.04465772,-0.06582319,0.0015656945,0.016427701,0.003174576,-0.0066337325,-0.0047165677,0.007403438,-0.06148642,-0.07330143,0.022492955,-0.051588193,0.04749962,-0.024261825,0.04962214,0.05737128,0.044113737,0.04340168,-0.14127985,0.007963723,-3.4215674E-4,-0.10418269,-0.0027687233,-0.037813693,5.010037E-4,-0.021220833,-0.0283457,0.109270245,-0.08919666,-0.004145698