c({id:"NanoServices:0",text:"NanoServices\nComprehensive guide to FOAM's nano-service architecture: context DI, Box messaging layer, Stub/Skeleton RPC, CSpec registration.\n\nKeywords: nanoservices, box, rpc, cspec, stub, skeleton, knowledge\n\n<flow name=\"NanoServices\" category=\"DOC/GUIDE\" spid=\"foam\" description=\"Comprehensive guide to FOAM's nano-service architecture: context DI, Box messaging layer, Stub/Skeleton RPC, CSpec registration.\" keywords=\"nanoservices,box,rpc,cspec,stub,skeleton,knowledge\"/>\n\n<!-- START doctoc generated TOC please keep comment here to allow auto update -->\n<!-- DON'T EDIT THIS SECTION, INSTEAD RE-RUN doctoc TO UPDATE -->\nTable of Contents  generated with DocToc\n\n- FOAM Nano-Services Architecture\n  - Overview\n  - Core Concepts\n    - Location-Agnostic Service Access\n    - The Service Contract\n  - The Box Messaging Layer\n    - What is a Box?\n    - The Envelope\n    - How Box, Envelope, and RPCMessage Connect\n    - Box Implementations\n    - Box Composition\n  - Stub/Skeleton Pattern\n    - How It Works\n    - The RPCMessage\n    - Generated Code\n  - Creating a Nano-Service\n    - Step 1: Define Request/Response Models\n    - Step 2: Define the Service Interface\n    - Step 3: Implement the Server-Side Service\n    - Step 4: Register the Service (CSpec)\n    - Step 5: Use the Service\n  - Service Registration (CSpec)\n    - CSpec Properties\n    - The Client Configuration\n  - Complete Example: NotificationService\n    - 1. Request/Response Models\n    - 2. Service Interface\n    - 3. Server Implementation\n    - 4. Service Registration (services.jrl)\n    - 5. Client Usage\n  - Key Benefits\n    - 1. Zero Networking Overhead When Co-located\n    - 2. Transparent Distribution\n    - 3. Multiple Transport Options\n    - 4. Fine-Grained Decomposition\n    - 5. Composable Decorators\n    - 6. Type Safety\n  - Summary\n\n<!-- END doctoc generated TOC please keep comment here to allow auto update -->",sourceId:"NanoServices",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.02841992,-0.07266931,-0.04687664,0.005830841,0.006057708,-0.027442047,0.018489199,0.032362487,-0.030740885,0.08454421,-0.007637514,-0.051179834,0.08637736,-0.028312134,0.09253026,-0.027937427,0.093493454,-0.061265785,-0.026749957,0.06059649,0.06354892,0.07456059,-0.0116324,0.021394912,-0.12854601,0.0023121955,-0.052399173,-0.05603951,-0.04669809,-0.05805423,0.057236504,0.080918066,-0.023216847,0.019203372,0.04262326,0.070584044,0.057334792,-0.007507234,-0.04400208,-0.03075003,-0.046441194,-0.0377449,-0.06991963,-0.0024049343,0.034567226,-0.04845903,-0.08177761,-0.05739084,-0.006790754,0.03162875,-0.045075502,-0.055617128,-0.029375765,0.08101476,0.008852884,0.06252759,-0.02195667,0.045272253,-0.00386238,-0.027943226,0.02980989,-0.08008977,-0.009378246,0.030417211,0.030717555,-0.025888255,-0.016272893,0.013261032,0.051911652,-0.035391483,-0.08992195,0.035627082,-0.0072739385,-0.027945349,-0.042997543,0.07590415,0.10814264,0.06912803,0.01974352,-0.099760495,0.003756295,0.10780334,0.006368953,0.013781052,-0.07812295,0.044198647,0.041376133,-0.009852417,-0.031471055,0.024218328,0.0661257,-0.035869304,0.008088262,-0.07820929,-0.03362954,-0.0077760476,-0.012095666,-0.04543439,-0.004166576,0.03534423,0.031933233,-0.03339514,0.0033730583,-0.012170561,0.009367451,-0.04620899,-0.1049882,0.022069134,0.014024838,0.05114258,-0.108032964,0.036054336,-0.095727265,-0.01973347,-0.054790568,0.027754722,0.051058494,-0.002581524,0.031095244,-0.0013930826,0.03969944,-0.024910161,0.026528182,-0.018958708,-0.09154837,-0.058716495,0.06340824,5.5562988E-33,0.028044838,-0.016538775,0.007227758,0.065921105,0.12236446,0.006804596,0.07048625,0.02737646,-0.0032349362,-0.031812556,-0.043355785,0.043764092,0.007913013,-0.022311505,-0.0375758,-0.09273895,-0.068535425,0.001081856,0.048033945,0.011218967,-0.026610684,0.049322817,0.022646986,0.010167097,0.092108235,0.022440113,-0.00932833,-0.036362294,-0.04642387,0.019421294,0.055615