c({id:"PIIReport:1",text:"Personal Identifiable Information (PII)\nFOAM provides for General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) reporting of PII. The EU GDPR provides for the end user to inquire into PII held by a system, and additionally, deletion of said data if it does not conflict with superceeding requirements.\n\nCurrently, only reporting is considered. Data retention is left as future work and/or left to the application. In banking applications, for example, banking regulations trump GDPR for data retention.",sourceId:"PIIReport",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.0667458,0.057713043,-0.054829985,-0.036979817,0.079634875,0.031281702,0.05912628,-0.06337498,0.058521263,-0.063660346,0.049391698,0.027854152,0.04571585,0.0068363207,-0.028626304,-0.075625986,0.034516804,-0.053909186,-0.04132873,-0.008549595,0.020392753,0.044763595,-0.054963484,0.029811107,-0.122200854,0.02947421,0.034932956,-0.10011368,-0.019486118,-0.009786494,0.051944226,0.059965163,-0.016165972,-0.026226953,-0.00342736,-0.048080154,0.003446123,-0.022114968,0.027062757,-0.046785694,0.030091628,-0.11341324,-0.04159066,-0.076505035,0.07561914,0.07655373,-0.025202,-0.011103577,-0.05809217,0.0411403,-0.012551817,0.0077805524,0.02795961,0.032648467,0.006279262,-0.019440431,-0.008039226,-0.039664004,-0.048789844,0.05181522,-0.030038945,0.0013377513,0.016895376,-0.010090771,0.041382942,0.032101985,-0.007176018,-0.055398915,-0.008558999,-0.032290827,-0.056253724,-0.059274677,-0.13488953,0.049930293,-0.013159022,0.04043521,-0.082146786,0.012295438,0.012456506,7.8805955E-4,-0.018133676,0.022742627,0.057227306,-7.6498976E-4,0.007434796,-0.024667256,0.082464285,-0.032160267,-0.018210545,5.760031E-4,0.015319066,-8.1378955E-4,0.045730382,-0.0039085136,-0.024887199,-0.08551602,-0.07408814,-0.019784816,0.031712394,-0.015873706,0.01468607,0.0012319068,-0.0200716,0.012661279,-0.09737593,-0.09041785,0.04115092,-0.030000191,0.04389611,0.14238708,-0.0124087045,0.02301781,-0.0035291922,-0.0