c({id:"PIIReport:2",text:"Report Generation\nReport generation is invoked in two ways\n\n1. action: PII Report \n\nGrant operations groups permission user.action.pii to allow them to generate a PIIReportTicket for a user.\n\n \n\nAn operator can select a user and then selection action PII Report. This will create a PIIReportTicket and redirect the operator to the ticket detail view. The operator can review the Key Value document and then CLOSE the ticket to send the email\n\n2. menu: Settings -> PII Report \n\nGrant end user groups permission menu.read.settings and menu.read.pii-report for access to the Settings menu PII Report sub menu, which allows the user to generate and email themselves their PII Report. This process also creates an PIIReportTicket which is immediately CLOSED to send the email.",sourceId:"PIIReport",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.040144872,0.06771841,-0.07115122,0.03928041,-0.030263951,0.041382365,0.01615281,0.01841679,-0.016175775,0.018114703,-0.026665526,-0.032302767,0.08023277,0.0070646773,-0.030327521,-0.01268127,0.015282532,-0.068880074,-0.02798227,-0.024498044,0.086038746,0.03361068,0.055554006,0.00779493,-0.119153254,-0.06421907,-0.042648934,0.023567908,-0.014978068,0.026506145,0.06434511,0.12610246,0.014618146,0.006751075,-0.025384309,0.011951302,0.097654775,-0.0040796977,0.017305197,-0.06893321,0.058275193,0.021302974,0.031898797,0.008945547,0.026192201,0.02770047,-0.031181082,0.0041499045,-0.04717775,0.04881266,-0.032871287,-0.007749133,0.06279518,-0.035473008,0.002879593,0.04635544,-0.027201986,-0.027307801,-0.030631045,-0.026168566,-0.07996873,-0.07057747,-0.04995737,-0.07687183,-0.05857647,0.014815261,-0.015464485,-0.06642596,-0.03795941,-0.041532025,-0.06258135,-0.03209601,-0.088460684,0.0017743828,0.06643278,0.07983888,-0.085916415,0.059974633,-0.08073456,-0.053626027,-0.0033078727,-0.0019095687,-0.023730073,0.017586721,0.0404568,0.04021123,0.12571792,0.010807314,0.01910029,0.091931164,-0.03419238