c({id:"Permissions:7",text:"Permission Naming Convention\nValid wildcard patterns:\n-  - Global permission (ability to do anything)\n- foo. - Hierarchical wildcard\n\nInvalid patterns:\n- foo, ab, foo - Asterisk not at end or not preceded by dot\n\nExamples:\n-  - Ability to do anything, granted to 'admin' group\n- user.read.* - Ability to read all Users from the UserDAO\n- theme.write.acme - Ability to write only the 'acme' Theme from the ThemeDAO",sourceId:"Permissions",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[0.00979781,0.021908747,-0.08820921,0.0018722138,-0.006931007,0.0053937156,0.055682972,-0.049130607,-0.08972593,-0.019927084,-0.016187094,-0.013446599,-0.019230047,0.03743286,0.022433754,0.036053225,0.03311422,-0.006162062,-0.027585696,-0.014341972,0.06676655,0.017888444,-0.02688326,-0.037154462,-0.067785166,0.025597263,-0.055132437,-0.05301205,0.06480386,-0.009848889,0.037098873,0.08057816,0.10313333,0.009852892,0.018794762,-0.020364083,0.025592975,-0.038748484,0.011675148,0.017324608,0.035246648,0.023548635,-0.019501258,0.047540657,-0.03586241,-0.029790584,-0.041823816,-0.043235175,-0.03182282,0.09414157,0.05964396,-0.051693995,-0.09756057,0.0097542005,0.017066693,0.016387451,-0.0083754165,-0.017623054,0.025638865,-0.07425236,-0.022597712,0.0067670797,-0.091296725,0.042013012,-0.029747257,-0.019265693,-0.014946847,0.047479272,-0.010592355,-0.022356503,0.006243874,-0.0083936965,0.020894596,0.075055964,0.047065563,0.020252552,-0.040845294,-0.01735728,-0.041112073,-0.16617338,-0.020313533,0.04667978,0.040129725,-0.050361346,0.053255998,0.09872076,-0.012185941,-0.0017141474,0.0024069126,0.061648574,0.020580888,-0.08894565,0.07694805,-0.02716901,-0.06913627,0.0014158346,0.0754006,-0.12868172,-0.06156923,0.012125176,-0.060674645,-0.029274475,-0.0063654343,0.024263604,0.030762028,0.015663797,-0.004828095,-0.022055147,0.026422568,0.035500463,-0.061432898,0.009011248,-0.04799244,-0.06622977,0.0021219985,-0.09607561,-0.07003081,-0.07436684,0.02672