c({id:"Permissions:9",text:"Core Data Models\nAuthentication Models\n- User - System users (humans or computer systems) 2\n- Group - User collections; each user belongs to one group 3\n- Permission - Documented permissions shown in Permission Matrix 4\n- GroupPermissionJunction - Many-to-many Group\u2194Permission relationship 5\n\nCRUNCH Models\n- Capability - User-owned \"contracts\" that grant permissions, can expire, hierarchical 6\n- UserCapabilityJunction - Many-to-many User\u2194Capability relationship",sourceId:"Permissions",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[0.029301865,-0.06115676,-0.056261618,-0.031328976,-0.018984696,-0.014109333,0.035588518,0.04353154,0.027002264,0.0084349755,-8.12559E-4,-0.013443235,0.071128204,0.07233962,0.00652889,-0.005228769,0.059028827,-0.016442161,-0.05606218,-0.055129007,-1.058231E-5,-0.03743995,-0.023507789,0.01136372,-0.0487134,-0.011379593,0.021836272,-0.061115548,0.01676914,-0.03424791,-0.040340766,0.020181319,0.08841661,0.05580514,-0.01271459,-0.051588085,0.064634345,-0.03681429,0.0020815346,0.026751831,-0.046650868,0.020075925,0.017613128,0.006512574,0.04889418,-0.014779217,-0.0046913596,-0.021891482,-0.03515871,0.057548117,0.047004603,0.026256492,0.031032475,0.051538046,0.020645255,-0.037622396,-0.008378061,-0.06568727,-0.046338152,-0.008948388,-0.011768898,-0.014091913,-0.09573599,0.0068077547,0.07501125,0.013020019,-0.011104535,-0.007445016,-0.0018858978,-0.033780266,-0.022853253,-0.06592536,-0.12512463,-0.047808655,0.02622052,-0.029913524,0.015809601,0.0144182,0.0122045865,-0.13944642,-0.039086033,0.104855455,0.010329208,0.008457025,-0.053632546,0.044399247,0.022626756,-0.005629384,-0.044925462,-0.013240346,0.0099140415,0.046292987,0.050573792,-0.06880486,-0.076428175,-0.0010769429,0.07235474,-0.03111173,-0.038668234,0.02272499,-0.04884778,0.0041842335,-0.006008131,-0.046087768,0.01900719,0.0042423923,-0.006824088,-0.015759416,-0.015624473,-0.00886609,-0.059095822,0.012377548,-0.10458902,0.002