c({id:"Permissions:12",text:"Permission Pattern Summary\n| Pattern | Purpose |\n|---------|---------|\n| service.<serviceName> | Service access |\n| service.run.<serviceName> | WebAgent execution |\n| <model>.read.<id> | Read object |\n| <model>.update.<id> | Update object |\n| <model>.remove.<id> | Delete object |\n| <model>.create | Create object |\n| <model>.ro.<property> | Read property |\n| <model>.rw.<property> | Write property |\n| <model>.column.<property> | View table column |\n| No standard pattern | Execute actions |\n| @<RoleName> | Grant all Role permissions |",sourceId:"Permissions",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.0011185922,-0.01874493,-0.14655934,0.01672613,-0.03666372,-0.0139779495,0.017643949,-0.0013961536,-0.06847084,0.07184619,0.0586798,-0.02490225,0.042487822,-0.02370709,0.03330946,0.07102929,0.05761438,-0.006398793,-0.091960795,-0.042236023,9.81492E-4,-0.0022311674,0.0031879225,-0.059783526,-0.045647535,0.0018168575,0.043182492,-0.042022064,0.04810171,-0.016317459,0.04059496,-0.039013453,0.020905998,0.004191005,0.044749875,-0.012583931,0.08679614,-0.041025702,0.104598984,0.03849058,0.044871267,-0.027841542,-0.01644149,-0.050545722,0.004598727,-0.10481825,-0.0042112414,-0.1004982,0.0096530365,-0.030613752,1.507175E-4,-0.03136331,0.0011667804,-5.8064405E-5,-0.0058977124,-0.027650144,-2.1974051E-4,0.00840558,-0.029979052,-0.1063723,0.03718706,-0.020208076,0.03435607,-0.0040739537,-0.080308974,-0.019598704,-0.09081594,-0.08811799,0.06772628,-0.05995846,-0.038776036,0.06833047,-0.08445266,-0.049978197,-0.031164953,0.014187182,0.039343707,0.072381206,-0.012537736,-0.08456207,0.007826372,0.024702115,-0.026423972,-0.014550266,-0.078185,0.012769623,0.038894057,-0.009762908,0.02511955,0.026948672,0.020010171,0.02350686,0.05400609,-0.056705214,-0.031802475,0.0180969,-0.0016144123,-0.051723942,-0.050553963,0.07791477,-0.030634332,-0.073889434,-0.06058789,0.039976656,0.0034047193,-0.005359257,-0.024681175,0.10866274,-0.037137