c({id:"Permissions:13",text:"User Interface\nPermission Management\n- PermissionMatrix - Primary permission management interface 9\n- Security Audit - run the \"Security Audit\" FLOW to get a report of all DAO security configurations. The Security Audit is also part of the FOAM test suite.\n- Security Principle: Users cannot grant permissions they don't possess (implicitly or explicitly)",sourceId:"Permissions",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.051844392,0.03630508,-0.13084418,-0.008845183,0.055828396,-0.040423013,0.09806726,-0.04064804,-0.090349935,-0.024309497,0.024961991,-0.031984728,-0.012919638,0.04818015,-0.049237538,-0.0036180639,0.048240554,-0.0010853168,-0.015008577,0.0150980875,0.026347047,-0.024528082,-0.008356587,-0.08153784,-0.040047012,0.037297413,-0.017919337,-0.018279813,-0.011778335,-0.044704318,-0.05942048,0.01141194,0.037856437,0.013988597,-0.028660718,-0.055098057,0.103179514,-0.049828302,0.02483487,0.0053257314,-0.03262213,0.026510766,0.038689237,0.080460556,-0.0483021,-0.028155351,0.0050792084,-0.06735038,0.016816895,0.007874452,0.030600596,0.062969565,0.0767305,-0.0143306395,-0.002488706,-0.041973975,0.019424498,-0.0010394466,-0.041321184,-0.033479124,-0.022851799,-0.008586165,-0.069195986,0.07202609,0.04198833,0.03511783,-0.010665623,0.017315492,-0.023961963,-0.037562862,-0.06792054,-0.023219934,-0.01521037,-0.021434708,0.061620478,0.026366007,-0.056103975,0.055977292,0.045641795,-0.13058403,0.018546384,0.09139785,0.021464542,0.064956315,-0.061915345,0.1287755,0.017892748,-0.055149097,0.053285666,0.058034103,0.03550917,0.03440097,0.021665135,-0.059642155,0.01577252,-0.06722625,0.0436795,-0.0052285134,-0.086037345,0.049005263,-5.3848344E-4,-0.020899134,-0.04826251,-0.0019025027,0.0084997285,-0.018089725,0.02925023,-0.05405142,-0.03182711,0.07500481,0.009214298,-0.0010794633,-0.009845115,-0.05216332,0.05024958,-0.070043206,-0.0969077,-0.053490024,8.009367E-4,-0.01677532,0.044495583,-0.01977286,0.112602726,0.0168876