c({id:"QA2:1",text:"QA2: the decision-matrix questionnaire engine\nfoam.QA2({...}) turns a table of questions and outcomes into a FOAM class that can pick the next question to ask and narrow down which outcome applies. foam.u2.qa.QAWizardView drives it on screen. The engine is src/foam/u2/qa/QA.js; a runnable example is src/foam/u2/qa/demo.md.\n\nA definition has three lists and a methods: array:\n\n- properties: typed inputs the system already knows, and output fields.\n- questions: prompts for the user. A question with no choices and no class gets Yes/No, stored as the strings 'TRUE' and 'FALSE' (QA.js:161-172).\n- outcomes: rows, each with a predicate string.\n- methods: your own helper methods. The key must be present, even as [], or the definition throws (see Overriding pieces of the engine).\n\n---",sourceId:"QA2",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.014859526,0.04781143,-0.11663614,9.313288E-4,-0.057207383,0.039553467,0.011165469,-0.010186043,0.026230557,-0.0072095618,0.0023808093,-0.07045466,0.034894302,0.016608259,-0.0022767852,0.095538855,0.00706526,-0.11177809,-0.027664235,0.035205156,0.08440617,0.046473082,0.019004762,0.002815126,-0.033377208,0.055564635,0.039718777,-0.031632658,-0.021139689,-0.066646166,-0.037503373,0.057739872,0.0019596738,-0.0032723516,0.023151927,-0.010725872,-0.05176286,-0.03688128,-0.054552168,0.035283122,-0.060065664,-0.04273144,-0.063950375,-0.022075485,0.07499206,-0.016632007,-0.06333031,-0.04911423,0.008250669,-0.026822478,-0.09724092,-0.011720554,-0.019972894,-0.02232628,0.002923089,0.018976795,-0.03046336,0.0050318446,-0.042645775,-6.45504E-4,-0.0116517,-0.047644224,-0.019244038,0.1142962,0.065616876,-0.010480601,-0.06201086,-0.007435384,-0.015383177,7.4752845E-4,-0.12356384,0.030264534,0.03912986,-3.5552573E-4,0.025189301,0.04580058,-0.021073567,-0.003763413,0.043465767,0.04439632,-0.03931058,-0.031230368,-0.019881334,0.043475676,0.07850208,0.070462264,0.019586673,0.031350162,-0.0035329221,-0.00742