c({id:"REQUIRES_VS_IMPORTS:5",text:"Complex View with Multiple Dependencies:\njavascript\n// File: foam3/src/foam/u2/wizard/IncrementalStepWizardView.js\nfoam.CLASS({\n  package: 'foam.u2.wizard',\n  name: 'IncrementalStepWizardView',\n  extends: 'foam.u2.View',\n  \n  requires: [\n    'foam.lang.Action',\n    'foam.log.LogLevel',\n    'foam.u2.detail.SectionView',\n    'foam.u2.dialog.Popup',\n    'foam.u2.dialog.SimpleActionDialog'\n  ]\n  // All classes available without full package names\n});\n\nWhen to Use requires\n- \u2705 When you need to create instances of other FOAM classes\n- \u2705 For view classes, DAO classes, service classes\n- \u2705 When building complex UI components that compose other views\n- \u2705 For factory methods and class construction\n- \u2705 When you want to avoid typing full qualified class names",sourceId:"REQUIRES_VS_IMPORTS",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.095420524,-0.041432936,-0.01381893,-0.038374744,0.054411504,-0.03052963,0.0114777945,-0.034222387,0.0090903705,-0.07280537,0.031010754,-0.062848344,-0.032997143,0.08555162,0.05987009,0.006210965,0.016232666,-0.12337375,-0.06130309,0.11616687,0.11204992,0.0031349107,0.017542513,-0.027773634,-0.03004014,0.031804994,0.048723284,-0.086580224,0.055202078,-0.059899583,0.07763827,0.06683979,1.15373456E-4,-0.02324185,-0.053716917,0.038256895,0.009533226,-0.038892508,-0.01229325,-0.01630274,-0.06882385,0.06429842,-0.028458092,-0.018672246,0.037234932,-0.0309654,-0.08882802,-0.0910738,0.030526593,0.014882891,-0.057506263,-0.02032878,-0.02874085,0.013176012,0.016636798,0.027922107,-0.08874587,0.10182137,-0.059221447,0.052030526,-0.015567997,-0.007326193,0.012660559,0.02748729,-0.02826102,0.049230043,-0.012692041,-0.035561416,0.029780256,0.04201213,-0.103699885,-0.022520272,0.08464681,-0.030073266,-0.021817364,-0.024121862,0.037981745,-0.015836336,0.054172218,-0.08047165,-0.005043444,0.07699781,0.024015594,0.016263576,0.080991544,0.06855174,0.015793085,-0.055