c({id:"REQUIRES_VS_IMPORTS:8",text:"exports: - Making Services Available\nPurpose\nThe flip side of imports: - declares what objects or values you want to make available to descendants in the context chain.\n\nSyntax\njavascript\nfoam.CLASS({\n  name: 'MyService',\n  \n  exports: [\n    'userDAO',           // Export userDAO property to children\n    'this as myService', // Export entire instance\n    'log as logger'      // Export with alias\n  ]\n});\n\n\nHow It Works\n- Exported values become available in the context for child components\n- Child components can import these exported values\n- Creates a context chain where services flow down to descendants\n- Enables inversion of control architecture",sourceId:"REQUIRES_VS_IMPORTS",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.026708374,-0.032436773,-0.052065715,-0.025000941,0.053598907,-0.024450142,0.07613956,0.041795556,-0.014702178,-0.009365289,0.025229048,-0.02396102,-0.0150491735,0.038817417,0.10486564,0.01123137,0.06808043,-0.06449951,-0.05436324,0.032558437,0.08665749,0.037410885,-0.024118332,-0.004397803,-0.049894366,0.014177424,0.022226296,-0.109324016,0.057050493,0.00206412,-0.0034626108,0.049213175,-0.07208558,0.014838705,-0.041572403,0.14292061,0.09561777,-0.023376234,0.011178233,-0.018155202,0.051110465,0.029224861,-0.03773686,-0.08953485,0.013371828,-0.046190716,-0.022410158,-0.051122118,0.0060706036,0.038820326,-0.04159905,-0.016825948,-0.05317791,0.02009825,-0.03525751,0.05353892,0.018137204,-0.02399329,-0.0038225183,0.06824965,-0.055347003,0.01866847,0.0112591395,0.045267824,0.041350696,-0.10223759,-0.06370428,0.06655725,-0.06276942,-0.025179066,-0.06643813,3.1693402E-4,-0.005423498,-9.838215E-4,9.882675E-4,-0.027429536,-0.007312694,0.02342777,0.010440808,-0.0634353,0.0031724875,0.08055226,-0.014730644,0.041704256,-0.061158467,0.098050535,0.073605515,-0.06231871,0.02985034,0.06903539,-0.0416506,-0.13798818,0.09157758,0.02619287,-0.031447515,0.0027093852,-0.033295088,0.04137145,0.