c({id:"RISCyAPIs:0",text:"RISCyAPIs\nApplies the CISC vs RISC analogy to framework API design: FOAM APIs are small and regular because FOAM generates most calls itself.\n\nKeywords: risc, api design, cisc, code generation, knowledge\n\n<flow name=\"RISCyAPIs\" category=\"DOC/GUIDE\" spid=\"foam\" description=\"Applies the CISC vs RISC analogy to framework API design: FOAM APIs are small and regular because FOAM generates most calls itself.\" keywords=\"risc,api design,cisc,code generation,knowledge\"/>",sourceId:"RISCyAPIs",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.030143047,-0.052117378,-0.037671458,-0.010605551,0.05343223,-0.07194937,-0.033943053,0.090326235,0.05005257,-0.025126083,-0.028560985,-0.03916016,0.052907642,-0.03904814,0.032846037,-0.07480772,0.04902436,-0.033809282,0.02016665,-0.0021485903,0.10503911,0.009276737,-0.049823277,0.038931556,-0.0123780705,0.04358159,0.026420906,-0.05432713,0.043494742,0.0017980264,0.022692777,0.06417337,-0.01751803,-0.030377015,-0.04017305,0.061493557,-0.032674205,-0.07889155,-0.0074998923,0.06674582,-0.12158551,-0.005597986,-0.005375115,0.033193555,0.02117304,-0.05664673,-0.09185373,-0.067523524,-0.037475474,0.024842184,-0.060140535,-0.08151298,-0.06895821,9.010109E-5,-0.021419832,-0.021361105,-0.08566716,-0.033344645,-0.013278121,0.057459433,0.008477129,-0.025833042,0.029260648,0.039723128,0.013889628,0.027921075,-0.058739867,-0.013838516,0.085868016,-0.109616734,-0.07426377,0.08769754,-0.003341311,0.08422269,0.03872676,0.005393127,0.025626285,0.08356988,-0.036498163,-0.08692374,-0.012995131,0.18357198,0.021191418,-0.02594283,0.0655958,0.06871721,0.07939009,-0.03649243,-0.0030340955,-0.020706568,0.101378314,-0.035185926,0.090285316,-0.0619821,-0.043659057,-0.021332208,-0.08371395,-0.07772423,-0.04089859,-0.009642489,-0.06570099,0.031562027,-0.0584084,2.709924E-5,-0.013909791,0.04174465,-0.07919891,-0.011059099,-0.056008648,0.10145661,-0.061317097,0.06920795,-0.016726213,0.009318535,7.09696E-4,-0.0031