// Modified by admin admin (42) at 2026-10-02T11:21:26.980+0000
c({id:"RISCyAPIs:3",text:"FOAM as the Compiler\nFOAM is built around exactly this insight, applied to application development.\n\nIn a conventional stack, a human developer is the direct consumer of every API: the DOM API, the UI framework, the ORM, the query language. The framework designer's job is to make those APIs pleasant for a human to read and write. This produces CISC-style APIs \u2014 rich, expressive, full of conveniences and syntactic sugar, often large and complex as a result.\n\nIn a FOAM application, FOAM itself is the primary consumer of most of its own subsystem APIs. A developer writes a model declaration \u2014 properties, methods, relationships \u2014 and FOAM generates the UI, the persistence layer, the network protocol, and the validation logic from that declaration. The human writes the specification; FOAM writes the implementation.\n\nThis changes what a good API looks like across the entire framework. APIs that FOAM generates rather than humans write can afford to be RISC-y: small, regular, fast, and designed for programmatic composition rather than human ergonomics. The result is subsystems that are significantly smaller and faster than their CISC counterparts in conventional frameworks.",sourceId:"RISCyAPIs",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.008866578,-0.01786295,-0.03627705,0.00713899,0.034315217,-0.0861645,-0.04556829,0.060985554,0.021083921,-0.048279133,-0.04900008,-0.048907045,0.050145485,-0.018051583,0.06525345,-0.01649206,0.099897705,-0.07076832,0.026905494,-0.023553755,0.04697528,0.053072464,-0.05849335,0.034304675,-0.043788295,0.06641519,0.023072029,-0.09826741,0.064236835,-0.026552193,-0.0030066555,0.0014241656,0.0029523103,-0.030201947,-0.033303574,0.022236047,0.020398177,-0.10081687,-0.021224435,-0.024502685,-0.089022346,-0.08534653,-0.057404913,0.028979195,0.039339066,-0.041679185,-0.005949164,-0.057943113,-0.06863154,0.04026059,-0.005021579,-0.04457117,-0.030352682,-0.051079243,0.012639808,0.02713