c({id:"Refinements:3",text:"Axiom Installation in Refinements\nWhen axioms are installed on a refined class, the same two-phase installation process occurs: 3\n\n1. Axioms are added to the class's axiomMap_ 4\n2. installInClass() and installInProto() are called 5\n\nImportantly, when axioms are installed on a parent class through refinement, child classes are notified via pub/sub to clear their axiom caches, ensuring they see the new axioms: 6",sourceId:"Refinements",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[0.00756335,-3.529568E-4,0.048724268,-0.07051725,0.03917487,-0.030062838,0.020695621,-0.02786686,-0.039181743,0.023686929,0.042813405,0.008965972,-0.032213207,-0.035316534,0.009183027,0.012833821,0.020800188,-0.026487906,-0.04076117,-0.07447376,0.07588737,-0.052394062,-0.020709079,-0.011912179,-0.021107158,0.025343139,-0.016862208,-0.020891638,0.066048704,-0.008727329,-0.046046544,0.093461245,-0.031267058,0.022478985,-0.016432738,0.08619399,0.08868524,-0.008422112,0.005368315,0.067291245,-0.0016078339,0.0058081914,8.503215E-5,0.008771873,0.08473319,0.021193536,0.01152206,-0.052673925,-0.0017287335,-0.041586436,-0.037118245,-0.0098235775,-0.09025631,0.07272314,0.05393515,0.1362558,0.040082294,0.048661374,-0.059106436,-0.0380417,-0.027924642,0.018448576,-0.046167344,0.042200882,-0.026121136,0.07934147,-0.028144281,-0.057054397,0.05523224,0.01675644,-0.02532997,0.028265405,0.0923744,-0.036506176,-0.06630925,0.032901894,0.01929298,0.07678165,-0.017146986,-0.10622696,-0.0144289695,0.051830724,0.028231986,-0.04209993,0.02596218,-0.04955544,0.050478447,-0.15687636,-0.008617841,0.05909316,0.081394635,-0.05984485,-0.002005123,-0.010754941,0.010978501,0.018477269,-0.017970478,-0.067528956,-0.003264244,0.044745393,-0.0054826755,9.7007875E-4,0.024406355,-0.017170433,-0.01654863,0.0036070184,-0.079849996,-0.014271032,-0.046559244,0.013767628,-0.0068646693,-0.058042917,0.015766766,-0.07031898,-0.051841293,0.08753831,-0.016545404,-0.05607324,0.014808497,-0.01