c({id:"Relationships:2",text:"Overview\nFOAM Relationships define typed links between models with automatic property, method, and DAO generation. They support two cardinalities:\n\n- One-to-Many (1:) - A parent owns many children (e.g., Professor \u2192 Courses)\n- Many-to-Many (:) - Objects on both sides can link to multiple objects on the other side (e.g., Students \u2194 Courses)\n\nThe key benefit of FOAM relationships is that they eliminate manual junction table management*. You declare the relationship once, and FOAM generates all the necessary models, properties, methods, and DAOs to navigate and manipulate the relationship from both sides.\n\n---",sourceId:"Relationships",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.014973665,-0.05326418,-0.05057479,0.023782292,-0.031041604,-0.019390713,-0.048111785,-0.036464334,-0.0013015913,-0.035277434,0.0034067975,-0.018400019,0.04969283,0.03903912,0.0042424547,0.10005245,0.030586755,0.0024840827,-0.018146513,0.024957646,0.06575152,0.0060920883,-0.020427113,-0.0050173644,-0.045440793,0.030833557,0.03891988,-0.06994638,0.007970741,-0.083670355,0.011334777,0.08261993,-0.05340588,-0.020739058,-0.014092491,-0.0067137294,0.005357072,0.03860856,0.01633959,-0.007576779,0.0077345725,-0.0056275004,0.08333099,-0.019009765,0.06029838,0.014157771,-0.08191334,0.0068928706,0.021522684,0.032805935,-0.08438268,-0.023493325,0.00787866,0.039301928,0.035991665,0.11665951,-0.01147444,0.0043383418,-0.114717625,-0.005077141,0.012465208,0.033158243,-0.055749092,0.019960418,0.049808957,0.0050158952,-0.01166055,0.07730723,-0.01773715,0.066282734,0.0041151517,-0.00980721,-0.00787707,0.0035897857,0.05696135,0.09135412,0.038812403,0.075763315,0.07282083,-0.06765029,-0.0374213,0.11406589,0.020659924,-0.079654954,-0.02931881,0.052706543,0.05992448,-0.0805544,-0.022398932,0.04618963,0.012871699,-0.07813584,0.0869461,-0.015971309,-0.05627307,-0.025059834,0.044462543,-0.010188312,0.018599905,0.043532826,-0.0824435,0.084750146,0.038509