c({id:"SPID:5",text:"Permission System\nSPID Permissions\n\n| Permission | Purpose |\n|------------|---------|\n| serviceprovider.read.<spid> | Read objects in this SPID |\n| serviceprovider.update.<spid> | Modify SPID assignment of objects |\n| serviceprovider.remove.<spid> | Delete objects in this SPID |\n| serviceprovider.read. | Global read access (bypasses all SPID filtering) |\n| serviceprovider.update. | Global update access |\n| serviceprovider.remove.* | Global remove access |\n\nAutomatic Permission Granting\n\nWhen a ServiceProvider is created, it automatically grants:\n- serviceprovider.read.<spid>\n- serviceproviderdao.read.<spid>\n\nThese are defined in the inherentPermissions property.",sourceId:"SPID",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.120301925,0.0012786093,-0.063897155,-0.029240534,-0.009530735,-0.009709459,0.11131568,-0.067424916,-0.018028922,0.034469713,2.3586891E-4,0.050454985,0.047918946,0.046152588,-0.0300822,1.6711288E-6,0.11592952,-0.014491418,-0.07358642,-0.03616328,0.041789666,0.0048742387,-0.06801063,0.023913281,-0.051368713,-0.0358034,-0.0117183095,-0.11932383,0.06718193,0.044700317,0.0324344,-0.047792885,0.035436835,-0.07235531,0.063343935,-0.024500202,0.08914764,-0.025882225,0.036914892,0.06311281,0.03309419,0.02782436,-0.039498836,-0.0018705255,0.056290053,0.01021017,-0.014260161,-0.041302636,-0.035308227,-0.015468003,0.06013001,0.0038812375,-0.023064671,0.013673843,-0.03491377,-0.002545501,0.0051893373,0.0414845,0.019630859,-0.02430288,-0.0503104,-0.02069072,0.034201913,-0.016279995,0.008385734,-0.009643167,0.014860391,-0.056025393,7.6524244E-4,-0.036312923,0.0124830725,0.12673524,0.0018529617,-0.0054086684,0.040910047,0.06259991,0.0052134832,0.030019267,0.014721193,-0.16443406,0.016516387,0.035804313,0.060519226,2.5026663E-4,-0.10083549,-0.007964529,-0.009749499,-0.0608123,0.0692739,0.09703559,0.010968714,0.034726463,0.029386679,-0.052461736,0.027597532,0.0060951696,-0.012131667,-0.09285349,-0.036873948,