c({id:"SPID:10",text:"Global SPID (Wildcard)\nThe special SPID value  represents global/shared data:\n\njavascript\n// Check if object has global SPID\nif ( myObject.isGlobalSpid() ) {\n  // Object is accessible to all tenants\n}\n\n// Set global SPID\nmyObject.spid = ServiceProviderAware.GLOBAL_SPID; // \"\"\n\n\nObjects with global SPID are visible to all users regardless of their assigned SPID.",sourceId:"SPID",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.039351556,0.0029119493,-0.054120366,0.014251516,0.013094376,0.001311296,0.041491505,-0.034538615,-0.0031235365,-0.07635296,0.009875979,0.014454252,-0.03113303,0.017426394,-0.04191052,0.0163628,0.03056393,0.0030680557,-0.011291125,-0.025972921,0.02405286,0.021757824,-0.040225945,0.0057982546,-0.060416516,-0.037442505,0.038359657,-0.08497901,0.045962263,0.084251575,0.120633304,-0.0050842664,0.004880703,0.031218855,0.076394744,-0.0051324433,-0.060847457,0.0049803746,0.071701184,0.019486578,0.033355955,0.0462449,-0.004015373,0.003221006,0.019749353,-0.013520659,-0.097124085,0.051912535,-0.02520302,0.051765665,0.07726346,-0.06970022,-0.052395366,0.04517665,-0.01262821,-0.004660559,-0.05672631,-0.075095,0.08946725,-0.007910911,0.003958602,-0.03373987,0.11719474,0.032611106,0.022153191,-0.03101445,-0.01944383,-0.021595875,-0.033861928,-0.06839593,0.031166056,0.053943746,0.013164778,0.02391798,0.013291011,0.011172975,-0.04171818,-0.022137478,0.038006324,-0.09941787,0.019964222,0.00799695,0.035542164,0.016178595,0.07255592,0.035797954,0.0049277777,0.022961743,0.02662976,0.04955702,-0.045154706,0.001072867,0.022549314,-0.033774134,-0.058021158,0.004139224,-0.020583525,-0.08462209,-0.024191301,0.039513834,-0.08591124,-0.037501384,0.09220317,0.07578453,0.022000749,0.023962365,0.06916433,-0.018022373,-0.023279969,0.050676625,-0.083320014,0.094824545,0.027309733,0.006853013,-0.006413285,-0.041680712,0.005522368,-0.00904294,0.06167546,-0.033696517,0.021277344,-2.1203374E-4,0.026106585,-0.032193493,-8.588442E