c({id:"Security:10",text:"Other Security Topics (TODO)\n- Security Audit  - readOnly, authNotes, nullify (other EasyDAO settings)\n- Multi-Tenancy - SPID\n- IP filtering - CIDR\n- API - DIG and SUGAR Authentication - #flowdoc/api-doc-authentication\n- Public/Private Key Pairs\n- SSL Certificates - Sockets, HTTPS\n- Long term session tokens (API Bearer tokens)\n- CSpec creation and manipulation at runtime.\n- Merge this and foam/core/auth/README.md",sourceId:"Security",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.07199107,0.0033383905,-0.08967897,-0.021876141,0.052878354,0.028085317,0.028716838,0.01958569,-0.080486946,8.388881E-4,0.043297924,-0.07443269,-0.01959926,0.0106901815,0.069798484,0.044609096,0.03973218,0.0352743,0.03265989,-5.862877E-4,-0.02089148,-0.031108571,-0.046941485,0.042224143,-0.09798804,0.048536047,0.0037663402,-0.027290722,-0.03433635,-0.018089104,0.007372371,0.031006481,0.023787515,0.029488152,-0.03367243,0.011396794,0.10565338,-0.0073671355,0.017765434,-0.055583272,-0.024504762,-0.060395274,-0.06145562,-0.026120462,-0.053010102,-0.024467655,-0.016518995,-0.030722177,0.008034129,0.060657397,0.0665172,-0.039031465,-0.012548881,0.0331364,-0.053857334,-0.01257756,-0.010933242,0.008865901,0.031119846,-0.044591244,0.0530132,-0.031222874,-0.038289495,0.119193584,0.012960436,-0.03708248,0.004195542,0.06489359,0.042620625,-0.08940163,-0.04871292,-0.03824184,-0.055149917,-0.059971984,0.0068616313,0.04148166,-0.053088013,-0.026778018,-0.029461864,-0.10189741,-0.037762735,0.043947197,0.017653048,0.09736821,-0.07360567,0.09698427,0.019177606,0.0025254078,-0.01674734,0.03964831,0.10808419,-0.016387124,0.036900226,-0.10408933,0.11296535,0.033853136,-0.04480848,-0.08386557,-0.053885672,0.022394404,-0.05605087,0.024424497,0.01700647,-0.0772658,0.10471358,0.04471116,-0.020740319,-0.051242743,0.077881105,0.08506965,-0.066295326,0.03706375,0.011223031,-0.013491959,0.051228717,-0.005058546,-0.0358624,0.005491941,-0.012608432,0.019640863,0.0097691