c({id:"Sink:1",text:"FOAM Sinks\nFOAM Sinks are the destination objects that receive and process data from DAO (Data Access Object) queries. They implement a streaming architecture where data flows from a source DAO through the select() operation to a Sink that accumulates, transforms, or processes the results 1 .",sourceId:"Sink",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.005815201,-0.02669403,-0.025881449,0.013374902,-0.020121077,-0.08200038,0.039273538,-0.058257796,0.010966346,-0.0558293,-0.050855413,-0.042198796,-0.04069308,-0.03625901,-0.03046599,0.03271029,0.07947975,-0.022531716,0.038406346,-0.0030183718,0.061632734,0.10087143,-0.11916839,-0.020035947,-0.02494164,0.08759687,0.021670932,-0.10760795,0.007090297,-0.025440753,-0.041724067,-0.0014094295,-0.029040562,-0.0036373474,0.0031427254,-0.045053333,9.032723E-4,-0.027340041,-0.05758477,0.017451871,0.030309312,-0.06452259,0.048498925,-0.008915766,0.023425037,0.012566711,-0.05883175,0.0324133,0.003950052,7.9635135E-4,-0.025782151,-0.019495415,0.04149176,0.08029148,-0.041854326,0.03476986,0.007418358,-0.016647708,-0.030292507,0.0044849436,0.040553737,0.016364519,0.038886208,0.08991062,0.0486949,-0.052211322,-0.019425,0.05040637,-0.030250289,-0.0178301,-0.06916953,0.012232599,-0.0073108817,0.0010021687,0.0424627,0.017163584,-0.024394197,-0.00693227,0.08134776,0.02204035,0.057060234,0.088530354,2.5696596E-4,-0.034104135,-0.057546537,0.0422462,0.06826997,-0.018970191,-0.020578418,-0.033255618,-0.016801754,-0.029390628,-0.018978376,-0.033569835,-5.7705696E-4,-0.037469987,0.023995684,0.021734018,0.12061757,0.018981008,-0.06988908,0.06359071,-6.072443E-4,0.021453364,-0.060556166,-0.1013347,-0.004889599,0.014171651,0.004984188,0.05825883,-0.030690083,-0.039521314,0.034361664,-0.018635955,-0.0018481987,-0.07197853,-0.05652567,-0.034267735,-0.09953913,-0.009512126,-0.033184428,-0.024287216,-0.0045684627,-0.013177191,0.071009256,-0.013752923,-0.04161282,-8.965952E-34,0.013227657,-0.11769429,0.0172843