c({id:"Sink:3",text:"Source-to-Sink Architecture\nFOAM's query system follows a \"source-to-sink\" pattern where:\n- Source: The DAO containing the data you're querying\n- Sink: The destination that receives/accumulates results\n- Flow: select() streams objects from DAO to Sink 4\n\nThis is analogous to Unix pipes, where data flows through processing stages to an output destination 5 .",sourceId:"Sink",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.03160689,-0.018631183,-0.033538114,0.019209469,-0.010116328,-0.08413333,0.05015417,-0.021566657,0.012097927,-0.008789125,-0.051517166,-0.0500932,0.0070773587,-0.10949075,-0.03694039,0.03826474,0.045587387,0.009528601,0.040926345,-0.05194194,0.071320936,0.08583787,-0.09333015,-0.032739013,0.005370368,0.07857599,0.006267896,-0.09866782,0.027561184,-0.056587365,-0.057416085,0.08697251,-0.06366337,0.029593391,-0.005962438,-0.010232177,0.027778255,-0.020599218,-0.046542004,-0.0032312693,0.10311136,-0.020474436,0.028283162,-0.021949882,-0.04718865,-0.014389783,-0.09982455,0.0058935783,0.012553475,-0.037226453,-0.12296867,-0.024160122,-0.012884335,0.113917224,0.011858807,0.038223825,-0.04327123,-0.009369088,-0.0516091,-0.002490303,0.026181174,-0.020289147,-0.048514448,0.07498525,0.09372577,-0.019035108,-0.0015461856,0.059393592,0.029877787,-0.056018908,-0.06786393,-0.011529815,-0.042281494,-0.01374066,0.05846852,0.039148867,0.012922796,0.0050143693,0.03686706,-0.02544377,0.051939156,0.07342082,-0.01594402,0.003396782,-0.03163568,0.0071485806,0.032395054,-0.051009506,0.065898195,-0.0016808277,-0.08144725,-0.052391864,0.03307691,-0.033706598,0.0070203985,-0.014882751,0.043837946,-0.012708404,0.16231269,0.03965987,-0.019727265,0.082343,0.0049960907,-0.014158621,-0.09008773,-0.076817095,0.005561574,0.059326135,0.0049046534,0.008256884,-0.0067912256,0.013353616,0.05247154,-0.09287407,0.013007749,-0.03756679,-0.057466846,-0.058147028,-0.0751311,-2.6251495E-4,-0.035889346,0.02610432,-0.038063854,-0.0055087483,0.0264160