c({id:"Sink:6",text:"Custom Sinks\nYou can create custom sinks by implementing the Sink interface:\n\njavascript\nfoam.CLASS({\n  name: 'CustomSink',\n  implements: ['foam.dao.Sink'],\n  methods: [\n    function put(obj, sub) {\n      // Process each object\n      console.log('Received:', obj);\n    },\n    function eof() {\n      // Called when complete\n      console.log('All data received');\n    }\n  ]\n});\n 9\n\nFor cross-platform sinks, provide both JavaScript and Java implementations to enable server-side execution, which reduces network traffic by processing data where it resides 10 .",sourceId:"Sink",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.0051105563,-0.021978714,0.007937547,-0.0044723786,-0.024603494,-0.090727314,-0.026168166,0.026726639,-9.4711155E-5,-0.02404701,-0.10481905,-0.031683538,-0.11145748,0.02113097,0.022410333,-0.008781928,0.064128995,0.035713386,0.027468652,-0.07177466,0.076288275,2.863285E-4,-0.016562194,-0.03916719,-0.08421755,0.03852668,0.03627396,-0.092114,0.0064516077,-0.029868472,0.012192847,-0.06954702,-0.10552183,0.04575111,-0.12543523,-0.062648945,-0.036015734,-0.033721715,-0.023990499,0.005183034,0.028057165,-0.0086221,0.0021667967,-0.020947242,0.028063808,-0.09010491,-0.08729547,0.01617433,0.03299002,0.040316038,0.032213137,-0.07274784,0.058271796,0.047605004,-0.012183342,9.867587E-4,-0.043915693,-0.0428845,0.010205421,0.041431516,0.017150711,-0.016001394,0.057823487,0.06090197,0.022851568,-0.020491181,-0.012319608,0.14605694,-0.0391668,0.090782486,-0.066432685,9.343773E-4,0.015382091,-0.04092936,-0.024686437,-0.024428472,-0.028521683,-0.01682486,-0.043605827,0.07223869,0.02274595,0.05406064,-0.044984315,0.055733096,-0.02307876,0.05353081,0.035528924,0.042441726,-0.029971678,-0.041180838,-0.09818506,0.0047811796,0.0139047755,-0.011628377,-0.08456753,0.02542291,0.0075803706,0.0032258157,0.07280853,0.044219386,-0.002753799,0.07579323,0.036318313,0.03722955,0.024447277,-0.024628118,9.803765E-4,0.06514177,-0.019