c({id:"Sink:7",text:"Specialized Sinks\nFOAM includes specialized sinks for specific use cases:\n- FnSink - Converts all sink events to calls on a single function 11\n- OrderedSink - Sorts results before delegating to another sink 12\n- NullSink - Do-nothing sink (Null Pattern) 13\n- Sequence - Executes multiple sinks in sequence 14",sourceId:"Sink",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.009454065,-0.063213274,0.01273067,-0.03253779,-0.05678279,-0.03844424,-0.0915813,0.0077431253,-0.0030189818,-0.058107678,-0.016015684,-0.040732495,-0.10689953,0.016134486,-0.07880025,-0.03543931,-0.042572524,0.050132863,0.056405846,-0.06655889,0.04386518,0.04769817,-0.01509031,-0.024947781,-0.06365493,0.009255839,-0.008499124,-0.106453754,0.030439451,-0.044775132,0.02608611,0.019247277,-0.044336755,-0.07820761,0.045152742,-0.008128982,-0.07486247,-0.05522848,-0.036728263,0.014031528,-0.004080698,-0.07558402,0.052533858,-0.051738463,0.042161763,-2.3714741E-4,-0.069248006,0.008108351,-0.06084855,0.046229605,0.028356485,0.0024628974,0.023558935,0.10152378,0.051333327,0.060405035,-0.03854348,-0.05667335,0.026848791,0.052729074,0.03870713,-0.0035633254,-0.025860833,-0.016025411,0.07684958,0.0025726503,-0.021544622,0.050921004,-0.01068829,0.0567624,-0.087695375,-0.014451656,-0.020725898,0.020307425,0.020107266,0.038751144,-0.022455756,0.013185649,-0.092040464,-0.02717645,-0.016212959,0.007838715,0.0054217973,-0.022327086,0.02447349,-0.007306678,0.010795782,0.025937539,-0.029294716,0.012148097,-0.052720454,-0.038341053,0.030899642,-0.084542006,3.8954816E-4,0.021212962,-0.023123942,0.035316255,0.08898888,0.065648474,-0.056929965,0.012162173,-2.686405E-4,0.025233967,0.018409146,-0.055184033,-0.08764014,0.02688179,-0.024455247,-0.04309046,-0.018089363,-0.010757441,0.078746945,-0.04475649,-0.030046877,-0.0136618875,-0.05406428,-0.041264102,0.05036463,0.03414642,-0.005592056,-0.0027784838,0.01044024,0.046309166,-0.009416211,0.07234927,-0.02947377,5.3771373E-33,0.0686634