c({id:"Slots:1",text:"Slots: Observable OO Pointers\nThis guide is the conceptual and advanced reference for slots. If you just want the\nhands-on basics \u2014 binding a field, a computed label \u2014 start with the\nFOAM tutorial's Reactive Slots section,\nthen come back here for the model behind them, deep slot chains, and the slot type zoo.\n\nSource of truth: foam.lang.Slot (src/foam/lang/Slot.js) and FObject.slot()\n(src/foam/lang/FObject.js).",sourceId:"Slots",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.0058043236,-0.054127913,-0.11972477,0.02537305,-0.09129647,0.019377911,0.03766809,0.03474072,0.050390586,-0.07041745,-0.009698087,-0.024684992,-0.07233682,0.058723837,0.0053853886,0.05827701,0.041143157,-0.013371774,0.05405667,0.018577978,0.079780936,9.296748E-4,-0.01526644,-0.054585107,-0.073294796,0.10311336,-0.016697569,-0.050535027,0.051580492,-0.083190866,-0.0259956,0.00636962,0.052359212,0.010628155,-0.06038119,-0.017818797,-0.017517705,-0.049975377,0.0071243136,0.0059862896,0.06381321,-0.035757914,0.044350937,-0.056945927,0.11120217,0.014666229,-0.0016571205,-0.00991925,-0.0183566,0.06634906,-0.01877611,-0.08965864,-0.032964736,0.11134258,0.025581144,0.028930448,0.034501478,-0.03643951,-0.011389237,0.008568896,0.051354114,0.035237633,0.046305593,0.07718089,0.022071501,-0.010032751,-0.014665891,0.051024947,-0.002402229,0.026185311,-0.05674083,0.06395623,0.0411091,-0.051231477,0.028171588,0.05071512,-0.009987532,0.05011832,0.11016109,-0.0072023086,-0.014628725,0.048544213,-0.006960571,-0.008646448,0.001013811,0.068422295,0.0032588327,0.010321218,-0.07929623,-0.016582493,0.03895189,-0.07542475,2.5482074E-4,-0.04474694,-0.056840524,-0.023594668,0.0056422064,-0.017918238,-0.0673044,-0.028397597,-0.021338696,0.02419791,0.015646588,-0.008952541,-0.04481408,-0.012749047,-0.072785996,-0.08515052,-0.05268021,-0.00876144,-0.03405743,-0.006278328,-0.042192712,-0.0032393152,-0.04015472,-0.008341169,0.025293387,0.015660917,0.07642353,0.025209554,-