c({id:"U3:2",text:"Node Hierarchy\nEvery piece of DOM content is a Node. The class tree:\n\n\nfoam.u2.Node             \u2190 base: toE(), isLiteral(), remove()\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 foam.u2.Text         \u2190 a DOM text node; adapts booleans and dates to strings\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 foam.u2.SlotNode     \u2190 wraps a reactive slot; replaces its DOM node when the slot changes\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 foam.u2.WrapperNode  \u2190 reparents children between elements without rebuilding them\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 foam.u2.FunctionNode \u2190 dynamic content zone marked by <!-- dynamic -->\u2026<!-- /dynamic --> comments\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 foam.u2.DAOSelectNode  \u2190 FunctionNode that implements Sink; live DAO-bound list\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 foam.u2.Element      \u2190 a real DOM element (default: <div>)\n\n\nIn practice you work with Element and let add() dispatch the others transparently. FunctionNode and SlotNode are created automatically by add() when you pass a function or a slot.\n\n---",sourceId:"U3",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.026304727,-0.004162393,0.0066324454,0.06784416,0.058668047,-0.066199854,0.0027425722,-0.05237903,0.019442046,-0.02691344,-0.020695442,0.006885047,-0.031880327,-0.054419223,0.026092274,0.06137933,2.2111129E-4,0.0067555807,0.064423926,-0.035722997,0.095174,-0.037617616,-0.031997856,-0.04072102,-0.017138645,0.11721328,-0.030835778,-0.0455419,0.08771548,-0.09913687,0.010862763,0.0014378396,0.02952664,0.010260981,-0.11332485,0.05586821,-0.016340861,-0.022713058,-0.044580378,0.034782574,0.031634364,-0.004149761,0.031875614,-0.032229707,0.08271277,0.046561778,-0.105395615,0.014230203,-0.029304875,0.011040145,0.03265934,-0.085516,0.01522535,0.10286175,-0.0013412706,0.101671025,0.0058759637,-0.010677183,0.026900351,0.025812838,0.08846584,0.038669672,0.030576672,0.05219899,0.07975044,0.0171055,-0.005545352,0.013036451,-0.015259373,0.03959396,-0.020337895,0.018003386,0.020911155,0.014819785,0.050464064,0.060748536,