c({id:"U3:3",text:"Element \u2014 The Core Class\nfoam.u2.Element wraps a single real DOM element.\n\njavascript\n// Create an element (rarely done directly \u2014 use start()/tag() inside a view)\nvar el = foam.u2.Element.create({ nodeName: 'span' }, x);\nel.add('Hello').write();   // write() appends to document.body\n\n\nKey properties:\n\n| Property | Default | Description |\n|----------|---------|-------------|\n| nodeName | 'div' | The HTML tag |\n| id | generated | The element's DOM id attribute |\n| shown | true | false adds class foam-u2-Element-hidden (sets display:none) |\n| element_ | \u2014 | Reference to the underlying live DOM element |\n\n---",sourceId:"U3",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.008170191,0.025111537,-0.03788024,0.09450388,0.10513781,-0.032272562,-0.0075806705,-0.08994203,0.055703174,-0.06901453,0.0190116,-0.019877376,0.04598852,-0.09099012,0.050052445,0.028232766,-0.020929348,-0.09956331,0.0117109595,0.082222156,0.071247466,-0.028668689,0.022038197,0.012098121,-0.018745929,0.043138415,0.03776909,-0.080002844,0.07868263,-0.04518859,0.04567041,-0.06928482,0.027955836,-0.03713846,-0.06693821,0.06434874,0.03964839,0.032929573,-0.071611315,-0.0061117206,-0.030082136,-0.0754549,0.004011447,0.032619648,0.016252222,0.01246805,-0.076058485,-0.022874331,0.018804714,0.07155249,0.005577099,-0.077986956,0.027349811,0.044906627,-0.020802293,0.059032068,-0.023388166,0.018588126,0.016749008,-4.4642724E-4,0.05207643,0.05414787,0.103030525,0.078556836,0.070208594,-0.012697636,-0.04223189,-0.020114886,-0.10566051,0.022565668,0.02812529,-0.03277005,0.049908407,-0.003833437,0.018377889,0.052659843,-9.489715E-4,0.022673888,-3.442883E-4,0.092502356,-0.03758485,0.021143157,0.0015444279,-0.035358336,-0.040504586,0.1625079,0.06789945,-0.045767486,-0.11225416,-0.020558309,-0.05753181,-0.0047908993,0.005316293,0.0034119918,-0.040422805,0.05240855,0.030825729,0.013115929,-0.07283308,0.045653407,0.0034393843,0.011220997,-0.033958536,-0.05