c({id:"U3:6",text:"CSS Scoping\nEach component owns its CSS. Styles are scoped with a unique generated class name so there are no global collisions.\n\njavascript\nfoam.CLASS({\n  name: 'StatusBadge',\n  extends: 'foam.u2.View',\n  css: \n    ^ {                           / root element of this component /\n      display: inline-block;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      padding: 2px 8px;\n    }\n    ^active { background: $success100; color: $success700; }\n    ^inactive { background: $grey100; color: $grey700; }\n    ^:hover { opacity: 0.85; }\n  ,\n  methods: [\n    function render() {\n      this.SUPER();\n      this.addClass()             // applies the root scoped class\n        .enableClass(this.myClass('active'), this.data.active$)\n        .enableClass(this.myClass('inactive'), this.data.active$.map(v => !v));\n    }\n  ]\n});\n\nThe ^ CSS Selector\n\n^ in a css: block is expanded to .foam-pkg-ClassName at install time:\n\n| CSS written | Expands to |\n|------------|-----------|\n| ^ { ... } | .foam-pkg-StatusBadge { ... } |\n| ^active { ... } | .foam-pkg-StatusBadge-active { ... } |\n| ^:hover { ... } | .foam-pkg-StatusBadge:hover { ... } |\n\nCSS API\n\njavascript\nthis.addClass()                     // adds scoped root class (myClass())\nthis.addClass('custom-name')        // adds literal class\nthis.addClass(this.myClass('sub'))  // adds scoped sub-class: pkg-Name-sub\nthis.removeClass('old-class')\nthis.enableClass('active', boolSlot)    // adds/removes class reactively\nthis.enableClass(this.myClass('x'), this.flag$)\n\nmyClass(opt_suffix) returns the scoped class name for this component. Inside dynamic() blocks, use self.myClass() (not this.myClass()) because this is the builder element inside the dynamic scope.\n\nCSS Tokens\n\nUse semantic CSS tokens from foam3/src/foam/u2/CSSTokens.js \u2014 never hardcode colors:\n\ncss\n^  {\n  background: $backgroundDefault;\n  color: $textDefault;\n  border: 1px solid $borderLight;\n  border-radius: $inputBorderRadius;\n  padding: $inputVerticalPadding $inputHorizontalPadding;\n}",sourceId:"U3",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.037272647,0.07499274,0.056072984,0.04738379,0.06472723,-0.01530743,0.082662925,-0.052430462,-0.009225722,-0.017374018,0.028760111,0.013726213,-0.005212977,-0.017887766,0.09248709,0.051267795,-0.009909565,-0.028884176,-0.11500697,0.0014376994,0.0495528,-0.025299175,-0.016308,-0.023703394,-0.07584105,0.06333692,0.06716508,-0.03892343,0.030061102,-0.05142695,-0.025613852,0.04358564,-0.07342031,0.019294629,-0.08075733,-0.020322727,-0.008039031,0.089332804,-0.008325284,-0.03276713,0.004845873,-0.014400015,-0.036777906,-0.10245341,0.039155763,-0.056848496,-0.026235277,-0.043076776,-0.023973556,-6.9299265E-4,-0.008665571,-0.07226338,0.024787316,0.04683296,-0.010344287,0.034180757,4.8594706E-5,0.05161554,0.056201242,-1.88279E-4,-0.055290848,-0.02521889,0.033171408,-0.0056991735,0.05662226,-0.025880245,0.020764653,0.009626367,-0.036934067,0.11358485,-0.010390135,0.0066895164,0.09155788,-0.0116171595,0.0070184153,0.08491943,0.014053849,0.053201117,-3.1319598E-4,-0.09850256,-0.025732493,-0.015908916,0.0053034653,-0.04795385,0.05260331,0.097699374,-0.022261793,-0.105308056,-0.03371574,-0.041468374,-0.033738587,-0.02015328,-0.012881992,0.033037636,-0.03475226,0.008982844,-0.083400406,-0.02225354,0.0067773554,0.060483284,-0.048411243,-0.021411171,-0.024851074,0.018536476,-0.02559211,-0.025635144,-0.066961594,-0.019220646,-0.034925774,0.023197824,0.004093575,0.0084382845,-0.04682086,-0.025486108,-0.018523676,0.010183024,0.06291674,-0.028907211,0.034406256,0.0033953742,0.096074246,0.03499165,0.13196921,-0.046700865,0.053832736,-0.052574255,-0.06668219,6.5177713E-34,0.06380078,-0.032346744,-0.09183659,0.0138324015,0.055765297,0.008454965,-0.030239047,-0.0072616264,-0.03255556,0.05469379,0.061324112,0.07134617,-0.009405243,-0.036514908,0.07039632,-0.038388234,0.033298064,-0.020157848,-0.07510485,0.010067147,-0.035496954,0.10475559,-0.0327