c({id:"U3:8",text:"Reactive Slots\nEvery FOAM property is accessible as a slot via the $ suffix:\n\njavascript\nobj.firstName           // current value (snapshot)\nobj.firstName$          // a Slot \u2014 reactive reference\nobj.firstName$.sub(fn)  // subscribe to changes\nobj.slot('firstName')   // same as obj.firstName$\n\nelement.slot(fn, ...deps) \u2014 ExpressionSlot\n\nInside a view, this.slot() creates a slot that re-fires when named dependencies change:\n\njavascript\nvar full = this.slot(function(firstName, lastName) {\n  return firstName + ' ' + lastName;\n});\nthis.add(full);  // reactive full name\n\nelement.dynamic(fn) \u2014 FunctionNode\n\nWhen slot content changes the DOM structure (not just a value), use dynamic():\n\njavascript\nthis.add(this.dynamic(function(isAdmin) {\n  if ( isAdmin ) {\n    this.start('button').add('Admin Panel').end();\n  } else {\n    this.start('span').add('View Only').end();\n  }\n}));\n\ndynamic() tracks the argument names just like slot() \u2014 argument names are the property names on this that it watches. The function body uses this.start() (not this.E()). Return values are ignored; build via side effects.\n\nslot() vs dynamic():\n\n| | slot() / add(slot$) | dynamic() |\n|-|-------------------------|-------------|\n| Returns | A value (string, number, element) | Builds DOM as a side effect |\n| DOM change | Replaces the previous node | Replaces content between comment markers |\n| Use when | The value changes, structure doesn't | The DOM structure itself changes |\n\nDeep Slot Watching ($ chain)\n\nWhen a reactive expression depends on a nested property, watching only the top-level object won't re-fire (the reference doesn't change). Use $ chaining:\n\njavascript\n// WRONG: doesn't fire when account.currency changes\nfunction(account) { return account?.currency; }\n\n// CORRECT: walks account \u2192 .currency and re-fires on any change\nfunction(account$currency) { return account$currency || 'USD'; }\n\nenableClass / show / hide\n\nDrive DOM state directly from slots \u2014 no imperative updates:",sourceId:"U3",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.069805935,-0.00162193,0.04044269,0.0891065,-0.002408701,-0.041075543,0.0016026085,-0.040806882,0.11912768,-0.04321037,-0.011320651,-0.08113347,-0.02918278,0.034892138,0.046133574,0.052188095,0.041433804,-0.015558545,-0.06891087,-0.023263875,0.071073346,-0.04880474,-0.063713685,-0.050320867,-0.014200523,0.055497333,-0.025913492,-0.041750424,0.017508164,-0.044699125,0.06834369,3.6602013E-4,-0.029856533,-0.023546156,-0.091592155,0.0075999447,-0.03953272,0.062326137,0.041922007,-0.04951504,-0.0017743964,0.026302978,0.0013767696,-0.13057746,0.059946746,-0.030891478,0.031474534,0.012902512,-0.09005725,0.038257524,-0.0015589473,-0.04732782,0.017862575,0.09462808,0.045753136,0.019911673,0.080804825,0.018350951,-0.009016747,-0.01075164,-0.026355436,-0.028353395,0.0085911425,0.0045171287,0.0048970142,0.035351127,0.0031088556,6.871882E-4,-0.01032295,0.0860505,0.027439868,0.048993416,0.013134709,-0.095952995,-0.011472746,0.043153256,-0.017918002,0.034558743,0.017581817,-0.060518336,0.009326922,0.009196657,-0.06270008,-0.06419863,0.054776344,0.046910703,0.013558759,-0.064017616,0.0065825973,0.01942987,-0.030556377,-0.0037296151,0.1166837,0.051846467,0.009747288,0.023930829,0.0068325554,0.059784193,-0.04225738,0.036373407,0.013185773,0.07163735,-0.05221063,0.010271268,6.601227E-4,-0.02483197,-0.057563648,-0.04457498,-0.05038538,0.04315497,-0.02996131,0.03949804,-0.018836102,-0.013975732,-0.0422978,0.004253976,0.109276645,-0.08870761,0.012241147,0.035383698,0.14356543,0.034314826,3.1793254E-5,0.02089079,0.09528641,-0.028343355,0.0028173255,4.864845E-33,0.021309434,-0.04492993,-0.054383248,-0.011925472,0.06388035,0.030290915,0.0028286371,0.013760401,-0.0073615643,0.035613228,0.022999806,0.14979541,-0.0054085925,-0.033325743,-0.021011852,-0.05156263,0.026159957,0.015419867,0.0037554277,-0.017605448,-0.045047294,2.50597E-4,-0.0