c({id:"U3:10",text:"Context and Data Binding\nFOAM's context (X) flows through the view tree. startContext() / endContext() inject values for the scope of the chain:\n\njavascript\nthis\n  .startContext({ data: this.invoice, controllerMode: foam.u2.ControllerMode.VIEW })\n    .add(Invoice.AMOUNT)          // auto-bound to this.invoice.amount, read-only\n    .add(Invoice.STATUS)\n  .endContext()\n\n\ndata in Context\n\nWhen data is in context, adding a property constant (uppercase) auto-binds it:\n\njavascript\n// These are equivalent:\n.add(Invoice.AMOUNT)\n// and:\n.start(Invoice.AMOUNT.view).setData(this.data.amount$).end()\n\n\nAttributes and Styles\n\njavascript\n.attrs({ href: this.url$, target: '_blank' })   // reactive attributes\n.attr('disabled', this.isDisabled$)              // single reactive attribute\n.style({ color: this.color$, fontWeight: 'bold' })\n\n\n---",sourceId:"U3",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.035007685,0.06350394,-0.034988575,0.06527444,-0.02038137,0.03130963,0.036924887,-0.005598415,0.051688522,-0.048270408,0.03594439,-0.01683009,0.024354177,0.008585105,0.057866793,0.07086474,0.10516214,-0.10386774,-0.06352874,0.0657024,0.08634173,0.072959416,-0.047681626,-0.062435932,0.012084385,0.07347198,-0.019614356,-0.14493737,0.09582987,-0.027543249,-0.012001879,-0.020482935,9.7368285E-4,-0.030828523,-0.06471931,-0.012271738,0.0072494103,0.05597734,0.022108644,0.08158455,0.065821536,0.015450456,-0.028834745,-0.10224386,0.036209196,0.0036867338,0.011047936,0.0191308,-0.030837119,0.06030393,-0.011470373,-0.05431774,-0.0049832095,0.06012216,0.012728605,0.02607586,0.096059375,0.004650032,-0.026548993,0.037735652,-0.033641443,0.00318956,-0.028430514,0.05420749,0.048029054,0.011161043,0.024627676,-0.0075383023,-0.08219983,-0.0013024472,0.050267395,0.010024598,0.08163499,-0.014895496,0.0645746,0.01796052,0.019360805,-0.05080491,0.03408579,-0.06235536,0.037325308,0.00721882,-0.051321965,0.018037282,0.021199644,0.07571092,0.0