c({id:"U3:11",text:"The View Lifecycle\nrender() \u2014 not init()\n\nIn U3, all DOM building belongs in render(). init() is for object initialization (listeners, startup logic), not DOM construction:\n\njavascript\nfoam.CLASS({\n  name: 'MyView',\n  extends: 'foam.u2.View',\n\n  methods: [\n    function render() {\n      this.SUPER();              // always call SUPER first\n      this.addClass()            // apply root scoped class\n        .start('p')\n          .add(this.data.description$)\n        .end();\n    }\n  ]\n});\n\n\nonDetach() \u2014 Cleanup\n\nRegister subscriptions with onDetach() so they are cancelled when the element is removed from the DOM:\n\njavascript\nfunction render() {\n  this.SUPER();\n  // BAD: subscription leaks when view is removed\n  this.data$.sub(this.onDataChange);\n\n  // GOOD: subscription cancelled on detach\n  this.onDetach(this.data$.sub(this.onDataChange));\n}\n\n\nPrefer the declarative listeners: on: binding instead of sub() where possible \u2014 it auto-detaches:\n\njavascript\nlisteners: [\n  {\n    name: 'onDataChange',\n    on: ['this.propertyChange.data'],\n    code: function() { / uses this correctly / }\n  }\n]\n\n\n---",sourceId:"U3",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.0644701,-0.017677335,0.07663155,0.035051893,0.12710898,-0.009339832,0.016836323,-0.120513156,0.08095485,-0.025018595,0.036214285,0.046153124,-0.08911634,0.009201575,-0.010692351,0.016705042,0.014951124,-0.13760251,-0.05108611,0.05121272,0.088547304,0.015977483,-0.005703045,0.021733176,0.02743213,0.044252172,0.077451885,-0.1633002,0.040320244,-0.031180996,-2.52584E-4,-0.0104610985,-0.042052746,-0.05785239,-0.10471235,0.031940114,-0.05399046,0.017757585,-0.0392567,0.03792361,-0.0010454039,0.015379461,-0.08862713,-0.043072995,0.020036694,-0.01709546,-0.039167453,-0.0848161,-0.0075653857,0.0481959,0.03981865,0.020462321,0.00467577,0.032878898,-0.013049007,-0.008392516,-0.01043156,0.07578926,-0.004586847,0.03344831,0.0106655415