c({id:"U3:12",text:"Element, View, Controller, Router\nFour base classes serve different roles:\n\n| Class | data | exports | Use for |\n|-------|--------|-----------|---------|\n| foam.u2.Element | No data property | Nothing | Raw HTML elements, layout wrappers |\n| foam.u2.View | data property | data | Displaying or editing a single object |\n| foam.u2.Controller | No inherited data; export as data | Self as data | Self-contained screens with own state |\n| foam.u2.Router | \u2014 | route | State machines with URL-reflected route |\n\njavascript\n// View \u2014 renders one object\nfoam.CLASS({\n  name: 'InvoiceView',\n  extends: 'foam.u2.View',\n  methods: [\n    function render() {\n      this.SUPER();\n      this.add(Invoice.AMOUNT.)\n          .add(Invoice.STATUS.);\n    }\n  ]\n});\n\n// Controller \u2014 owns its own state\nfoam.CLASS({\n  name: 'InvoiceDashboard',\n  extends: 'foam.u2.Controller',\n  imports: ['invoiceDAO'],\n  properties: [\n    { class: 'Long', name: 'totalAmount' }\n  ],\n  methods: [\n    async function init() {\n      this.SUPER();\n      var result = await this.invoiceDAO.select(M.SUM(Invoice.AMOUNT));\n      this.totalAmount = result.value;\n    },\n    function render() {\n      this.SUPER();\n      this.start('h1').add('Total: ', this.totalAmount$).end();\n    }\n  ]\n});\n\n\n---",sourceId:"U3",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.03552372,0.04955838,0.017281203,0.047927264,0.0141075365,-0.011389854,-0.08337188,-0.013228628,0.035423893,-0.04173945,0.004440343,-0.04472645,-0.051487215,-0.038494796,0.0612462,0.07080587,0.012369142,-0.10662686,-0.06846587,0.02040444,0.11814995,-0.01157199,-7.259719E-4,-0.01754127,0.0027823742,0.03893516,0.042118315,-0.08149926,0.018601868,-0.084047236,0.047940824,0.017853348,-0.09807971,-0.009708118,-0.06758593,-0.006412496,0.009632171,0.009817521,0.013582339,-0.045271095,0.059277266,0.046920624,-0.021505224,-0.07995021,0.04294451,-0.046625935,0.02245509,-0.057784144,0.04071