c({id:"U3:14",text:"Visibility and DisplayMode\nDisplayMode\n\nfoam.u2.DisplayMode controls how a property is rendered:\n\n| Value | Meaning |\n|-------|---------|\n| RW | Read-write (editable) |\n| RO | Read-only (visible but not editable) |\n| DISABLED | Shown but greyed out |\n| HIDDEN | Not rendered |\n\nControllerMode\n\nfoam.u2.ControllerMode is set on the context and drives property visibility:\n\n| Value | Effect |\n|-------|--------|\n| CREATE | createVisibility applies; RW by default |\n| VIEW | readVisibility applies; RO by default \u2014 downgrades RW to RO |\n| EDIT | updateVisibility applies; RW by default |\n\njavascript\n// Set via context\n.startContext({ controllerMode: foam.u2.ControllerMode.VIEW })\n  .add(Invoice.AMOUNT.)    // rendered as read-only\n.endContext()\n\n\nPer-Property Visibility\n\njavascript\nproperties: [\n  {\n    class: 'String',\n    name: 'token',\n    createVisibility: 'HIDDEN',   // not shown on create form\n    readVisibility:   'RO',       // visible but not editable in view mode\n    updateVisibility: 'HIDDEN'    // hidden on edit form\n  },\n  {\n    class: 'String',\n    name: 'notes',\n    // Dynamic visibility: function argument names = watched sibling properties\n    visibility: function(status) {\n      return status === Status.APPROVED ? foam.u2.DisplayMode.RW : foam.u2.DisplayMode.HIDDEN;\n    }\n  }\n]\n\n\n---",sourceId:"U3",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.044149246,0.041274246,-0.08063111,0.14629664,0.0757082,0.0779298,0.019929605,-0.008144415,0.04823461,-0.0019147563,0.04398457,-0.049008895,0.021328496,-0.0362098,-0.0025077066,0.052820455,0.07194668,-0.10972151,-0.09056059,0.019028895,0.13298388,0.013162822,0.022064988,-0.03431424,-0.023808196,0.039894022,-0.0117000695,-0.07559494,0.010954768,-0.051961545,-0.011530856,-0.028101483,0.021055995,-0.060088567,0.0070918635,-0.035839166,0.07279585,-0.016941734,-0.0060821353,-0.06243668,-0.011262197,-0.033545706,-0.053969618,-0.100072