c({id:"U3:16",text:"DAO-Bound Lists \u2014 select()\nElement.select() binds a DOM list to a DAO query, updating as the data changes:\n\njavascript\n// Creates a DAOSelectNode \u2014 updates live as DAO changes\nthis.select(this.invoiceDAO.where(M.EQ(Invoice.PAID, false)), function(invoice) {\n  this.start('div').add(invoice.amount$).end();\n});\n\n\nThe callback receives each object and is called in the context of the parent element. A DAOSelectNode is created, implementing Sink \u2014 DAO put(), remove(), and reset() events update the DOM incrementally.\n\nFor a complete search/browse/create/edit/delete interface, use DAOBrowserView:\n\njavascript\nthis.tag('foam.u2.view.DAOBrowserView', { data: this.invoiceDAO });\n\n\n---",sourceId:"U3",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.11841727,0.04327423,-0.024881152,0.09129879,-0.032923147,-0.08787892,0.0067820353,-0.032604042,0.10579866,-0.05931758,-0.03372044,0.053321484,-0.106748134,-0.096012,-0.031031644,0.014361432,0.047997113,-0.0111979265,-0.03951315,-0.0033261853,0.1408851,0.018731222,-0.061867572,-0.06950434,0.07234658,0.036562424,0.084566854,-0.08571268,-0.00908111,-0.0759937,0.007743467,-0.027682602,0.009084089,-0.02459998,-0.07592917,0.005270724,0.0052988417,0.0068618227,0.017558042,0.010135243,0.1201735,0.04360853,-0.017110636,-0.061488826,0.03589767,0.008318811,-0.14429156,0.038953036,0.012647511,0.025910266,-0.02655365,-0.027088758,0.024470272,0.10511772,-0.043542873,0.032267645,0.022816904,-0.02321115,-0.053274907,-0.021869836,0.02420782,0.03020934,0.0316037,0.08854764,0.06577329,-0.03473925,0.022443216,-0.03251449,-0.014138306,0.0010855779,0.030183123,0.010712722,0.079155765,-0.009705235,0.06306932,-0.024420016,0.03589633,-0.003961207,0.019300064,0.009996485,0.08687187,0.016418735,-0.04538151,0.0071712304,-0.037533633,0.052180756,0.033561256,-0.077255726,0.048430134,-0.056152932,-0.053079773,0.020759117,-0.018374393,-0.0027055577,-0.05472958,0.024546342,0.102395445,0.024427032,0.0