c({id:"U3:17",text:"Common Patterns\nSections and Detail Views\n\njavascript\n// SectionedDetailView automatically groups properties into tabs by section:\nthis.tag({\n  class: 'foam.u2.detail.SectionedDetailView',\n  data: this.invoice\n});\n\n// With property filter (propertyWhitelist):\nthis.tag({\n  class: 'foam.u2.detail.VerticalDetailView',\n  of: 'com.example.Invoice',\n  propertyWhitelist: [Invoice.AMOUNT, Invoice.STATUS, Invoice.DUE_DATE]\n});\n\n\nActions as Buttons\n\nAdding an action constant renders it as a button, automatically bound to the context data:\n\njavascript\nthis.add(Invoice.SUBMIT, Invoice.CANCEL);\n\n\nVisibility and enabled state are driven by the action's isAvailable and isEnabled functions.\n\nrepeat() \u2014 Static Iteration\n\nrepeat(n, fn) calls fn n times with the index:\n\njavascript\nthis.start('ol')\n  .repeat(5, function(i) {\n    this.start('li').add('Item ' + (i + 1)).end();\n  })\n.end();\n\n\n---",sourceId:"U3",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.08398234,0.004069009,-0.0038278,0.028862722,-0.009945768,0.04028382,0.017690193,-0.051757045,0.009442395,-0.021688433,-0.020912008,0.009810907,-0.059677023,0.02956366,0.05674609,0.010384625,0.020076279,-0.09249665,-0.07139568,0.029041236,0.15614283,0.013656362,0.0432897,-0.07930647,-0.0384522,0.07451092,0.010794683,-0.09588952,0.039396767,-0.049161024,0.10844969,-3.108785E-4,0.017258612,-0.023350716,-0.063770816,-0.03809451,-0.04396536,0.021797664,0.03988124,0.02018339,0.005721837,-0.012131566,-0.066817164,-0.04155886,0.013588475,0.006519538,0.026739994,-0.025208112,-7.80734E-4,0.07698582,-0.028546665,-0.052610327,0.029712167,0.020154845,-0.004623731,0.020582633,-0.02156623,-0.043186966,-0.0033914405,0.002559922,0.017395994,0.016616153,-0.023514105,0.03979581,-0.048381444,0.106709376,0.072318465,0.007958639,-0.03798028,-0.010858053,0.0883673,0.022325505,0.08333948,-0.020374827,0.0472993,-0.051382184,-0.046600573,-0.059548393,-0.073760465,-0.023966074,0.00