c({id:"U3:19",text:"Anti-Patterns\n| Wrong | Right |\n|-------|-------|\n| this.E() | this.start() |\n| DOM manipulation in init() | DOM building in render() |\n| this.myClass() inside dynamic() | self.myClass() (capture var self = this first) |\n| this.method() inside .sub() callback | this.method.bind(this) or a listener |\n| data$.sub(fn) without onDetach() | this.onDetach(data$.sub(fn)) |\n| Returning elements from dynamic() | Build via side effects; early return is fine |\n| Inline style= | CSS classes with ^ prefix |\n| Hardcoded colors | CSS tokens ($primary500, $textDefault) |\n| foam.lookup('MyModel') for known class | requires: ['MyModel'] then this.MyModel |\n| add(prop) for permission-gated field | add(prop.) or tag(prop., {config:{label:''}}) |\n| foam.u2.Element.create() directly in view | this.start() inside render() |\n| Watching array reference for child changes | Version counter pattern (see foam-view-builder skill) |\n\n---",sourceId:"U3",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.0605996,0.08530215,0.062114943,0.08714723,0.07203969,-0.012650547,0.06320983,-0.034372304,-0.012284084,-0.05629408,0.027447147,-0.020749602,-0.03803194,-0.03273142,0.08664156,0.09315252,0.05482314,-0.06742179,-0.09862039,-0.015761837,0.044909555,-0.005270703,0.039346136,0.013419531,-0.092092246,0.06306479,0.046599697,-0.07137269,0.11390316,-0.06451703,-0.008443627,0.06111081,-0.0667592,-0.011363106,-0.121117696,0.045924734,0.02183405,0.03784485,0.0067569246,-0.0040704305,0.005499753,-0.010778641,-0.035354774,-0.09420311,0.021676434,-0.050123446,-0.020949354,-0.07174987,-0.013282236,0.007960561,-0.016656062,-0.020274088,0.030362096,0.012083027,0.016347714,0.043049823,0.047562495,0.02555743,0.047422595,0.0023802307,0.0066453433,-0.027986443,-0.0027822636,0.023421034,0.0034588568,0.011462982,0.032427534,0.029240562,-0.011512896,0.09093147,0.0038333961,0.0070402888,0.09733922,-0.01104542,0.038950972,0.08629117,-0.019478587,0.004354522,-0.0090532955,-0.08