c({id:"U3:20",text:"Source Files\n| File | Role |\n|------|------|\n| src/foam/u2/Element2.js | The entire Element class, Node hierarchy, and all type refinements |\n| src/foam/u2/CSS.js | CSS axiom, scoping expansion, token replacement |\n| src/foam/u2/CSSTokens.js | Design token definitions (colors, spacing, typography) |\n| src/foam/u2/View.js | foam.u2.View \u2014 Element with data property |\n| src/foam/u2/PropertyBorder.js | Wraps property views with label, validation, units, visibility |\n| src/foam/u2/DisplayMode.js | DisplayMode enum and restrictDisplayMode |\n| src/foam/u2/detail/SectionedDetailView.js | Tabbed detail form with section support |\n| src/foam/u2/detail/VerticalDetailView.js | Single-column detail form, supports propertyWhitelist |\n| src/foam/u2/view/TableView.js | Sortable, paginated table |\n| src/foam/u2/view/DAOBrowserView.js | Complete CRUD interface (combines TableView + search) |\n| src/foam/u2/ActionView.js | Renders an Action as a button |\n| src/foam/core/controller/Fonts.js | Global typography classes (h100\u2013h700, p, p-*) |\n| src/foam/demos/u2/ | Runnable demos |\n| src/foam/demos/examples/ | Interactive .fbe example files |",sourceId:"U3",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.028274823,-0.0228442,-0.04382948,0.04007379,0.09523303,0.025480337,0.019953419,0.05986598,0.006178109,-0.004605408,0.004474479,-0.042332433,0.01868852,-0.055537444,0.051741436,0.043087434,-0.046241883,-0.04063459,-6.320732E-4,0.034234643,0.068787366,0.016566139,0.08697304,-0.09694712,-0.023035856,0.08098183,9.237719E-4,-0.055732362,-0.02924133,-0.11824238,0.03707341,0.045667186,-0.01452924,-0.004573517,-0.013239868,0.03159616,0.019792613,-0.0466221,-0.023234913,0.0128132105,-0.045152582,0.03380441,-0.02627715,-0.047811665,-0.008253925,-0.04969918,-0.027667379,-0.081595376,-0.0012002989,0.056399472,-0.07103596,-0.049088616,-0.049261883,-0.0135074,0.013826951,0.05927506,-0.049916748,0.028660545,0.058738757,0.03474253,0.027381966,