c({id:"VsSpring:3",text:"Architecture Patterns\nFOAM's Approach\n\nFOAM uses a unified class system across languages with declarative models 2 :\n\njavascript\nfoam.CLASS({\n  package: 'com.google.project',\n  name: 'MyModel',\n  extends: 'com.google.project.MyBaseModel',\n  properties: [...],\n  methods: [...],\n  javaImports: [...]\n});\n\n\nKey architectural features:\n- Context-based dependency injection through imports/exports 3\n- Cross-language code generation from single model definitions 4\n- Self-modeling system where Model is defined using itself 5\n- Axiom-based extensibility for adding features to classes 6\n\nSpring Boot's Approach\n\nSpring Boot uses Java annotations and auto-configuration:\n\njava\n@RestController\n@Service\npublic class MyService {\n  @Autowired\n  private UserRepository userRepository;\n\n  @GetMapping(\"/users\")\n  public List<User> getUsers() { ... }\n}\n\n\nKey features:\n- Annotation-based configuration (@Component, @Service, @Autowired)\n- Dependency injection via Spring IoC container\n- Auto-configuration for common patterns\n- Java-only runtime",sourceId:"VsSpring",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.03522493,-0.07057185,0.032976836,-0.0670344,0.036561057,0.04462875,-0.013364322,-0.012056708,-0.11288893,-0.06719372,0.020548567,-0.059501454,0.071006045,0.015771829,0.09899162,-0.03561552,0.09483855,-0.015282606,0.007289593,0.038389463,0.09163329,2.9273111E-5,-0.027384361,0.029393526,-0.05567764,0.07349559,0.024186216,-0.1182428,-0.023800522,-0.014978662,-0.014823872,0.074367836,-0.020724077,-0.020691428,-0.02277338,0.02554963,0.036049873,-0.02843849,-0.028185492,-0.008310523,-0.08428452,-0.12545635,0.07741471,-0.039975632,0.10051453,-0.032102957,1.6921751E-4,-0.03215921,-0.0022969847,-0.01700816,0.025407106,-0.07657493,-0.019903695,-0.058616567,0.023201644,0.011754322,0.023340639,0.07848434,-0.033382386,-0.010740142,0.035990115,0.009602774,-0.037514538,0.038560748,0.012903351,-0.04677428,0.01510051