c({id:"VsSpring:5",text:"Data Access Layer\nFOAM includes a comprehensive DAO (Data Access Object) system with decorator pattern 11 :\n- EasyDAO facade for assembling DAO chains 12\n- Built-in decorators for caching, authorization, validation, logging\n- File-based persistence with JDAO 13\n- Memory storage with MDAO\n- Network-transparent client/server DAOs\n- Query language via MLang\n\nSpring Boot uses:\n- Spring Data JPA/JDBC for database access\n- Repository pattern with @Repository\n- JPA entities with @Entity\n- External databases (PostgreSQL, MySQL, etc.)\n- JPQL/HQL for queries",sourceId:"VsSpring",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.07604582,0.017857546,-0.035717692,0.0032046426,-0.052519996,-0.03621557,0.014835582,-0.030360391,-0.081858695,-0.014372734,-0.026665729,0.013347077,0.010712166,-0.05078293,0.0694242,0.021396244,0.087511964,0.022474643,0.037563473,0.016144108,7.5207674E-4,0.015273621,-0.051745225,-0.015642334,0.009870107,0.034195356,0.023661522,-0.04737729,0.0129522765,-0.094773255,-4.2247307E-4,0.00857119,-0.047343582,0.030552322,-0.049373157,-0.017547725,0.08743255,-0.026297826,-0.071850665,-0.048645765,-0.03875624,-0.012274343,-0.024892928,0.0048084073,-0.00297758,-0.06138637,-0.013700874,-0.0016863775,0.0013095645,-0.025562525,-0.019969504,-0.03451093,-0.0017510658,0.07257674,0.02991198,0.047579233,-0.0198887,0.051358905,-0.09539271,0.0024687957,-0.017261634,-0.014043441,0.024305763,0.07372502,-0.035093203,-0.030117562,0.015673688,0.06897058,0.11072679,-0.12130764,-0.043413233,-0.0025143137,-0.023893153,0.0016590719,-0.03956489,0.0861279,-0.0023752318,0.04368585,0.11893484,-0.05239834,-0.009598303,0.11435903,-0.00971482,0.03928862,-0.07808172,-0.014951749,0.011093009,-0.022398042,-0.037994344,0.006384804,0.09724246,-0.00228142,-0.018454354,-0.071777076,-0.0634418,-0.06666955,0.018045286,-0.012434026,0.03861725,0.004979067,0.019770034,0.07048166,-0.010063753,0.00408805,-0.00143615,-0.039777167,-0.005317603,-0.02769