c({id:"VsSpring:13",text:"Feature Oriented Active Modeller\nFOAM is a modeling tool and class based object system.  To use FOAM,\nyou create a model of your class by describing the properties, methods,\nevent topics, listeners, and dependencies of your class.  FOAM takes\nthis model and generates a usable JavaScript class along with several\ncompanion features such as database support and network marshaling.\n\nWhile FOAM is written in JavaScript, it can be used to generate code\nfor any language or platform, including Android Java and iOS Swift.\n\n\nFile: README.md (L32-48)\nmarkdown",sourceId:"VsSpring",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.027360592,-0.06907785,-0.04933463,0.016235018,0.07220598,-0.012984266,0.006578981,-0.009119841,-0.054505643,-0.03961183,0.005344194,0.013571956,0.048385624,0.01197593,0.03803437,0.024796681,0.07380432,-0.049507417,0.015911821,0.027453069,0.04986663,0.12637943,-0.05843035,0.017262064,-0.024718907,0.023815103,0.01983729,-0.1115294,0.015520577,-0.04565303,0.032327037,-0.05154151,0.05108492,-0.032733086,-0.032214098,-0.06946849,-0.019667909,-0.042661536,-0.045492712,-0.016148482,-0.05065248,-0.08470233,0.039909218,-0.041515976,0.071502075,0.0011794067,-0.08644793,-0.0452227,0.018281616,0.042398926,-0.007817399,-0.10063874,0.010180121,-0.0372384,5.2642386E-5,0.030582057,-0.0022294673,6.0072547E-4,-0.023904102,0.0116794575,0.03529722,0.04573258,0.0140509885,0.059821587,0.04959623,-0.01992805,0.031339046,-0.010527861,0.03842244,-0.104957834,-0.060813285,-0.0067933393,0.05410983,-0.018337328,0.014953642,0.023472397,0.033184793,0.05375397,0.087231696,0.027531305,-0.05950003,-0.0017992209,0.02434719,-0.009279984,0.0014761569,0.04632496,0.05064221,-0.033640973,0.0052243723,0.028653396,-0.014238898,-0.031129094,-0.010752678,-0.029200476,-0.09404739,-0.013874608,-0.01689643,0.007729792,-0.01661952,0.06330741,-0.10983632,0.043335054,0.041237243,-0.05101443,-0.018884243,-0.046876382,-0.005777762,-0.023637334,0.02020