c({id:"VsWebComponents:14",text:"this.title$ is a live slot. Adding it to a DOM node creates a subscription \u2014 the node updates precisely in place whenever title changes. There is no virtual DOM to diff and no render() method to schedule. The FOAM class is also a full model with JSON serialisation, cross-language code generation, and DAO persistence at no extra cost.",sourceId:"VsWebComponents",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.10020147,0.06824737,0.008078163,0.027875125,0.08104728,-0.05290939,0.009908036,-0.09112767,0.07919179,-0.063930266,0.013224634,0.024141837,-0.029935231,-0.053932708,-0.009046909,0.0066547007,0.021943642,-0.03904768,-0.0054377182,0.028800065,0.056008466,0.04957647,-0.07734191,0.024930883,2.8418255E-4,0.055852883,0.04708032,-0.014470299,0.05220114,-0.08677445,0.03838239,0.029092481,-0.0046851286,-0.008931292,-0.08491236,0.06629523,-0.0011265121,-0.013002322,-0.008229193,-3.3469623E-4,0.07584225,-0.061697174,-0.05084057,-0.018973636,0.04428728,-0.035744403,-0.08048117,-0.06842388,-4.990698E-4,-0.02605154,0.023078877,-0.11697631,0.010777367,0.053481776,0.012746021,0.109985396,0.03861379,0.054544322,-0.014891453,7.070893E-4,-0.039435536,0.054540172,0.029082838,0.09101329,0.08300602,-0.072612636,-0.02635927,0.020710804,-0.013248239,-0.028708948,0.009493719,0.029729605,0.10219895,0.006314022,0.005589064,0.040538136,-0.011689805,0.04415303,0.092771076,0.012400508,0.036920402,-0.007719553,0.0062269717,-0.03852556,-0.024837554,0.1608975,0.053642817,-0.026762085,-0.037879933,-0.042756774,-0.024284564,-0.059223626,0.019684775,0.014995142,-0.17540121,0.018170213,-0.0012615161,0.02286818,-0.01877954,0.07540711,-0.005633225,0.0432995,-0.026927099,-0.018735524,0.005732597,-0.086906955,-0.02486612,0.006607091,-0.054477632,-0.00784546,-0.028858043,0.021598652,-0.053182665,-0.028364057,-0.03944076,-0.024033854,0.04641245,-0.05105839,0.1166675,-0.023821486,0.13150255,-0.0141531415,0.030304708,-0.03276491,-0.021837877,-0.09053869