c({id:"Wizard:13",text:"Triggered Save\nWhen a data model implements WizardletAware, it can implement a method called\n  installInWizardlet. This method is called and passed the Wizardlet instance\n  after the instance of the data model is set on the wizardlet's data\n  property. At this point the data model has access to the wizardlet and can\n  invoke the save method manually. When the wizardlet is saved this way, and no\n  parameters are passed to wizardlet.save, this is called a triggered save.\n  The most important difference between this and an auto save is that user input\n  will be blocked until a response is received from the server. This gives the\n  server an opportunity to update properties on the data model to provide\n  important feedback to a user.",sourceId:"Wizard",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.03144879,-0.018615494,-0.06749916,0.027010644,-0.02013465,0.034170672,0.04409902,-0.0231026,0.046274528,0.015266105,-0.0033380138,0.04795183,0.007811778,-0.11554989,-0.046529822,-0.0151401395,0.03960964,-0.108315825,-0.11900237,-0.099795334,0.05097139,-0.02121315,0.029844236,0.027822642,-0.003633977,-0.046387397,0.086428665,0.04663857,0.0817092,0.05601709,0.023491047,-0.07592479,-0.11836135,-0.010088453,-0.045385566,-0.0063223625,0.0016883836,0.09138993,0.054798517,-0.060448956,0.0045944215,-0.108669676,-0.07629097,0.037100974,-0.04476796,0.0684931,-0.041652326,-0.032171454,-0.08961037,-0.018513368,-0.015658552,-0.006389653,-0.060986184,4.1342137E-4,0.006290004,-0.018885568,0.050984878,0.048790064,-0.03265279,-0.01442512,-0.067172796,0.02767477,-0.04572443,0.061229944,-0.037798174,0.016947001,-0.033755824,-0.051296547,0.1040809,-0.1309626,0.025836192,0.0058043418,0.034441557,-0.06414386,0.016593805,0.021151723,-0.03611719,-5.2715134E-4,0.03791808,-0.004620056,0.07184809,0.05058323,0.028393175,0.0013066515,0.0042564776,-0.015212174,0.040365484,0.04140573,0.09481778,0.054270875,0.033492442,0.018865883,0.041235633,0.04461929,-0.