c({id:"Wizard:14",text:"Final Save\nFinal save is done by a context agent that appears in the wizard sequence\n  after StepWizardAgent, called SaveAllAgent. This is typically surrounded\n  by SpinnerAgent and DetachSpinnerAgent so that a fullscreen spinner can be\n  displayed after the wizard is closed and until the final save is complete.\n  The final save is not always necessary but works as a failsafe in case the\n  user closes the wizard before an auto-save is completed, or if for any other\n  reason (for example, due to an exception that was thrown) the auto-save\n  functionality fails.",sourceId:"Wizard",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.042226404,0.02393018,-0.030741388,-0.048955817,0.016499741,0.04821146,-0.050974872,0.012918014,0.037613668,0.06012145,0.011173881,0.046357706,-0.033564866,-0.08702955,-0.09692257,0.006244604,-0.065684855,-0.021480927,-0.10953709,-0.055055566,0.013393798,-0.027749699,0.02832169,0.048958328,-5.553372E-4,0.016049856,0.026598834,-0.008770887,0.036303632,0.030752286,0.027507914,-0.014282142,-0.03780202,-0.048262935,-0.046495046,0.031232418,-0.09003175,0.07985427,0.07963258,-0.08816431,0.0503997,-0.01871835,-0.0674767,0.03781295,-0.07873905,0.044209413,-0.04114163,-0.05432133,0.010309657,0.016083505,0.0064525055,0.03192501,-0.024261931,-0.0145609025,0.064600095,0.003398392,0.11657875,0.0042919605,-0.0941663,0.07093048,0.019061632,0.009371317,-0.124325834,-0.016928991,0.0570331,0.049469106,0.018211102,-0.074630775,0.076884516,-0.089557275,-0.046724673,-0.047670852,-0.013196843,-0.011285428,-0.0020599307,0.008991218,-0.05070185,-0.0076594623,-0.048116334,0.025922336,0.01615603,-0.038430847,0.0588352,-0.026036387,0.06556547,-0.004176879,0.036775984,0.013676861,0.085670024,0.051082887,-0.08081898,-0.0074748853,0.013227709,0.008174695,-0.019936033,0.015627692,0.03440229,0.014685598,1.1762327E-5,-0.034070157,0.029475957,-0.042276297,0.099460535,0.016663358,0.06168766,-0.12621473,0.09442618,-0.033443585,0.0292