c({id:"agentsnotprotocols:9",text:"The Summary of the Summary\nPublish an agent, not a protocol.\nCode travels. Papers diverge.\nThe second-best network call is one the caller doesn't know is happening.\nThe best \u2014 and most reliable \u2014 is the one that never happens at all.\n\nSlides: here",sourceId:"agentsnotprotocols",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.10182086,0.0023385,-0.027534286,-0.026671842,-0.018603496,-0.027750725,-0.017997822,0.046055723,0.06730789,0.0015654219,-0.016171485,0.086303145,0.022623837,-0.025482137,-0.034773737,-0.048190102,0.080069296,-0.042569134,0.017267767,-0.03639112,0.017753316,6.42454E-4,-0.015521447,-0.036783736,0.0651355,-0.020587942,-0.048430797,-0.018580435,-0.017126122,-0.02966985,0.015669305,0.119695574,-0.016772877,0.04013095,-0.016026314,0.043043107,-0.021570208,0.012766287,0.019313838,0.034806922,0.03918091,-0.025873024,-0.05036635,0.044505708,-0.05229822,-0.06684702,-0.04864374,0.029612787,-0.06203131,-0.0323595,-0.08837417,0.02759395,0.0099937795,0.046369977,0.09082347,-0.03734475,-0.06043096,0.021480175,-0.013798028,-0.009117286,0.020225687,0.0034871479,-0.09836651,0.05420581,0.10747144,0.058192972,-0.015718704,0.035867136,-0.01756035,-0.0374898,-0.044319097,0.00594802,-0.035773233,0.028888969,0.07079066,0.019855596,0.04078821,0.0048754816,0.017901996,-0.03473036,7.1990303E-6,-0.06985586,-0.0036785505,0.06637007,0.024966558,-0.022794792,0.025718372,-0.023199797,0.0013156909,-0.007980844,-0.047158152,-0.006306212,0.047870815,0.037005514,-0.02670772,0.08569623,-0.06456248,-0.12395139,0.0017653852,0.07208873,-0.031631283,-0.029998612,-0.0171305,-0.13776635,0.032025557,-0.043482717,0.027937584,-0.023344513,0.0764257,0.04135198,-0.017351946,-0.017342938,-0.004281491,-0.029749684,0.03590504,0.019296777,0.084946044,0.13552171,0.072599165,-0.063608125,-1.3983899E-4,0.037734725,0.07024033,-0.011327382,0.0082141785,0.057883848,0.09947684,-4.5373928E-33,-0.016008915,-7.7033037E-4,-0.03427576,0.09731