c({id:"cheat-sheet:0",text:"cheat-sheet\nA long-form FOAM3 cheat sheet: class definition syntax, property types, methods, listeners, actions, DAOs, reactivity.\n\nKeywords: cheat sheet, reference, syntax, quick reference, knowledge\n\n<flow name=\"cheat-sheet\" category=\"DOC/GUIDE\" spid=\"foam\" description=\"A long-form FOAM3 cheat sheet: class definition syntax, property types, methods, listeners, actions, DAOs, reactivity.\" keywords=\"cheat sheet,reference,syntax,quick reference,knowledge\"/>\n\n<!-- START doctoc generated TOC please keep comment here to allow auto update -->\n<!-- DON'T EDIT THIS SECTION, INSTEAD RE-RUN doctoc TO UPDATE -->\nTable of Contents  generated with DocToc\n\n- FOAM3 Cheat Sheet (long form)\n- Models\n  - Properties\n    - Defaults\n    - Expression Behavior\n    - Dynamic Get and/or Set\n    - Property Types (FOAM3 Current)\n      - Numeric Types:\n      - String Types:\n      - Date/Time Types:\n      - Object Types:\n      - Collection Types:\n  - Methods\n  - Listeners\n  - Actions\n- DAOs\n- Reactivity\n  - Listen to Changes\n  - Display Properties\n  - Computed Values\n  - Dynamic Views\n- Context and Dependency Injection\n  - Context and Subcontext\n  - Imports and Exports\n  - Context and Object Creation\n  - Context Patterns\n\n<!-- END doctoc generated TOC please keep comment here to allow auto update -->",sourceId:"cheat-sheet",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.09028276,-0.038293056,-0.02323513,0.037511606,0.050929982,0.062468465,-0.030618716,0.026051138,-0.018368263,0.062858604,-0.030607972,-0.06621383,-0.014873169,-0.056226663,0.030360393,0.06863146,0.025266713,-0.060225666,-0.037989285,0.07796073,0.11581756,0.08493197,-0.004312111,0.044612423,-0.034011707,0.042807207,-0.0684312,-0.051822923,-0.035368875,-0.06419013,-0.0076756645,0.08734471,0.025019905,-0.008976032,0.029123623,0.015597127,-0.007920548,-0.022869177,0.019118223,0.01146499,-0.037559852,-0.04755262,0.015508133,-0.03412301,0.0487