c({id:"crunch-doc:1",text:"Continuous Reactive User Nano-Capability Hierarchy\n<foam class=\"foam.flow.widgets.DocumentationIncomplete\" status=\"wip\"></foam>\n\nCRUNCH is a CORE subsystem that enables flexible definitions of incremental steps users can take to gain access to features of an application. A key principle of CRUNCH is the user will only enter new information at the time it's required to perform an action. (although it is possible to have users add information ahead of time also)",sourceId:"crunch-doc",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.005915488,-0.048770025,-0.06944314,0.025381248,0.023491912,-0.07441436,0.015615211,0.069228284,-0.104709156,-0.023172336,0.021582415,-0.017425813,0.016875003,0.01638418,0.05977489,0.024624504,0.056505073,-0.052515313,0.0070543825,-0.08631224,0.059084088,-0.021141307,0.0023921016,0.016629865,-0.063634016,0.060053755,-0.047321804,-0.091237046,0.09835633,0.017078172,0.06892364,0.07577904,0.09441704,-8.82544E-4,0.0015811241,0.058740806,-0.019592214,0.04738114,-0.06052839,-0.034933567,-0.05027889,-0.042533323,-0.02812398,-6.8420725E-4,0.040521257,-0.059074033,-0.019556208,-0.04707304,-0.028324703,0.041394655,-0.03301432,-0.07164947,0.02522637,0.01667187,0.045276303,0.03656349,0.07035442,0.018559838,-0.008658477,-0.059422217,0.050353825,-0.08875601,-0.020584863,0.035098393,0.12329468,0.050606236,0.038154073,-0.05776764,0.045149304,-0.013668884,-0.037829712,-0.0097301565,0.002463143,-0.042092077,0.032718055,-0.01197979,0.031290166,0.0065401476,0.028862102,0.040030587,-0.030015426,0.058129054,0.006901801,-0.03774428,-0.030655064,0.10463006,0.061375655,-0.04314393,-0.019458022,-0.0047243102,0.032416526,-0.05486142,0.022166707,-0.032255795,-0.11644698,0.014505398,0.013481298,-0.051590346,-0.016680542,0.028432956,-0.039972868,0.04831305,0.04318525,-0.026827568,-0.077018976,-0.108572185,-0.013373482,2.4664841E-4,-0.060217988,0.117291935,-0.046688385,-0.034596015,-0.010777795,0.010085093,0.030832324,0.03