c({id:"doc:2",text:"Wizard Sequences\nCrunchController methods for invoking the wizard return instances of Sequence.\nA sequence contains a number of steps that can be reconfigured or removed before\nexecuting the whole chain. More information about sequences can be found in the\ndocumentation for\nfoam.util.async.\nThe following documentation is derived from the sequence, as sequences are\nself-documenting.\n\nSequence from createWizardSequence\n\n<foam class=\"foam.flow.widgets.SequenceSummary\" of=\"foam.u2.crunch.CrunchController\" method=\"createWizardSequence\"></foam>\n\nSequence from createCapableWizardSequence\n\n<foam class=\"foam.flow.widgets.SequenceSummary\" of=\"foam.u2.crunch.CrunchController\" method=\"createCapableWizardSequence\"></foam>",sourceId:"doc",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.080854766,-0.05346848,-0.0814913,-0.004047019,-0.045499396,-0.006050879,-0.03642507,-0.022234771,0.0045776325,-0.1122049,0.020103121,0.011372147,-9.891158E-5,-0.056084238,-0.03641504,-0.012119882,-0.019270854,-0.056116026,0.06527735,-0.07155437,0.11137656,0.05356928,0.06165583,0.030258281,-0.054440275,-0.05633264,0.044911608,-0.017783528,0.06735497,-0.018110592,0.14679886,0.046668623,0.021419352,-0.06503632,0.07023148,0.05485726,-0.031559657,-0.009304027,-0.007161214,-0.0046985405,0.032901496,-0.0034681123,-0.036645304,-0.018549854,0.046908546,-0.0258892,-0.11512384,-0.05105425,0.0016252417,0.04518425,-0.008278331,-6.413508E-4,-0.01262473,-0.0075648716,0.04210273,-1.250002E-4,-0.0053722863,0.037790112,0.019879369,0.02959749,0.079093754,-0.01252456,-0.04875023,0.025420342,0.06987649,0.017952804,0.037828967,-0.01582443,0.06972849,-0.02539452,-0.118710205,-0.03546331,0.041126043,0.015181595,0.04140623,0.071781516,-0.016661871,-0.030846983,-0.07614246,-0.008554104,-0.06304195,0.033167727,0.0818859,-0.02299883,-0.022079194,0.038194835,0.06331833,-0.008723384,0.057677124,6.795333E-4,0.002070849,-0.057689253,0.039189506,-0.00482686,-0.01674688