c({id:"foam_parser_callback_system_explained:3",text:"The Core Architecture\n\u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510\n\u2502                        PARSING FLOW                              \u2502\n\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2524\n\u2502                                                                  \u2502\n\u2502   Input String \u2500\u2500\u25ba StringPStream \u2500\u2500\u25ba Parser \u2500\u2500\u25ba Result/undefined \u2502\n\u2502                         \u2502                                        \u2502\n\u2502                         \u25bc                                        \u2502\n\u2502                   apply(parser, grammar)                         \u2502\n\u2502                   (intercepts EVERY parse call)                  \u2502\n\u2502                                                                  \u2502\n\u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518\n\n\nKey Components\n\n| Component | Description | File Location |\n|-----------|-------------|---------------|\n| StringPStream | Immutable stream of characters with position tracking | foam/parse/StringPStream.js |\n| Parser | Object with parse(ps, grammar) method | foam/parse/parse.js |\n| Grammar | Collection of named parsers (symbols) with actions | foam/parse/parse.js |\n| apply | Callback that intercepts every parse operation | StringPStream.js:85 |\n\n---",sourceId:"foam_parser_callback_system_explained",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.07238664,-0.08252322,0.023076294,-0.022016633,-0.021615019,-0.031730227,-0.023990056,0.048543822,0.051318545,-0.045416977,-0.0048245885,0.0048998552,-0.031241802,0.021354882,0.036899947,-0.016484661,-0.028560758,0.016385645,-0.036350906,-0.0855539,0.07971522,-0.027523529,-0.083566174,0.0057862,-0.0136678815,0.10946894,-0.013996286,-0.076635204,0.04814228,-0.016350517,0.051694207,-0.07852379,0.019482074,0.05389019,-0.022476947,0.14504482,0.017563792,-0.08846395,0.009733254,-0.06069843,0.021360075,0.029968888,-0.1061118,-0.041477896,0.034465805,0.0056922603,-0.019932926,-0.03535357,-0.15723456,-0.03088703,-0.045335375,-0.054164708,-0.021157183,0.054013748,-0.0044501503,0.020889968,-0.0412631,0.028509296,0.037482165,0.001711304,-0.021211207,-0.037879366,-0.03790191,0.028920216,0.036018066,0.020025084,0.0085654175,0.03964454,0.008303521,-0.006394624,-0.09067639,0.058230888,-0.005558187,0.035428703,-0.06012352,0.027516782,9.934953E-4,0.013852185,-0.003096982,-0.05478509,0.034476336,-0.057094734,0.063402705,0.066369385,0.02040876,0.08246239,-0.0067604254,0.032716427,0.0057914574,0.03625132,-0.06878634,-0.13168716,0.091040745,0.014807513,0.032693442,0.07433375,-0.09577995,-0.030308763,0.0019650871,0.019253181,-0.05501947,0.048148684,0.120153315,-0.081457,-0.029707642,0.0152093265,-0.06599848,0.035266675,0.034501277,-0.04850424,-0.04496347,0.111900136,0.021293903,-0.04456374,0.026725242,-0.040099304,0.045172904,-0.05298