c({id:"foam_parser_callback_system_explained:9",text:"if ( ! result ) {\n  console.log(grammar.getLastError());\n  // Output: \"Unexpected character 'x' at index: 5, Expected one of: [a,b,c],\n  //          Text leading up to this was: ...\"\n}\n\nHow getLastError Works\n\n\u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510\n\u2502                  getLastError() INTERNALS                       \u2502\n\u251c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2524\n\u2502                                                                 \u2502\n\u2502   1. Creates ErrorReportingPStream                              \u2502\n\u2502   2. Re-parses with error tracking                              \u2502\n\u2502   3. Records [position, parser, grammar] at each failure        \u2502\n\u2502   4. Keeps the FURTHEST failure point                           \u2502\n\u2502   5. Tests all ASCII chars to find \"valid\" next characters      \u2502\n\u2502   6. Builds human-readable error message                        \u2502\n\u2502                                                                 \u2502\n\u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518\n\n---",sourceId:"foam_parser_callback_system_explained",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.03607401,0.02074583,0.08284208,0.023465974,0.0050799334,-0.010147481,0.02463891,0.0028311925,0.041829776,-0.014488158,0.016076386,-0.032629475,0.060096856,-0.017502014,-0.044752333,-0.044183355,-0.1291169,0.020821491,-0.052548382,-0.079004005,0.05680448,0.047509413,-0.06861751,0.051882945,0.003501842,0.06614578,-0.11484476,-0.06619734,-0.002856211,-0.007830676,-0.011925198,-0.09432707,-0.061471477,0.048304256,0.11228047,0.019591784,-0.045616515,-0.057512328,0.039672896,-0.03263929,-0.06488069,-0.009420116,0.013862815,0.061635952,0.03623255,-0.03773311,-0.099869475,0.002591847,-0.033583067,-0.0037396054,-0.07052579,0.03347224,0.09122687,0.020154713,0.046069402,-0.006290997,-0.05649625,0.009952406,0.037227266,0.030214632,-0.0010650203,-0.044787668,-0.05393373,-0.011679718,0.028424056,-0.021321833,0.026693372,-0.011317082,-0.08302996,0.10330537,-0.076537296,-0.043784983,-0.05222829,0.12955077,0.0071820426,0.09283263,0.028473202,-0.06346816,0.0594698,0.056077305,-0.036505934,-0.07297277,0.07320894,0.062401883,0.024821024,-0.010291978,-0.054471206,0.056193568,0.025524568,0.060156975,-0.047487352,-0.10840746,1.3255503E-4,0.09340499,0.01077828,0.09653282,-0.011034241,-0.058668613,0.0013167388,0.03383679,-0.031200439,0.026161281,0.104854934,-0.08921277,-0.026913164,0.013602427,-0.0026519601,-0.0644152,0.062325075,-0.062161718,-0.044338223,0.00806587,0.030322416,-0.007731472,0.049108576,0.03142268,0.03829836,0.0052783326,-0.022438167,0.043720312,0.041153263,-0.019796213,0.019919464,0.08034779,0.041602787,-0.046331286,0.048504885,5.2786837E-33,-0.016251557,0.037067786,-0.04934454,9.5549325E-4,-0.017645251,0.01463215,-0.053612396,0.04846801,-0.04093159,-0.034269523,0.052808303,-0.1