c({id:"foam_parsers_doc:1",text:"- FOAM Grammar-Based Parsers for JavaScript\n  - Introduction\n    - Benefits of FOAM Grammar-Based Parsers\n    - How FOAM Parsers Work\n  - Simple Parsers\n    - Setting Up\n    - literal(str, optvalue)\n    - literalIC(str)\n    - anyChar()\n    - eof()\n    - chars(str)\n    - notChars(str)\n    - range(start, end)\n  - Parser Combinators\n    - seq(...parsers)\n    - seq1(index, ...parsers)\n    - seq0(...parsers)\n    - alt(...parsers)\n    - repeat(parser, optdelim, optmin, optmax)\n    - repeat0(parser, optdelim, optmin, optmax)\n    - plus(parser, optdelim)\n    - optional(parser, optvalue)\n    - not(parser, optparser)\n    - until(parser)\n    - until0(parser)\n  - Value Transformation Parsers\n    - str(parser)\n    - substring(parser)\n  - Grammars\n    - Creating a Grammar\n    - sym(name)\n    - Example: Matched Parenthesis Parser\n    - Example: Phone Number Grammar\n  - Semantic Actions\n    - Defining Actions\n    - Example: Expression Interpreter\n  - Grammar Reuse\n    - Composition\n    - Inheritance\n  - Utility Methods\n    - match(input)\n    - matchAll(input)\n    - getSymParser(symbolName)\n    - stringPStream(str)\n  - Auto-Complete Suggestions\n    - Suggestion Class\n    - Creating Suggestions with sug()\n    - Suggestion Categories\n    - Example: Query Parser with Suggestions\n    - Custom Suggester Views\n    - SmartView - The Suggestion UI\n    - How Suggestion Collection Works\n    - Building Dynamic Property Suggestions\n    - Nested Property Suggestions\n  - Parser Messages\n    - Creating Messages with msg()\n    - Message Properties\n    - Example: Empty File Detection\n    - Collecting Messages\n  - Best Practices\n  - Complete Example: Email Address Parser\n  - Live Examples\n\n<!-- END doctoc generated TOC please keep comment here to allow auto update -->",sourceId:"foam_parsers_doc",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.0564978,-0.085445404,0.030933483,0.018289639,-0