c({id:"i18n:2",text:"Where translations live\nTwo kinds of files hold i18n data. Knowing them up front makes the examples below make sense:\n\n- Model code (.js) \u2014 messages: entries and inline label: { en, fr } maps declare a string's default text per language, right next to the model. This is what this guide covers.\n- locales.jrl journals* \u2014 rows of foam.i18n.Locale that supply or override translations at runtime, keyed by a source string. Framework defaults live in foam3/src/foam/i18n/{enus,frfr,pt_pt}/locales.jrl; app-specific rows go in journals/locales.jrl. The languages offered in the picker are seeded in foam3/src/languages.jrl. All of these are covered in the advanced guide.",sourceId:"i18n",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.055124678,-0.009604015,-0.0020082565,-0.023423113,0.048382204,0.020913847,-0.032475427,-0.016964296,0.08861902,-0.062499866,0.008593309,-0.0012564095,-0.033009574,0.03128125,-0.016792715,-0.047322977,-0.008414125,0.032095425,0.011024822,-0.030555792,0.04847896,0.041685794,0.0736974,0.016166419,0.07040459,0.05326869,-3.7393149E-4,-0.01798114,0.03828942,-0.027744062,-0.028986221,0.07768328,0.020272605,0.0070005553,0.006892811,0.060821567,0.0031912657,-0.097694345,0.03680214,0.010679545,-0.021249648,-0.04269597,0.009059766,-0.041102562,0.014197288,0.0030176186,-0.014402536,0.03751601,-0.051109474,0.061998677,-0.040591694,-0.04294284,0.020997524,-0.045568455,0.035001926,0.016623076,-0.009837272,0.018146472,0.025667168,0.09336912,-0.00601194,0.051045287,-0.045815613,0.09137695,0.017391594,0.013248904,0.0049694646,0.0642076,-0.024155898,-0.10114656,-0.075112425,0.0036862625,0.0618099,0.050127074,-0.013928277,0.024488915,0.0059399856,0.023778517,0.029978096,-0.068779685,-0.011894945,0.024876337,0.09585063,0.0017109405,-8.3074556E-4,0.029456327,0.06490663,-0.011326204,0.093669154,0.10747102,-0.0042605028,-0.13629672,0.020827161,0.05187199,-0.02500932,0.0642352,-0.028553335,0.07748016,0.0053578564,-9.86793