c({id:"i18n:4",text:"Defining Messages\nBasic Static Messages\n\nAdd a messages array to your model definition with message objects:\n\njavascript\nfoam.CLASS({\n  package: 'foam.core.auth',\n  name: 'User',\n  messages: [\n    { name: 'USERNAMEREQUIRED',    message: 'Username required' },\n    { name: 'INVALIDFIRSTNAME',   message: 'Invalid characters in first name: ' },\n    { name: 'RESETPASSWORDSENT',  message: \"Password reset request sent.\" }\n  ]\n});\n\nThis installs properties like USERNAMEREQUIRED on the class that return the message string.\n\nMulti-Language Support\n\nUse messageMap to provide translations for different locales:\n\njavascript\nmessages: [\n  {\n    name: 'MYSTRING',\n    messageMap: {\n      en: 'English',\n      fr: 'Francais',\n    }\n  }\n]\n\nFOAM resolves messages by checking messageMap[foam.locale], then messageMap[foam.language], then messageMap.en.\n\nYou don't have to translate every string into every language. Declare only the languages you've done \u2014 English alone is fine. Any locale with no entry falls back to messageMap.en (foam3/src/foam/i18n/Messages.js:96), so untranslated strings show English rather than break. Add the rest later at runtime, with no code change \u2014 as Locale rows in a locales.jrl (keyed Class.MESSAGENAME) or via the Translation Console (advanced guide).\n\nDon't set both message and messageMap on one entry. message only writes the current locale's text into messageMap, so combining the two makes the outcome depend on declaration order. For multiple languages use messageMap alone, and always include an en fallback.\n\nA messageMap declares the code defaults. At runtime, the application boot path can override these from localeDAO \u2014 see the advanced guide.\n\nInline Localized Labels\n\nAny String-valued attribute on a model \u2014 a property label or placeholder, or an action label/ariaLabel \u2014 accepts a locale map directly, with no separate messages entry:",sourceId:"i18n",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[0.022505645,-0.023620578,0.048025176,-0.022032691,-0.018621504,-0.015615567,0.040464617,0.005623546,0.010824993,-0.08546375,0.017957732,-0.099699184,0.028082699,0.067966715,0.036550984,0.0032230224,0.055437732,-0.04196928,-2.031118E-4,0.020239985,0.09722667,0.033051565,0.08291047,0.05108144,0.0033580037,0.03116875,0.0076661576,-0.03354762,-0.05015278,-0.01073853,-0.017942928,0.08306632,-0.009497628,0.038219508,-0.0010674229,0.048224423,-0.019707222,-0.029945375,0.0010373164,0.009729278,-0.08895209,-0.028880997,-0.014065496,-0.06587466,0.03032802,-0.039040238,2.9408536E-4,0.044635355,-0.026154313,0.050026108,0.019273322,-0.05415598,-0.012426005,2.7042703E-4,0.03947638,-0.009994484,-0.014882126,0.047052387,-0.0010531546,0.008227189,-0.044134613,0.034688637,0.02160875,0.04900545,0.04972091,-0.0066876635,-0.011204785,0.0037019998,-0.025866624,0.010053398,-0.05876088,0.016286343,0.028402526,0.016845854,-0.06837474,0.08262266,0.012717835,0.039072763,-0.005157089,-0.010400845,-0.033113066,0.024444474,0.01890895,-0.033092428,0.043887485,-0.017396007,0.008755375,-0.044683658,0.095904365,0.017211802,0.008192092,-0.13342188,0.021753987,0.083577774,0.035584148,-0.008891078,-0.02958337,0.054398883,-0.053157885,0.018911557,-0.028357381,-0.01585509,0.08394739,-0.008532175,0.028857756,-0.042165253,-0.03651197,-0.07399115,-0.034511756,-0.020790303,4.50994E-4,-0.0031708127,0.0056636264,0.054237317,0.024929607,-0.03092083,0.062180255,-0.062815346,0.03177793,0.03762536,-0.036277052,-0.08986767,0.04089757,-0.026475625,0.013342798,0.0374438,0.013321008,6.966479E-33,0.05821814,0.037208796,0.0068859337,0.11712895,0.053434547,-0.024811065,-0.028632635,-0.014052049,-0.013013587,-0.09741478,-0.018007888,0.09552262,0.04617271,-0.010246066,0.022873519,0.008649493,0.046715863,6.500896E-4,0.055692304,0.06428676,0.060405575,0.06906475,0.04920326,-0.012674681,0.004636127,0.06685852,0.015923567,-0.06874148,-0.08350972,0.0062947175,-0.025656354,-0.07695094