c({id:"i18n:5",text:"javascript\nproperties: [\n  {\n    class: 'String',\n    name: 'defaultText',\n    label: { en: 'Default / English', fr: 'Par d\u00e9faut / anglais' }\n  }\n],\nactions: [\n  {\n    name: 'save',\n    label: { en: 'Save for selected locale', fr: 'Enregistrer pour la locale s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9e' }\n  }\n]\n\nFOAM picks the value for foam.locale, then the language prefix (fr for fr-CA), then falls back to en (foam3/src/foam/lang/types.js:47-62). This is the shortest way to localize a single label.\n\nCaveat \u2014 it's a plain default, coerced once. The String property adapt picks the current locale's string when the value is set and stores that plain string (foam3/src/foam/lang/types.js:47-62). A property label is declared I18NString (foam3/src/foam/lang/types.js:1432), but that class adds no translation: it extends String, inherits this adapt, and only reports label reads to the Translation Console while it is open (foam3/src/foam/lang/types.js:113-136). That covers the common cases: switching language reloads the page (foam3/src/foam/core/auth/LanguageChoiceView.js:81) and re-picks the locale, and the text can still be overridden at runtime by a Locale row keyed Class.PROPERTY.label \u2014 no message needed (advanced guide). What an inline map can't do is use ${} templates or expose the string as a reusable constant. For those, define a messages entry and feed it to the label \u2014 via a labelFormatter (this.add(data.MYMSG)) for a property, or a render()-time label: arg for an action. An entry from messages[] does not become a label: on its own.\n\nTemplate Messages with Parameters\n\nEnable the template flag to use ${} placeholders for dynamic content:\n\njavascript\nmessages: [\n  {\n    name: 'MSGCONSTANT1',\n    message: 'Message text with one ${templateKey1} or more ${templateKey2} template keys',\n    template: true\n  },\n  {\n    name: 'MSGCONSTANT2',\n    message: '${this.MSGCONSTANT1} or ${this.propertyName}',\n    template: true\n  }\n]",sourceId:"i18n",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[0.02944967,0.010141428,0.0071250396,0.060335558,0.0077543855,0.08047613,0.07869448,-0.014708307,0.06898894,-0.0678702,0.022601267,-0.06363105,-0.06355033,0.008378116,0.05286443,0.031238984,0.0656037,-0.031788945,-0.010272228,0.015189802,0.07908354,0.018384453,0.11413416,0.06559599,0.027216792,0.062485617,-0.027272113,-0.007097394,-0.0061717615,-0.002680928,-0.0043814993,0.060394462,-0.04284098,0.017113147,-0.018426022,0.101392694,-0.025971321,0.011823436,0.0275963,0.027119149,-0.015512892,3.890856E-4,-0.015206962,-0.046469122,-0.020587455,0.018112704,-0.011387113,-0.009611748,-0.13226661,0.079439655,0.007117792,-0.02175121,-0.030374946,-0.03154389,-3.2263933E-4,0.016186066,-0.021514704,0.042349774,0.061751902,0.06698098,-0.055144027,0.05165828,0.030519012,0.030594151,0.04043808,0.029197114,0.023917941,0.00994297,-0.06780023,0.010126538,-0.011664122,0.018157685,0.0686485,-3.4644164E-4,-0.046251416,0.024516068,-0.026263067,0.0011616746,-0.018078504,-0.022692237,-2.2995588E-4,0.04152808,0.008573422,-0.031271197,0.061841663,0.028465029,0.04826804,-0.04687196,0.11574875,0.03838819,-0.020216906,-0.122173585,0.03682354,0.05429489,0.015010722,-0.016426068,-0.035173148,0.046759974,-0.03429285,-0.0066800253,0.029256659,0.027662285,0.022848938,0.002902331,0.028255144,-0.07980599,-0.04384149,-0.07202829,-0.025966683,0.017901212,-0.010653711,0.034049947,-0.03796093,0.01757952,-0.06210085,-0.04569028,0.06843406,-0.10029624,0.06717973,0.04749049,-0.0012433483,-0.0766445,-0.0048325458,-0.023847789,-0.026213752,0.005474684,0.004682337,3.4570224E-33,0.028267806,0.0022513787,-0.019752726,0.052157126,0.04723927,-0.026295915,-0.040677913,0.009924394,-0.019840162,-0.031314284,0.035783716,0.11311154,-0.0080830855,0.0020601242,-0.010848266,-0.008556608,0.0680497,0.0704215,-0.012703202,-0.005798728,0.020452715,0.08432264,0.038804725,-0.05420925,0.023475979,0.045979373,-0.026837343,-0.0069223596,-0.05778017