c({id:"i18n:6",text:"Template keys resolve from:\n1. Explicitly provided values during rendering\n2. this[key] for instance properties or other class constants\n3. Dot notation for nested FObject properties.\n\nThere are two ways to fill in the ${} placeholders.\n\nWay 1 \u2014 pass the values in. The placeholder name matches a key you pass:\n\njavascript\nmessages: [\n  { name: 'GREETING', message: 'Hello, ${name}!', template: true }\n]\n\n// Call it with that key:\nthis.E().add(this.GREETING({ name: 'Sam' }));   // \"Hello, Sam!\"\n\nWay 2 \u2014 read the values from the object itself. Write ${this.propertyName} and call the message with no arguments. FOAM reads the property straight off the object:\n\njavascript\nproperties: [\n  { name: 'firstName' }\n],\nmessages: [\n  { name: 'GREETING', message: 'Hello, ${this.firstName}!', template: true }\n]\n\n// No arguments needed \u2014 it reads this.firstName:\nthis.E().add(this.GREETING());   // \"Hello, Sam!\" when firstName is \"Sam\"\n\nHeads up when using Way 2 inside an expression: an expression only re-runs when a property in its argument list changes. So list every property your message reads \u2014 otherwise the text won't update when that property changes.\n>\njavascript\nmessages: [\n  { name: 'FULLNAME', message: 'Hello, ${this.firstName} ${this.lastName}!', template: true }\n],\nproperties: [\n  {\n    name: 'greetingMsg',\n    // BUG: only firstName is listed. Change lastName and this does NOT\n    // re-run \u2014 the greeting keeps the old last name.\n    // FIX: list both \u2192 expression: function(firstName, lastName)\n    expression: function(firstName) {\n      return this.FULLNAME();\n    }\n  }\n]\n\nMessage Name and Class Constant Conflicts\n\nMessages install constants on the owning class. Properties, actions, listeners, methods, inner classes, and existing messages also reserve class constant names. Do not add a message whose constantized name collides with any existing slot on the same model.",sourceId:"i18n",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.04227119,0.09306625,0.091219164,0.11239774,0.0090661915,-9.953037E-4,0.05068677,-0.028881053,0.08250817,-0.050992668,-0.021190068,-0.029931786,-0.07632461,-0.0037177117,0.09732955,0.094995126,0.021421803,0.007593201,-0.09389226,0.034594804,0.0985221,0.0043066335,-0.027448898,0.014889547,-0.058923237,0.09520059,0.015948713,5.920797E-4,-0.0056499103,-0.060081933,0.0052920263,-0.020384425,0.02252893,0.08039028,-0.07409947,0.05369172,0.020338291,0.025135053,0.0041709505,-0.03829591,-0.0011044116,0.034841824,-0.084271595,-0.11262237,0.063225955,-0.03565806,-0.0068241237,8.4878795E-4,-0.051593456,-0.012199244,-0.009742204,-0.0640391,-0.022136044,0.052556727,0.05279448,0.028813334,0.012439653,-0.0012585603,-0.0031286879,-0.03656572,-0.014969503,-0.0022220444,0.031818192,0.015094165,0.04532757,-0.06786725,-0.0058973855,0.0365077,0.032189827,0.10910628,0.008475217,0.06227052,0.060611352,-0.053967338,-0.027137937,0.059815407,-0.044131394,0.01429386,-0.015007034,-0.0026319432,-0.015473988,-0.0033816462,-0.049905233,-0.10433294,0.04540409,0.006372859,-0.026148183,-0.009878331,-0.0055563403,-0.0042419964,-0.0729007,-0.12604317,0.04449035,0.077789195,0.037963863,0.051337175,-0.015148628,-0.015641812,-0.04605367,0.04812865,-0.028565487,0.04289392,0.022542413,-0.014278832,0.084861524,-0.009193391,-0.07802019,-0.0732625,-0.062056217,0.008513912,-0.0051593552,0.04084515,-0.032747407,0.034784902,-0.023897745,-0.06925089,0.031695057,-0.045468338,0.093886316,0.10043493,0.12943077,-0.104139104,0.04539651,0.010734148,0.050267156,-0.022818018,-0.04900761,3.367521E-33,0.021694606,0.046345923,-0.11245579,0.083630234,0.07559759,0.017059948,-0.017236501,0.049918126,-0.016842535,0.037729442,0.04653326,0.080708236,0.036807686,-0.038106587,-0.040038798,-0.007187578,0.012689809,0.085201666,0.021367772,-0.0198071,0.03231984,0.017983068,-0.04310661,0.0028713075,0.054008026,0.034491867,-0.027502155,0.060482036,-0.136318