c({id:"i18n:8",text:"Runtime-override keys follow the defining class. Locale rows and the Translation Console key a message by the class that declares it \u2014 Order.STATUSCHANGED in the example above, never ExpressOrder.STATUSCHANGED. Keep this in mind when moving a message up to a base class: any existing Locale rows keyed to the old subclass path stop matching and must be re-keyed (advanced guide).",sourceId:"i18n",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.026192864,-0.014568963,0.07510382,-0.041732214,-0.08134395,0.017551085,-0.020811621,-0.016447935,9.085546E-4,0.086309284,0.024585202,0.079589374,-0.033230163,-0.031537358,-0.03481445,0.025968544,0.023410441,-0.01867673,-0.07779056,0.032885633,0.061269835,0.04879469,0.024225356,0.08718158,-0.0052500363,0.013533938,0.008389846,0.061567836,0.020244472,-0.01168379,-0.09737986,0.06454455,0.013984087,0.073712006,-0.036095154,0.074443996,0.05995018,-0.073768966,0.048991412,0.038610034,0.017856767,-4.5789775E-4,0.05216067,-0.07188951,0.018983684,-0.003220512,0.025173014,-0.005922826,-0.068178885,0.026272342,0.007180982,0.025231307,-0.070127554,-0.018681549,0.010973931,0.072729066,0.09649717,0.057364028,0.016702918,0.0021341548,-0.042227298,0.07526952,-0.031042486,6.597993E-4,-0.079561725,0.008030035,-2.2205274E-4,-0.026766745,-0.023159212,0.04825502,0.01519512,-0.043977894,0.05012401,0.046511438,-0.08864101,0.008491177,-0.03550274,-7.823374E-4,-0.026551282,-0.060350172,-0.059204694,-0.040454455,0.04176229,0.017006151,0.10704198,-0.047649495,-0.06018832,-0.06887478,0.0562911,0.053475384,-0.058284935,-0.12103089,0.083247,0.051516995,0.016349394,0.01010803,0.015709437,0.042860776,-0.019003944,0.062213346,-0.08127047,0.05237963,-0.046946038,0.036810815,0.053768266,-0.043395232,-0.010409096,-0.07401929,-0.056510765,-0.04723863,0.031675987,-0.003726809,0.036092263,-0.041205972,-0.11192413,0.024183588,0.05092858,0.010403316,-0.0611015,-0.1170686,-0.050640557,-0.074557014,-0.020638704,0.014212556,-0.0855