c({id:"i18n:9",text:"Porting Hardcoded Strings\nStep 1: Identify Hardcoded Strings\n\nLook for string literals in:\n- Property labels\n- Validation error messages\n- UI text in views\n- Choice options\n\nStep 2: Define Messages\n\nAdd messages to your model for each hardcoded string:\n\njavascript\n// Before\nproperties: [\n  {\n    name: 'enabled',\n    tableCellFormatter: function(value, obj) {\n      this.add(value ? 'Y' : 'N');\n    }\n  }\n]\n\n// After\nmessages: [\n  { name: 'ENABLEDYES', message: 'Y' },\n  { name: 'ENABLEDNO', message: 'N' }\n],\nproperties: [\n  {\n    name: 'enabled',\n    tableCellFormatter: function(value, obj) {\n      this.add(value ? obj.ENABLEDYES : obj.ENABLEDNO);\n    }\n  }\n]\n\n\nReal example from Script.js.\n\nStep 3: Use in Views and Methods\n\nReplace string literals with message references:\n\njavascript\n// Before\nchoices: [\n  [4, 'Low'],\n  [5, 'Medium'],\n  [6, 'High']\n]\n\n// After\nmessages: [\n  { name: 'PRIORITYLOW', message: 'Low' },\n  { name: 'PRIORITYMEDIUM', message: 'Medium' },\n  { name: 'PRIORITYHIGH', message: 'High' }\n],\n// In property view\nview: function(, X) {\n  return {\n    class: 'foam.u2.view.ChoiceView',\n    choices: [\n      [4, X.data.PRIORITYLOW],\n      [5, X.data.PRIORITYMEDIUM],\n      [6, X.data.PRIORITY_HIGH]\n    ]\n  };\n}",sourceId:"i18n",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.0030778823,-0.0031774843,0.045108605,0.10675054,0.015433304,0.07699875,0.04842165,-0.017142901,0.016601259,-0.06688049,0.022349384,-0.07894538,-0.05348655,0.049659032,0.0025131279,0.08829231,0.013741086,-0.08678678,-0.08967185,0.006087736,0.037312534,0.018868294,0.010207523,-0.015055566,0.044313125,0.10742217,0.029690275,0.0041676485,-0.024070973,-0.030448722,-0.038442455,-0.01353716,0.041466348,0.03267259,-0.05388481,-0.045805994,0.0010652201,-0.024881627,0.08288462,0.036533725,-0.04028422,-0.030837636,-0.038800023,-0.085787185,0.03051135,-0.010838872,-0.017177012,-0.05877001,-0.00228