c({id:"i18n:10",text:"Table Cell Formatter Translation\nA function-form tableCellFormatter runs with this bound to the cell element, not the model: FOAM calls it as f.call(cellElement, value, obj, axiom) (foam3/src/foam/u2/view/FnFormatter.js:18-20). Every element imports translationService? (foam3/src/foam/u2/Element2.js:473), so a formatter can translate through the element itself, and a model-level imports: ['translationService?'] added for the formatter's sake is dead code.\n\nA custom formatter replaces the default view, so it must translate what the default view would have translated, for example a unit label:\n\njavascript\ntableCellFormatter: function(value, obj, axiom) {\n  this.add(value, ' ').translate('foam.units.' + axiom.units, axiom.units);\n}\n\n\ntranslate(source, opt_default) looks the key up and adds the text, falling back to the default (foam3/src/foam/u2/Element2.js:1301-1320). Always pass the default text when calling getTranslation directly: its third argument is what the Translation Console records as the source string, and a lookup with no default is not recorded at all (foam3/src/foam/i18n/TranslationConsole.js:571-572).",sourceId:"i18n",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.054053966,-0.03442997,-0.06830815,-0.021606335,-0.008421089,0.032848485,-0.028710298,0.01934656,0.115174204,-0.043947525,0.011035144,-0.11348195,-0.056267984,2.8410033E-4,0.01990713,-0.04265121,0.0070505682,0.0079326825,-0.045119364,0.030914303,0.06701503,0.016176369,0.06357241,-0.026785988,0.07602847,0.02420219,0.016743116,-0.04786071,0.0017655244,-0.028195353,-0.06431569,0.06854987,-0.051018067,0.04149676,0.0056727114,0.027830506,0.0020632097,-0.024960391,0.044944387,0.07196367,-0.020701226,-0.00971128,-0.01223976,-0.079660356,0.013690262,0.035955757,0.018727778,-0.05162406,-0.015218899,0.036555424,-0.058181826,0.044006206,0.0015555146,-0.02220348,0.04553816,0.049119707,0.014823405,-0.013997951,0.097034164,0.047942985,-0.124863446,0.04773998,