c({id:"i18n:11",text:"Property Label Formatter Gotcha\nPropertyBorder calls prop.labelFormatter on the label element and passes the rendered object as the first argument. That means this is the label Element, while data is the object whose property is being rendered.\n\nCorrect:\n\njavascript\nlabelFormatter: function(data) {\n  this.add(data.PASSWORDMESSAGE);\n}\n\n\nIncorrect:\n\njavascript\nlabelFormatter: function(data) {\n  this.add(this.PASSWORDMESSAGE);\n}\n\n\nUse this.add(...) because this is the element receiving the label text. Read messages and object state from data.",sourceId:"i18n",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.012595608,0.03844564,-0.012250826,0.06243245,-0.028022876,0.07442037,0.09333029,-0.008453515,0.072518565,-0.0731572,0.03870901,-0.037533544,-0.029499246,0.0025793817,0.10285155,0.060267992,0.048800748,-0.079765625,0.0065296786,-0.01942736,0.05215072,-0.014686274,0.073354654,0.030936176,0.026016725,0.082771294,-0.0047963206,-0.026075738,0.055036627,-0.013340567,0.0015074824,-0.056825414,-0.018268421,0.020819198,-0.07213066,-0.048656654,0.01124492,0.104461335,0.005594273,0.06153651,0.058295485,-0.032630835,-0.049544785,-0.04394549,-0.006404735,0.02822102,0.02287032,-0.056767024,-0.019796606,0.045975313,0.03478109,0.0110450545,0.026256924,0.008226318,-0.02945825,0.068354025,0.04535476,0.036831837,0.07021337,0.07160693,-0.04551005,0.020678332,0.023803936,0.025168983,0.07776092,-0.007547556,0.016178843,-0.04852015,-0.11818785,-0.02766371,0.049864143,0.04524555,0.09469104,-0.0029047292,-0.0083091045,0.007078325,-0.03454664,0.023924788,0.12066761,0.029420987,-0.010814834,-0.018139075,-0.028700624,0.04087705,0.010157888,0.07745076,-0.0039123893,-0.042729132,-0.034303647,0.0019198451,-0.0057798973,-0.064699456,-0.039481096,0.10656611,-0.109993555,0.01705671,-0.05323516,0.015845397,-0.023138596,-0.042766064,0.009699503,0.017848635,-0.011012733,-0.06759217,0.009044064,-0.061975926,-0.0320833,-0.029376412,-0.013153114,0.04