c({id:"i18n-advanced:8",text:"Choosing the Right Pattern\n| The string is\u2026 | Use | Editable at runtime? |\n|---|---|---|\n| declared on your own model or view | message: '...' in the base language, plus a Locale row per shipped locale keyed <class id>.<NAME> \u2014 the translation service sends the client only the viewer's locale | Yes |\n| needed on the client before any round trip (a boot-time label, a login-page error) | messageMap: { en, fr } or an inline label: { en, fr } map. Every inline language ships in the client JS for every user, so keep this set small | Default is code; a Locale row still overrides it |\n| framework-driven, looked up by a source key \u2014 menu label, DAO browse/create title, class action label/tooltip | a Locale row in localeDAO keyed by that source key | Yes |",sourceId:"i18n-advanced",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.077561446,-0.0042583216,-0.016564082,-0.012026284,-0.027266504,0.058051378,0.077203564,0.033157624,0.028488021,-0.029218612,-0.03374285,-5.7197636E-4,-0.040610794,0.066245064,0.053503923,0.006330578,0.06488592,0.03210318,0.031072076,-0.020821985,0.056579314,-0.04019418,0.05357574,0.07053395,0.060123708,0.0025252106,0.04784611,-0.01616766,0.019684108,0.016895514,-0.044446878,0.09454982,-0.025870807,0.0063407654,-0.04114677,0.05227993,0.0058395616,-0.044805836,0.0015569617,0.0031883377,-0.035074666,-0.022000058,0.03108058,0.009645203,0.04853139,-0.056520846,0.0065262155,0.037803095,-0.060826413,0.0626445,-0.0400402,-0.059097316,-0.042572893,-0.016162818,-0.0054471088,-0.019841926,-0.026945239,0.022795906,0.0059749046,0.07817377,-0.08566147,0.039625507,0.029183019,0.094140455,0.0059558405,0.071325585,-0.005201912,0.0066588903,-0.06361722,-0.008668361,-0.039283883,-0.022841625,0.040020134,0.04127296,-0.0826002,-0.056018263,-0.014929988,0.03304848,0.0067489715,-0.031634048,0.028305281,0.057545792,0.025436182,0.043655343,0.063352376,0.050896008,0.04856679,-0.062060796,0.100358054,0.07117685,