c({id:"intro-to-flow:2",text:"Features\nA quick rundown of the features in FLOW\n\n- &lt;i&gt;italics&lt;/i&gt;\n- &lt;b&gt;bold&lt;/b&gt;\n- &lt;p&gt;Paragraph tags&lt;/p&gt;\n- HTML entities: &amp;amp; -> &amp;\n- ### Headers\n- Various lists, including: \n\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    Links!\n  </li>\n  <li>\n  Embedded FOAM tags &lt;foam class=\"com.google.foam.demos.bubbles.Bubbles\"/&gt;\n\n  <foam class=\"com.google.foam.demos.bubbles.Bubbles\"></foam>\n  </li>\n  <li>Code tags:\n  \n\n/\n  @license\n  Copyright 2018 The FOAM Authors. All Rights Reserved.\n  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0\n /\n\nfoam.CLASS({\n  package: 'foam.core.demo.relationship',\n  name: 'Student',\n  ids: [ 'studentId' ],\n  properties: [\n    {\n      class: 'String',\n      name: 'name'\n    },\n    {\n      class: 'Long',\n      name: 'studentId'\n    }\n  ]\n});\n\nfoam.RELATIONSHIP({\n  sourceModel: 'foam.core.demo.relationship.Student',\n  targetModel: 'foam.core.demo.relationship.Course',\n  cardinality: ':',\n  forwardName: 'courses',\n  inverseName: 'students'\n});\n\n\n</li>\n<li>Image support:\n\n<img src=\"/src/foam/core/controller/foam_red.png\"/></li>\n</ul>\n\n</section>\n\n<section name=\"todo\">",sourceId:"intro-to-flow",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[-0.044427846,0.053170707,0.039141845,0.030239582,0.12176162,0.038369652,-0.006318452,-0.08082664,0.033186693,-0.05476256,-0.01314319,-0.03904098,0.021179277,0.041861445,0.06961488,0.112460494,-0.07994468,-0.0022786094,-0.0263983,-0.051132657,0.014972205,-0.006964097,0.030840492,0.0052029807,-0.04128694,0.1059145,0.044703163,-0.058158275,-0.037350595,-0.06978965,0.023274116,-0.017395543,0.032441605,0.003478984,-0.018716386,0.015914068,-0.024714913,0.04339866,-0.012759854,0.019356957,-0.016101005,-0.03622624,0.07233475,-0.09069348,0.051879782,0.0097232945,-0.049720738,-0.029997133,0.04751925,0.048725512,-0.06568532,-0.13916136,-0.058647458,-0.0041873446,0.021924164,0.066970676,-0.03394965,-