c({id:"manual:AScript:3",text:"The basics\nWriting a formula\n\nJust type the expression. Unlike Excel, you do not start with an = sign.\n\n\nfee + tax + shipping\n\n\nUsing field values\n\nRefer to a field by its name. To reach a field inside a joined or nested record, use a dot:\n\n\namount\naddress.city\ncountry_name\n\n\nField names come from your model. If you're not sure of a name, start typing and the editor will offer matches.\n\nValues you can type\n\n| Kind | How to write it | Example |\n|------|-----------------|---------|\n| Number | just type it | 42, 3.14, -5 |\n| Text | inside double quotes | \"Settled\", \"USD\" |\n| Yes / no | true or false | true |\n\nText must be in double quotes. \"USD\" is the text USD; USD without quotes means the field called USD.\n\n---",sourceId:"manual:AScript",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[0.039466765,0.05923554,-0.006710377,0.0631429,-0.03506423,0.031980645,-0.015537743,0.07704125,-0.0033674738,0.0033917245,0.028912472,-0.14989157,-0.009542282,0.011082865,0.0044062645,0.04433467,-0.031892903,0.023479873,-0.024539413,0.033164337,0.09205921,0.036947522,-0.05395046,0.019171014,0.07890367,0.040798217,0.08481333,0.0456792,-0.03213858,0.025282823,-0.12719391,0.0012567487,0.034087714,0.023539621,0.03663996,-0.07748019,-0.037900746,0.05118279,0.03187226,0.028609416,0.011326897,-0.13407588,0.09819667,-0.018965978,0.013315099,-0.015075454,0.023754088,0.14453453,0.10301497,0.10042866,-0.007218224,0.0581045,-0.010097669,-0.015403317,0.031545628,-0.0036069236,-0.02148521,-0.01645052,-0.07549121,-0.0843365,-0.023138002,0.023546956,0.014183262,-0.009770268,0.0069896723,-0.019366106,-0.11536799,0.03171642,-0.12911457,0.021150962,0.043071285,-0.036516767,-0.04839267,-0.0599256,-0.049858738,8.054293E-4,8.940701E-4,0.032240916,0.054176122,0.05339899,-0.060022768,0.014757421,-0.08240125,-0.005878844,0.014573498,-0.065567926,0.094874695,0.03621356,0.049574155,-0.032746937,0.06638102,0.01112105,0.06560105,-0.0031