c({id:"manual:AScript:8",text:"Watch out \u2014 three ways to say \"year\": YEAR(born) is a number (2024) for maths. YEARS(born) is an age (34), the years elapsed. YYYYMM(opened) and its family are text (\"2024/03\") \u2014 use these to group rows into buckets (per month, quarter, week\u2026), not to calculate with. Same idea for HOUR (number) vs HHMM (text).\n\nChecking a value\n\n| Function | True when\u2026 |\n|----------|-----------|\n| ISBLANK(x) | the value is empty |\n| ISNUMBER(x) | the value is a number |\n| ISTEXT(x) | the value is text |\n\n---",sourceId:"manual:AScript",kind:"flow",embeddingModel:"Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2",vector:[0.052883744,0.110578,-0.0015782908,-0.0032828941,-0.0058252066,0.060556512,-0.014187568,0.01613315,-0.008471366,-0.017101983,0.03567054,-0.12104257,0.016819082,-0.046093095,-0.024388144,0.0037307895,-0.07223793,-0.032356266,0.03797717,-0.1653296,0.010027691,-0.03959417,-0.034853972,0.028250352,0.08677189,0.07738207,-0.04336067,0.011522438,0.04959291,0.078474365,-0.041384716,0.091145046,0.058708485,-0.023874909,-0.033098098,0.0066326912,-0.027357958,0.0595052,0.00583748,0.015705852,-0.030647805,-0.13537495,0.03566426,-1.6151651E-5,0.009894024,0.023436531,-0.012442564,0.03472762,0.008379508,0.1713414,-0.0473389,0.07259447,-0.031518735,0.040428907,0.05382763,0.033976983,-0.05081414,-0.062342554,0.0033794711,-0.063153975,-0.09473855,-0.050747443,0.037861913,-0.056813914,0.01198562,0.0070969686,-4.5550294E-4,0.024980694,-0.021296944,0.07049326,0.052604634,0.031189525,-0.052202847,0.08280272,-0.039258014,0.02660564,0.041569673,0.0026051498,0.08628538,-0.02431601,-0.059533305,0.012147209,0.005186408,-0.0032795193,0.012226484,0.00940476,0.014463128,0.074201696,-0.031176757,-0.011835924,0.002002751,0.03324339,0.05321959,-0.006297457,-0.005292085,0.019614091,0.006429725,0.054996718,0.072995126,0.055416316,-0.104218006,0.02145676,-0.060391612,-0.019489931,-0.067075185,-0.007648576,0.035924446,0.011644227,0.015110828,-0.01965742,0.020891221